<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zab</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="mt">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zabuli nachikungajiza mbuli mbili, ziwele ndo nzimbo na kulanda. Kwa ndonga ya Chiebulaniya, ulonzi zabuli una mana ya “lwimbo lwa kutogola.” Kukomya, zabuli nyinji ndo nzimbo ziwele mgati mwake Nguluwi kangutogoligwa, ila hana zabuli zilivinji kahi. Zimwenga ndo za kulanda utanzi wa Nguluwi kuno zinji ziwele na kulombocheza na kumema ulonzi uwele na masinzo makulu. Hana nzimbo za kutogola zilingumtogola mndewa wa Isilaeli na hana nzimbo ziwele nazali zitumika kuwalangusa wanhu vyoyalingugana Nguluwi na luhala lwa heye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zabuli nachandichigwa na wanhu wamwenga na kukungajizwa kwa mhela wa miyaka mamiya menji. Zabuli za katali ng'hatu ndo zila ziwele nazandichigwa kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa mndewa Daudi. Ndo mbuli ya kukundigwa kota zabuli nyinji nazandichigwa na mndewa Daudi yuye. Zabuli nyinji nazandichigwa mhela wanhu lowahiluche kaye kwa hewo, kulawa kuli mhela wa kuganigwa kikala kuli isi ya chijenzi kwa lupichi, ako Babuloni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wasomile wawele wanguzizela ng'hatu mbuli za Bibiliya, wangukunda kota zabuli nazikungajizwa na kuwa kota vyozilingoneka sambi, kuli mhela wa kaline ya kadatu ama ya kane, Yesu loyawele yang'hali kupondigwa. Koneka aku kwa kuduma nakumema zabuli miya imwe na makumi gahano ziwele nazigawanulwa kuli vitabu vidodo vihano.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wone zabuli ndo nzimbo ama kulanda, zabuli zeng'ha nazandichigwa ziwele kuli koneka kwa ushaili. Wone munhu yavizele hado kuwala ushaili wa Chiebulaniya, yomtanza kuvizela Zabuli. Mbuli imwe ya ushaili wa Chiebulaniya mgati mwa Zabuli, yanguchemigwa misitali jiwele na mana ilingiwhana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Walingwandika mhela winji nawali wolumbiza hamwe mana za misitali mili. Msitali wa mwaluko naulavya ulonzi. Hamba msitali wa keli wahawezile kuhiluchila majesa gagala ga mwaluko kwa ulonzi ulivinji. Msitali wa keli kahi wahawezile kuwa na majesa galingitwanza na gala gawele kuli msitali wa mwaluko ama hanji nautang'hula majesa ga msitali wa mwaluko kwa konjeza ulonzi uyage.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zabuli ndo chitabu chimwe hali vitabu vya Bibiliya, chilinguzeleka lukami na wanhu wanguchisangalalila ng'hatu. Zabuli nyinji nazali zitumika kuli koneka kwa kufugamila mgati mwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi iwele Yelusalemu. Zabuli zangulangusa kulanda na kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi yawele mchanya mwa vinhu vyeng'ha. Zabuli ya makumi meli na gadatu naiwakangaza nhumbula wanhu wenji wawele nawali wamemile masinzo na usungu. Zabuli ya makumi gahano na imwe nayambuza wanhu kulonga gehile ga hewo hali Nguluwi. Zabuli ya miya imwe na kumi yangigala kikangaza nhumbula na kitumbila kwa kumuwikula Maseya yalinguya, yawele kowa ndo mndewa na mtambika.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Chitabu cha mwaluko cha Zabuli ndo sula ya 1-41.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Chitabu cha keli cha Zabuli ndo sula ya 42-72.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Chitabu cha kadatu cha Zabuli ndo sula ya 73-89.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Chitabu cha kane cha Zabuli ndo sula ya 90-106.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Chitabu cha kahano cha Zabuli ndo sula ya 107-150.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cha Mwaluko</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 1:-1-41">Zabuli 1-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzila mbili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Nakatambichizwa yula munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">yohambe yalute kuli chitala cha wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">halinguwinza nzila za wawele na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">ne kikalisa hamwe na walinguliga.<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>Ila kangunojezwa na ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">kangijesaga ilajizo lya heye nemisi na nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>Naye kanguwa kota igodi litopekwe hafungo ha nzanda za mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">lilingulela mafuza gake kwa mihela jake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">ne ihamba lyake halilinguswinha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Chila choyalingudita changulutilila goya.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Haiwele kota vyowawele wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">hewo ndo kota mhumba ilinguwembeluka kwa mbeho.<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Lelo wehile hambe weme nzinzili kuli utaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">ne wawele na gehile hali nhing'hano ya watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguizela nzila ya watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">ila nzila ya wehile yokwajilila.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mndewa yahaguligwe na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Lekachoni wanhu wa isi wangubelenhuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">Lekachoni wanhu wangiwika goya kwa uviso kwa mbuli za hihi hela?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Wandewa wa isi wangiwika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">na wakulu wangikungajiza hamwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">kwa chiwalo cha kihanza majesa ga kumlema Mkulu Nguluwi na yabakalizwe mafuta wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>Wandewa awo wangulonga, “Tiwuse kuli ulongozi wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">tutoze kutali minyololo ja hewo.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Yula yalingulongoza kilanga kanguwaseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">Nguluwi kanguwabeza.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>Hamba kanguwang'hanuchila kwa ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">na kuwadumbiza kwa kuzudila kwa heye, yolonga,<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>“Nani nandimuwika mndewa wa heni, mchanya mwa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">chidunda cha heni chelile.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Ndowikula mzilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">“Hegwe ndo mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">heni lehano nandiwa mhaza wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>Undande, nani ndokupa wanhu wa isi wawe uhalizi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">na mbaka ja isi jowa ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>Kowatowa kwa ng'hweku ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">na kuwabena kota chijilo.”<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Lelo hemwe wandewa, muwe na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">hemwe wakulu wa isi, mwangukanyigwa.<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>Mumkolele mijito Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kudumba na kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>Mumfugamile na kukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">leka yaleche kuzudila na kuwadumya baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">kwa vila heye kanguzudilaga himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Wangutambichizwa weng'ha walingubilimila kikala goya kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi loyambilime Abusalomu, mwanage.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, wang'honyo wa heni nawonjezeka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:1">Walingunhowa ndo wenji.<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Ndo wenji walingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">“Nguluwi homlohola.”<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>Ila hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa ngawo ya heni banzi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">kwa hegwe ndanguwa na lutogo na kusumya.<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Kwa lizi lya heni ndangumchema Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">naye kangwidichila kulawa kuli chidunda cha heye chelile.<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Ndanguwasa na kuwa na usinjizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">ndangwinuka kahi kwa vila hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwangunyimiza.<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>Hambe ndumbe wanhu elufu na maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">hanga wangunhowa banzi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi winuche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Nguluwi wa heni undohole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Uwatowe wang'honyo wa heni weng'ha kwa mizeje ja milomo ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">ubene mizino ja wehile.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Kwa vila ulohozi ndo wa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">Utambichizo wa hegwe uwe mchanya mwa wanhu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yula yalingwaluchiza kwimba na vinhu vya ng'weso za muziki. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi wa heni ulingundewela, ndangulanda unyidichile hondilanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Lombele kuli kugaya, hegwe nakunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">umbonele isungu na kuhulichiza kulanda kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>Mwela yoo, mowifya ukulu wa heni kwa soni mbaka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Ndaze, mogana upoka na uhadi mbaka nili?<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Ila mvizele kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakehagulila munhu wa heye yalingumhulichiza mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguhulichizaga hondimchema.<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>Mdumbe na mleche kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">mijese ng'hatu kuli vinhanda vya hemwe na minyamalile.<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Mlavye nhambiko za hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">na kitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>Wanhu wenji wangulongaga, “Whaani yalinguweza kutulajila ganojile?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, utulole kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Ila nakumha heni kusangalala kukulu mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">kusinda hewo wawele na divai na nyhule kwa winji.<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Ndanguwasaga na kuwa na usinjizi kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">kwa vila gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe uliyeka kwangumbika honhu hanojile.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuli mhela wihile</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yula yalingwaluchiza kwimba na kwa mluli. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uhulichize ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">ulole kung'ung'uta kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Uhulichize kulila kwa heni leka unhanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">gwa Mndewa wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">kwa vila hegwe ndo ndilingukulanda.<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hamitondo kwanguhulika lizi lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">hamitondo ndangukuwichila goya kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">hamba ndangubeteza unyidichile.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Kwa vila hegwe hauwele Nguluwi ulingunojezwa na wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">wihe hauweza kikala na hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Walingidaya hambe weme hali hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">hegwe kwanguwazudila weng'ha walingudita wihe.<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Hegwe kwanguwadumya weng'ha walingulonga udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwanguwazudila walingukopola na wahadi.<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>Ila, kwa winji wa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe, ndokwinjila mng'handa mwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">Ndofugama kwa kuhulichiza kuli ng'handa ya hegwe yelile.<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undongoze kuli kutanganika kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">kwa chiwalo cha wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">ugolose nzila ya hegwe hali heni.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Kwa vila kuli milomo ja hewo kwahela kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mnhumbula za hewo nakumema kudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">milomo ja hewo ndo kota chilaga chiwele mwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">myango za hewo nazimema wihe.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uwagaze kwa wihe wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">wagwe kwa mbuli zihile za hewo wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">Uwawinje kwa chiwalo cha winji wa gehile ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">kwa vila nawakubelenhuka hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>ila weng'ha walingubilimila kikala goya kwa hegwe wasangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">wembe kwa kusangalala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Uwemile walinguligana itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">leka wasangalale kwa chiwalo cha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Kwa vila hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi kwanguwatambichiza wala watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">kwanguwamila kwa kunoga kwa hegwe kota ngawo.<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda mhela wa magazo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yula yalingwaluchiza kwimba na vinhu vya ng'weso za muziki. Kwimba kwa Sheminiti. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kung'hanuchila kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">uleche kungaza kwa kuzudila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Umbonele isungu, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndahela mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, umhe heni mong'ho, ndangutoka mbaka kuli mizeje ja heni.<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Muhe wa heni wangugazika ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kobeteza mbaka nili?<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unyhinduchile na kundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">undohole kwa chiwalo cha igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Kwa vila haduhu yalingukukumbuchila kula kowawele wabagame</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">whaani yoweza kukutogola ako kuli isi ya wabagame?<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Nhoka kwa chililo cha usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">chila nechilo ndanguchidoza chinhanda cha heni kwa mahozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">kwa mahozi ndangudoza chegamo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>Meho ga heni nagatoka kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">nagabilabila kwa chiwalo cha kugazigwa na mng'honyo.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Muche kwa heni hemwe mweng'ha mlingudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakahulika lizi lya chililo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakahulika chililo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">Mkulu Nguluwi nakakunda kulanda kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Wang'honyo wa heni weng'ha wobasigwa soni na kudumbizwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">baho du, wohiluka kumbele na wobasigwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa kugana kutanzigwa kwa chiwalo cha walinguwabunza wayawo</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:0 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lwimbo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ulonzi awu ndo Shiggaion. Wasomile hawalinguvizela una mana yachi, hanji ndo kulombocheza.</char></note> lwa Daudi kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kuwala Kushi, Mbenjamini.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, ndangubilimila kikala goya kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">undohole kulawa kwa weng'ha walingumbilimisa.<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Wone uleche, wokuya kundadula heni kota isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">wombulunha heni mbaka kutali, kowa kuduhu wa kundohola.<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">wone nandita mbuli imwe hali azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">wone ndina nongwa kuli madito ga heni,<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>wone nandimhilusila goloko wa heni wihe honhu ha ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">ama nandimsukula mng'honyo wa heni ne chiwalo,<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>lelo, mng'honyo yambinze na kimbata heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">yabije ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na kuuwika ukulu wa heni kuli nhimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>Winuche gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">ukulemeze kuzudila kwa wang'honyo wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">Winuche, gwa Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">hegwe nakulajiza hachi iditigwe.<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Uwakungajize wanhu wa isi hafungo ha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">nagwe uwalongoze kulawa kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwanguwatagusa wanhu wa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">Umhe heni hachi kwa kiwhana na kutanganika kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">kwa kiwhana na kugoloka kwa nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Uudumye wihe wa wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">uwemize nzinzili wanhu watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">gwa Nguluwi uwele na hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">ulinguuzela uviso wa nhumbula na majesa ga wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Nguluwi ndo ngawo ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">heye kanguwalohola wawele wagoloche nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>Nguluwi ndo mtagusa wa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">yalinguugaza wihe chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>Wanhu wohambe wamgaluchile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">Nguluwi konola ipanga lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">kowika goya upinde wa heye na kuugololela honhu.<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>Kowika goya vinhu vya heye vya kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">kowika misale ja heye kuli chiluli.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Ulole, mwihe kangijesaga wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">kangiwikaga goya kuwifya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">na kangwambuzaga uhadi.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Kangubawaga isimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">hamba kangugwilaga amo.<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>Kuwifya kwa heye komhiluchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">kuwifya komgwila heye yuye.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Ndolonga malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha hachi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">ndokwimba lutogo lwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi yawele kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Nguluwi na ukulu wa munhu</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Gititi. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Mkulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">ndikomya itagwa lyako lyangutogoligwa kuli isi yeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 8:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Nakuuwika ukulu wa hegwe ako mchanya mwa ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Kwa kutogoligwa na wana wadodo na walingong'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">nakiwichila ngome ya kiyamila kwa chiwalo cha wang'honyo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">uwadumye walingukubelenhuka na yalinguhilusa chibida.<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>Hondilola ulanga, mijito ja vidole vya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">nyelezi na nhondwe, vyouviwichile ako,<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>munhu ka whaani, mbaka umjese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">munhu ndo choni mbaka umlolele?<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Nakumdita yawe mdodo kusinda Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">nakumha itaji lya ukulu na kuhulichizwa.<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>Nakumdita heye yawe chilongozi kuli mijito ja hegwe jeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">nakuviwika vilumbigwe vyeng'ha hali ludali lwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>Ming'holo na misenga na migongolo ja kisolo,<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>videje na somba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">ena chila chilingojelela kuli nzila za bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">vyeng'ha nakuviwika kuli ludali lwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Mkulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">ndikomya itagwa lya hegwe lyangutogoligwa kuli isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s">Kulonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Muti-labeni. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Ndolonga malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:1">ndogasimila madito ga hegwe ga kububuwaza.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>Ndosangalala na kutowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">ndolimbila lutogo itagwa lya hegwe, gwa Nguluwi Uwele Kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>Mhela naloulawile, wang'honyo wa heni nawahiluka kumbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">nawekwang'wala na kudumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Nakuilewela hachi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kulawa kuli chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">nakulavya utaguso uwele wa hachi.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Nakuwang'hanuchila wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">nakuwadumya wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">matagwa ga hewo nakugosa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Wang'honyo nawadumigwa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">nakuwifya miji ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">mbaka kukumbuchilwa kwa hewo nakwajilila.<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongoza mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">nakawika chigoda cha heye cha undewa leka yataguse.<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>Kanguitagusa isi kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">kangwamula kwa kutanganika hali wanhu wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ngome kwa walingubunzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">heye ndo honhu ha kikala goya mihela ja magazo.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Walingukuzela, gwa Nguluwi wangitumbila kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">kwa vila hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi huwalechile walingukupala.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi yalingulongoza ako Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">Mugawikule kwa wanhu madito goyaditile.<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>Nguluwi kanguhilulaga chibida kwa kuboholigwa kwa danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">halingusemwa hebu chililo cha walingubunzwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Uwe na isungu kwa heni, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">Ulole magazo gawele nagafika kwa heni, kulawa kwa walingunzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">hegwe nakunyasula lombele habehi kubagama,<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>leka sime lutogo lwa hegwe hali wanhu wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">leka sangalale kwa vila nakundohola.<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>Wanhu wa isi nawenjila kuli ikulubila lyowabawile wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">nawagwilizwa magulu kuli utandawala wowauvisile.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakelajila vyoyawele kwa kukolela utaguso wa heye wa hachi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">Wanhu wehile nawagwilizwa kwa madito ga hewo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Wehile wohiluka kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">ena, wanhu wa isi zeng'ha walingumsemwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Ila wazunwa hawosemwigwa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">kitumbila kwa walihela chinhu hakukwajilila mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">Uleche kumleka yehile yasumye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">Uwakungajize wanhu wa isi zeng'ha hali hegwe, uwataguse.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Uwakabuse, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">leka wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wavizele kota hewo ndo wanhu hela!<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa chiwalo cha hachi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, lekachoni kwangwima kutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Lekachoni kwangivisa mhela wa magazo?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Kwa kidaya wehile wanguwagaza wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">wazunwa walingugwilizwa na hewo.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>Mwihe kangitogolaga kwa maya ga nhumbula ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">kangumtambichizaga yawele na maya na kumliga Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Kuli kidaya kwa heye halingumpala Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">Kijesa kwa heye kweng'ha ndo, “Haduhu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>Nzila za mwihe zangusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">kwa heye nhaguso za hegwe za kutali na majesa ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">kanguwabezaga wang'honyo wa heye weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>Kangijesaga mnhumbula, “Siwa na lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">sifichigwa na magazo kuli ukomu wa heni.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>Kumlomo kwa heye nakumema upanjilo na uhadi na kubunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">kangulongaga ulonzi wa kuzudiza na wihe.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>Kangivisaga kuli vijiji yobeteza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">yamkopole munhu yalihela nongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">Ka meho kumpugajiza ng'hochele,<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>kangubetezaga hali honhu ha kivisa kota isimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">Kangupugajizaga leka yawebate wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">kanguwagwilizaga kuli idiwa lya heye na kuwahola.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Ng'hochele kanguhondigwa na kutozigwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">kangutozigwa kwa nhumbula yihile ya yula mwihe.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>Mwihe kangijesaga mnhumbula ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">“Nguluwi nakasemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">nakadinya kumeho kwa heye halingona chinhu.”<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwagaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">uleche kuwasemwa awo walingubunzwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Gwa Nguluwi, lekachoni mwihe kangukubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">na kulonga kota humgaza?<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Ila hegwe kwanguwonaga wawele kuli kutunywa na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">nakukunda kuwabochela mmoko mwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Ng'hochele kangitumbila kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">hegwe kwanguwaga utanzi wa walekwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Ubene mong'ho wa munhu mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">udumye wihe wa heye weng'ha, uleche koneka kahi.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mndewa mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wohawamzelele wokwajilila kuli isi ya heye.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwangubochela kulanda kwa ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">kwangumkangaza na kumhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>Kowaditila hachi walekwa na walingubunzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">leka munhu yawele ndo misanga yalemwele kigala lunhwinhwi kahi.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kitumbila kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Kwa heye Mkulu Nguluwi ndangubilimila kikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">Mwanguweza ndaze lelo kundonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">“Uguluche kota chideje mbaka kuli vidunda,<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>kwa vila wehile wangujiwika goya mipinde ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">nawawika goya misale kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">leka wawatowe wanhu wanojile.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Wone misisi ja ulongozi jowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">munhu yatanganiche kodita ndaze?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka mgati mwa Ng'handa ya heye yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">chigoda cha undewa cha Mkulu Nguluwi cha ako kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Kwa meho ga heye kanguwalolaga wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">na kuvizela chila chowalingudita.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwapimaga watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">ila kanguwazudilaga ng'hatu wehile walingugana kubunza.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>Kowadulisila wehile makala ga chiluli na maganga ga chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">mbeho ng'hulu yowa ndo magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yatanganiche na kangugana kutanganika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">Wanhu wagoloche nhumbula wochikala hamwe na heye.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwimba kwa Sheminiti. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Ututanze, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">Wanhu wanojile nawamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">wakukundigwa nawajilila hali wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Chila yumwe kangumdetelezaga myage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">wangulongaga kwa kudeta na kwa nhumbula ya udesi.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">uzidumule azo myango za uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">na ajo milomo jilingidaya lukami.<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Hewo wangulongaga, “Kwa myango za hetwe tosumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">milomo ja hetwe jina ludali, mkulu wa hetwe ndo whaani?”<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">“Kwa vila wazunwa wangubunzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">walingugana wangulila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">lelo ndanguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">nani ndowegalila kikala goya konakwali wokubeteza.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ndo welile kota zahabu yelizwe kuli itanulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ena, kota zahabu yelizwe mala saba.<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Kotwamila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">kotuwika kutali mazuwa gose na lulelo alu lwihile.<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Wehile wanguzunguluta chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">kwajilila kwangutogoligwa hali wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kosemwa heni mbaka hanili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Ndaze, kosemwa heni mbaka mazuwa gose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Mbaka hanili kokuvisa kumeho kwa hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Ndowa na lunhwinhwi na majesa mbaka hanili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">masinzo mnhumbula chila zuwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Mbaka hanili wang'honyo wa heni wosumya heni?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>Undole na kunyhidichila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Umhe heni mong'ho kahi, leka ndeche kufichigwa na usinjizi wa kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Uleche kuwadita wang'honyo wa heni walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">“Natumsumya ayu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Walingungaza waleche kusangalalila kugwa kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Ila heni ndangitumbila igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">nhumbula ya heni yangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha ulohozi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>Ndokwimbila hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">kwa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe lyoulilajile kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s">Wihe wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Wapoka wangilonjelaga mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">“Haduhuli Nguluwi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Weng'ha nawajilila lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">nawadita mbuli za kuzudiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">haduhuli ne yumwe yalingudita linojile.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwalola wanhu kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">yalole kota hana yoneche yawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">kota hana yoneche yalingumuwinza Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Ila weng'ha nawali hafungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">nawajilila hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">haduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yaditile ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">haduhuli ne yumwe.<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Ndaze, hewo weng'ha walingudita wihe wahela nyhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Wanguwabunza wanhu chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">hambe wandande heni Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Wobatigwa na kukabusa kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">kwa vila Nguluwi ka hamwe na watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Hemwe mlingudita gehile, mwangulemeza majesa ga mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">ila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo honhu ha heye ha kubilimila.<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Ndangugana ng'hatu ulohozi wa Isilaeli wahafichile kulawa Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Mkulu Nguluwi hoyowahilula goya wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">walelwa wa Yakobo wotowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Waisilaeli wosangalala.<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s">Goloko wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, whaani yoweza kikala kuli ihema lya hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Whaani yoweza kikala mchanya mwa chidunda cha hegwe chelile?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Ndo munhu yalingikala ne nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">mhela weng'ha kangudita gatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">yalingulonga ga kukomya kulawa mnhumbula,<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>ndo munhu yohambe yahehe wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">yohambe yamditile gehile myage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">ne kumvilizila munhu yowalingikalasa habehi,<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>ndo munhu yalinguwabeza walinguwabunza wayao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">ila kanguwahulichiza wala walingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">ndo munhu yohambe yagalamule chilaho cha heye hanga hamba chowifya mbuli za heye,<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>yohambe yaziche sendi ya heye kwa kugana mzidi ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">ne kubochela chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kumbunza yalihela nongwa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Munhu yalingudita ago, hotigasika.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kikala goya</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Unyamile gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">kwa vila kwa hegwe ndangubilimila kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Ndangumlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi, “Hegwe ndo Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">ndahela linojile lyoneche ila hegwe.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>Kwa mbuli za welile wawele muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">kikala na hewo ndo kusangalala kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Ila walingujifugamila milungu jinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">wowa na magazo menji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Nhambiko ya danda sijilavila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">na matagwa ga milungu ajo sigalonga hebu.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwanguhega kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">nakuzidita mbuli za heni zeng'ha ziwe goya.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Nakumha heni ndolendole zinojile ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">ena, uhalizi wa heni unoga.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>Ndangumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kundongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">mbaka mhela wa nechilo nhumbula ya heni yangundagusaga.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>Ndangumuwika Mkulu Nguluwi kumwando kwa heni mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">ka hamwe na heni, sitigasika.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>Lelo nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha yangusangalala na kutowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">lukuli lwa heni lokwesela kwa kikala goya ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Ena hegwe huuleka muhe wa heni kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">hambe undeche, Yelile wa hegwe, nyole mchilaga.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>Kwangundajila nzila ya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">kuwa hamwe na hegwe kwangumemeza heni usangalalo wenele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">kuli moko wa hegwe uwele na mong'ho hana usangalalo mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa munhu yanojile</para>
  <para style="d">(Kulanda kwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi uhulichize chiwalo cha heni cha hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">uhulichize chililo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">uhulichize kulanda kwa heni kulihela uhadi.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>Utaguso wa heni uye kulawa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">kwa vila hegwe kuizela mbuli iwele ya hachi.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>Hegwe kwanguizela ng'hatu nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">nakumbuyila nechilo kumhugajiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">nakumbika kuli kujezigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">Huweza kuwona wihe mgati mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">nanyamula silonga chinhu chihile.<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>Kuwala madito gowalingudita wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">heni nyhulichiza malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">nandiwika kutali na nzila za wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>Mbinza ng'hatu nzila ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">ne hado silechile hebu.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Ndangukuchema, hegwe Nguluwi, kwa vila hegwe kwangunyidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">unyhulichize goya, uhuliche ulonzi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>Ulajile kunoga kwa igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">uwalohole kulawa kwa wang'honyo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">wala walingubilimila kikala goya kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>Unyamile kota vyoulingulyamila iziho lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">uvise heni kuli lubehelo lwa mabawa ga hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>kutali na kudumigwa na wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">kutali na wang'honyo wa heni walinguzunguluta.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Awo wahela isungu lyoneche mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">wamema ulonzi wa kidadambala.<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>Wangumbinza na kunzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">wangumbeteza heni leka wangwise.<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>Wangugana kundadula kota isimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">Kota isimba lilingupelemba.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">witowe na hewo na kuwagwisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">Kwa ipanga undohole kulawa kwa wang'honyo.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Kwa moko wa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">undohole kulawa mmoko mwa wanhu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wanhu wawele ng'hano ya hewo ndo kuli isi ayi hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Uwamemeze magazo gouwawichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">leka wawenago ga kuhega na wana wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wawalechele mbaka wazukulu wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Nani kuli kutanganika ndokona kumeho kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">hondililimka ndomema kusangalala kwa kukona.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kusumya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2 Samweli 22:1-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Lwimbo lwa Daudi, chitumagwa wa Nguluwi, lwoyamwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi zuwa lila loyamlohole mmoko mwa wang'honyo wa heye na mmoko mwa Sauli.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Ndangukugana, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mong'ho wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo italawe lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">ngome ya heni na mlohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Nguluwi wa heni, italawe lya heni yondilingumbilimila kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">ngawo ya heni na mong'ho wa ulohozi wa heni na ngome ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>Nandimchema Mkulu Nguluwi, yalinguganigwa kutogoligwa yanhanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">nani nandoholigwa kulawa kwa wang'honyo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Kwa vila ng'weso za kubagama nazinzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">mazi tendema ga kudumya nagavaba heni,<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>ng'weso za kuli isi ya wabagame nazimbata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">midiwa ja kubagama najifika.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Kuli magazo ga heni nandimchema Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">nandimlilila Nguluwi wa heni yanhanze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Kulawa kuli ng'handa ya heye, nakahulika lizi lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">kulila kwa heni nakufika kuli makutu ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Aho isi naikakama na kutigasika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">na misisi ja vidunda najitigasika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">navitigasika kwa vila Nguluwi nayali yazudile.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Iyosi nalifung'ha kulawa kuli mhenyelo ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">chiluli chilingulakaza nachilawa kuli mlomo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">makala ga chiluli nagaka kulawa kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>Nakagubula ulanga nakadulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">ng'hungugu nhitu hasi ha magulu ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>Nakakwina chilumbigwe chiwele na mabawa na kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">nakaguluka himahima mchanya mwa mbeho.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>Nakegubika jiza banzi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">chigubiko cha heye nachali jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">nachali ng'hungugu ng'hulu ya kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>Lumwemwesa nalumwemwesa hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">kulawa kuli ng'hungugu nakulawila nhonya ya maganga na makala ga chiluli.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakabuma kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya nakalavya lizi lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">nhonya ya maganga na makala ga chiluli navilawila.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Nakawatozela wang'honyo misale ja heye na kuwasambalula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">nakatoza lumwemwesa, nakawawinga.<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>Kwa kung'hanuchila kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">kwa lweselo lwa mhenyelo ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">hasi ha bahali nakugubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">misisi ja isi najoneka hazelu.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Nguluwi nakagolola moko wa heye kulawa kuchanya na kundavya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">kulawa hasi ha mazi menji nakanyasula.<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Nakandohola kulawa kwa mng'honyo wa heni yawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">na kulawa kwa hewo wanzudile kwa vila nawali na mong'ho lukami kusinda heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>Nawavaba vyombele kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">ila Mkulu Nguluwi nayali kitumbila kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>Nakandavya na kunyhilika kuli kilejeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">nakandohola kwa vila nakanojezwa na heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha heni chonolo kwa kiwhana na kutanganika kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">kiwhana na welile wa moko ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>Kwa vila nandizibatilila nzila za Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">na simbelenhuche Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>Kwa vila nhaguso za heye zeng'ha nazali hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">silechile kuwinza malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>Hali heye siwele na nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">nandiwika kutali na gehile ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha heni chonolo kwa kiwhana na kutanganika kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">kwa kiwhana na welile wa moko ga heni hali heye.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe kowa wa kukundigwa kwa wawele wa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">kwa walihela nongwa, kwangilajila kwahela nongwa.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>Kwa heye yalingiyeliza kwangilajila kota ndo yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">ila kwa wajilile kwanguwaditila kota vyowalinguganigwa.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>Kwa vila kwanguwalohola walingunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">ila kwanguwadulisa walingidaya.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Kwa vila hegwe ndo ulingubwina chenje cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, kwanguwinga jiza lya heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Kwa utanzi wa hegwe ndanguwasumya wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">londiwa hamwe na Nguluwi wa heni ndoweza kuzuma lukanzi.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>Choyalingudita Nguluwi chahela nongwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">Kulagana kwa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo kwa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">heye ndo ngawo kwa weng'ha walingumbilimila.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>Whaani yawele Nguluwi, mzidi wa Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Whaani yawele italawe lya kutwamila, kota Nguluwi wa hetwe?<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Nguluwi ndo yalinguwopa heni isali liwele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">nakaidita nzila ya heni iwe inojile.<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>Nakadita magulu ga heni gawe nzinzili kota ga ibala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">na kumbika honhu hanojile mchanya mwa vinhembenhembe.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>Kangundangusa kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">leka moko ga heni gawe na mong'ho wa kukwega upinde uwele nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>Nakumha heni ngawo ya hegwe ya ulohozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">moko wa hegwe wa kudilo naunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">kunyenyetela kwa hegwe nakundita ndiwe mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>Nakundita njende kwa kilejeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">leka magulu ga heni galeche kutelela.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>Nandiwawinza wang'honyo wa heni na kuwafichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">sihiluche kumbele mbaka lowadumigwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Ndowatowanga leka walemwele kwinuka kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">wogwa hali magulu ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Hegwe nakundita ndiwe na mong'ho wa kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">nakuwadulisa wang'honyo hali heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Nakuwadita wang'honyo wa heni wabilime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">wala wanzudile nandiwadumya.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Nawatowa iyowe lya kulanda utanzi, ila hakuwele na wa kuwalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">nawamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi ila hawedichile.<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Nandiwatowa, nawali kota nhimbwisi hali mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">nandiwatoza hanze kota nhope mnzila.<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Hegwe nakundohola kulawa kuli kutowigwa na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">nakundita ndiwe chilongozi wa wanhu wa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">Wanhu wohambe ndiwazele nawang'holela mijito.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>Wajenzi nawoya na kufugama kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">lowahuliche malajizo ga heni, nawanyhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Wajenzi watweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">nawoya kulawa kuli ngome za hewo wokakama.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka mkomu! Yatambichizwe italawe lya heni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">Yatogoligwe Nguluwi wa ulohozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>Heye nakandita nyhilule chibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">na kuwadita wanhu walemwele hali ludali lwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>Nakundohola kulawa kwa wang'honyo wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">Ena, kwangunyhinula leka ndiwe mchanya ng'hatu mwa wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">na kundohola kulawa kwa wehile.<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>Ahyo, ndokutogola, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hali isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">ndolimbila lutogo itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Nguluwi kangumtambichizaga mndewa wa heye kusumya kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">kangulajilaga igano lya kwimilila kwa yabakalizwe mafuta wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">ena, kangumditilaga ahi Daudi na walelwa wa heye mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Nguluwi kuli vilumbigwe</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Kilanga kwangiwikula ukulu wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:1">ulanga wangutawiza mijito ja moko ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Chila zuwa lyanguulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">chila nechilo yanguzelesa.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Kuduhu nhelo ama ulonzi ulingulonjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">ne lizi lulinguhulikwa,<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>ila lizi lya hewo lyangulutaga kuli isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">na ulonzi wa hewo kuli kuduma kwa isi yeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Nguluwi nakaliwichila isanya honhu hake kuli ulanga,<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>nalyo lyangulawa kota mkasano yalingulawa kuli chihengo cha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">lyangusangalala kota munhu yawele na mong'ho yalingubilima kuli nzila ya heye.<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Lyangulawaga ubanzi umwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">na kuzunguluta mbaka ubanzi uyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">haduhu choweza kibagula na ivuche lyake.<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>Ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi ndo lyenela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">kangumpaga munhu ukomu unyale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">Ulolezi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nawima nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">kanguwapaga luhala walihela uwanzi.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ga hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">kangusangalazaga nhumbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">Mizilo ja Mkulu Nguluwi jahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">jangigala lumuli kuli meho.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">na wa kikala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Nhaguso za Mkulu Nguluwi ugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">zeng'ha utanganika.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Zangunojeza kusinda zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kusinda zahabu inojile ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">zinona kusinda hanombwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kusinda hanombwa ilawile kuli ilala.<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>Kwa malanguso ga hegwe, ndangukanyigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">kwa kugawinza ndangupegwa chonolo chikulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>Ila whaani yalingona nongwa za heye yuye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">Gwa Nguluwi, mbiche kutali na nongwa zohambe ndizizele.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Undemeze heni chitumagwa wa hegwe ndeche kudita gehile ga kunuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">uleche kukunda ago gandongoze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">Aho ndowa ndilihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">siwa na gehile ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>Ulonzi wa mlomo wa heni na majesa ga nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">gakundigwe hali hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">italawe lya heni na mgombozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kusumya</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yakwidichile houwa kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:1">itagwa lya Nguluwi wa Yakobo likwamile.<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Yakuhilichile utanzi kulawila mng'handa mwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">yakutanze kulawa chidunda cha Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Yazikumbuchile ndolendole za hegwe zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">yazikunde nhambiko za hegwe za kulakazwa.<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>Yakupe goulingugana mnhumbula ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">yazidite mbuli za hegwe zeng'ha zikulutile goya.<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>Totowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha kusumya kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">tokwinula bendela kulipa ukulu itagwa lya Nguluwi wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">Mkulu Nguluwi yakwenezele kulanda kwa hegwe kweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Ndanguvizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi komtanza mndewa yambakalize mafuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">komwidichila kulawa mng'handa mwa heye kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">kwa moko wa heye wa kudilo komdita yasumye ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>Wanji wangitumbila mituka ja hewo ja kitowela ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">wanji wangitumbila falasi wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">Ila hetwe twangitumbila Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Hewo wochikwang'wala na kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">ila hetwe tokwima nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Umdite mndewa yasumye, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">Utwidichile hotukulanda!<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s">Malumbo kwa kusumya</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mndewa kangutowa luchenze kwa mong'ho wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">kangusangalala ng'hatu kwa kusumya koumpele.<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Nakumha kugana kwa nhumbula ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">haulemile kulanda kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>Nakumuyila, nakumha utambichizo winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">nakumvaliza kofia ya undewa ya zahabu inojile kumutwi kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>Nakakulanda ukomu nagwe nakumha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">nakumha ukomu wa kikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>Kwa kusumya kwa hegwe, mndewa kana ukulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">hegwe nakumha ukulu na kuhulichizwa.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>Nakumdita heye yawe yatambichizwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">nakumsangalaza heye, kwa kukuhejelela hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>Mndewa kangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">kwa igano lya kwimilila lya Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya, hotigaswa.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Gwa mndewa, moko wa hegwe wowebata wang'honyo wa hegwe weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">moko wa hegwe wa kudilo wowebata walingukuzudila.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>Houlawila kowadumya kota itanuli lya chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">Mkulu Nguluwi kowadumya kwa ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">chiluli chowalakaza ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Gwa mndewa, kowadumya walelwa wa hewo muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">wana wa hewo hawopona hali wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>Hanga howochijesa kukuditila gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">wone wowika goya mbuli za wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">hawoweza kusumya hebu.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Kwa vila hegwe kowadita wabilime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">louwagololela kumeho misale ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Utogoligwe gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha mong'ho wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">Tokwimba na kutogola ludali lwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s">Chililo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwimba kwa lwimbo lwa chifuno chidala cha lufuku. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Nguluwi wa heni, Nguluwi wa heni, lekachoni nakundeka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Lekachoni kwa kutali ng'hatu kundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">kutali na chililo cha heni cha magazo?<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>Gwa Nguluwi wa heni, ndangulila nemisi ila hambe widichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">ndangutowa iyowe nechilo, ila siweza kwesela.<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Ila, hegwe kwa yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">hegwe kwangulongoza kulawa kuli chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa na kutogoligwa na Waisilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Wasekulu wa hetwe nawetumbila kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">nawetumbila kwa hegwe, nagwe nakuwalohola.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Nawakulilila hegwe, nawaloholigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">nawakutumbila nawo hawabasigwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>Ila heni nda linhu hela, siwele munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">ndemigwa na kubezigwa na wanhu weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Weng'ha walingumbona wangumbeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">wangufyonya na kutigasa vitwi vya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>Wangulongaga, “Nakamtumbila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">lelo, Nguluwi yamgombole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">Wone Nguluwi kangunojezwa na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">lelo, yamlohole.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>Ila hegwe ndo undavile mmunda mwa mayangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">nakumbika hanojile kuli mhambaga ya mayangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Nandikutumbila kulawa kupondigwa kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">Kulawa lomhondigwe, hegwe nawali Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Uleche kuwa kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">kwa vila magazo ga habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">haduhu wa kunhanza.<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Wang'honyo wenji nawanzunguluta kota mibuguma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">wamema chila ubanzi wa heni kota mibuguma jing'hang'hale ja Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Wangugabula milomo ja hewo kota isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">liwele goya kuvaba heni na kundadula.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>Namala kota mazi gabohoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">mizeje ja heni najiseleuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">nhumbula ya heni ndo kota ihota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">yangusungulumuka mgati mwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>Ikolomelo lya heni nalikala ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">umyango wa heni wangunanahila kumlomo kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">Nakundeka kuli nimbwisi ya kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Chilundo cha wehile nachinzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">nawanzunguluta kota chilundo cha mibwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">kota isimba, nawandadula kuli moko na magulu ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Mhona mizeje hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">wang'honyo wa heni wangundola na kundonga vibi.<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>Wangigawila nguwo za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">wangulitowela simbi ivalo lya heni.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>Ila hegwe gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kuwa kutali na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">Hegwe mong'ho wa heni, uye himahima kunhanza.<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Undohole kulawa kuli ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">ulohole ukomu wa heni mli ndole za mibwa ajo.<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>Undohole kumlomo mwa isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">undohole kulawa kuli mbalati za mibogo ajo.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>Ndowasimila wang'holozangu itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">ndokutogola hali nhing'hano ya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>“Hemwe mlingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi, mumtogole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mumhulichize hemwe walelwa weng'ha wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mumfugamile Nguluwi hemwe walelwa weng'ha wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Kwa vila heye halingubeza ne kuzudila ung'hochele wa ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">ne kivisa kutali na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">ila kangumhulika hoyomlanda utanzi.”<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>Kwa chiwalo cha hegwe ndokutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">hali nhing'hano ng'hulu ya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">ndokweneza chilaho cha heni hali hewo walingukudumba.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>Wazunwa wolya na kiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">walingumpala Mkulu Nguluwi womtogola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">Nguluwi yawatambichize kikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Isi zeng'ha zokumbuchila na kumhiluchila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha womfugamila,<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">heye kanguwalongoza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Wawele na lufufu weng'ha muisi, wofugama hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">weng'ha wawele wobagama wofugama hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">weng'ha wohambe waweze kulutiliza ukomu wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Lulelo lulinguya lwomkolela mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">wanhu wolusimila mbuli za Nguluwi,<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>wowikula madito ga heye ga hachi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">Wanhu wowawele wang'hali kupondigwa wolonjelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">“Mkulu Nguluwi nakadita kwa hachi.”<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s">Mdimi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mdimi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">sipunguchilwa na chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>Hali honhu ha misolo midodi kangumbasilizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">hafungo ha mazi gasindamale kangundongozaga.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>Kanguuhilusilaga muhe wa heni mong'ho unyale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">Kuli nzila ya hachi kangundongozaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">kwa chiwalo cha kuzeleka kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Hanga hondikola hali ibindi lya jiza likulu lya kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">sidumba wihe woneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">kwa vila hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa hamwe na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">nyimbati na ng'hweku ya hegwe vyangunyamila.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>Nakumbichila goya mnvina hali wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">nakumbakaliza heni mafuta kumutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">chizombe cha heni chimema lukami.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Kwa kukomya, kunoga kwa hegwe na igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe vyowa hamwe na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">kuli mazuwa geng'ha ga ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">nani ndochikala kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mkulu</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Isi na vyeng'ha viwele mgati mwake ndo vya heye Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">isi na weng'ha walingikala mgati mwake ndo vya heye.<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Kwa vila heye nakawika misisi ja isi mchanya mwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">nakajiwika nzinzili mchanya mwa nzanda za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Whaani yokwina kuli chidunda cha Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Whaani yochikala kuli ng'handa ya heye yelile?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Munhu yawele na madito ganojile na nhumbula nzelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">yohambe yauwiche muhe wa heye kuli kudeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">ne kilaha kwa udesi.<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Munhu ayo kobochela utambichizo kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">na hachi ya heye kulawa kwa Nguluwi wa ulohozi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>Ndo vyoluwele lulelo lwa walingumpala heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">ena, wanhu walingumpala Nguluwi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Mchumuche hemwe lwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">mchumuche, hemwe lwizi lwa katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">mndewa mkulu yaweze kwinjila.<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Whaani ayo Mndewa mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Ndo Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho na ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali kuli ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Mchumuche hemwe lwizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">mchumuche, hemwe lwizi lwa katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">mndewa mkulu yaweze kwinjila.<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Whaani ayo Mndewa mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Ndo Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">heye ndo Mndewa wa ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s">Kumlanda Nguluwi ulongozi na kwamilwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa hegwe ndangigala nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>Ndangitumbila kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">uleche kundeka mbasigwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">wang'honyo wa heni waleche kusangalala kwa kulemwela kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Haduhu ne yumwe hali walingitumbila kwa hegwe, yawele yobasigwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">ila weng'ha walingukubelenhuka wabasigwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unzelese nzila za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">undanguse kugawinza goulingugana.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>Undongoze kuli kukomya kwa hegwe na kundangusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">kwa vila hegwe ndo Nguluwi mlohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">ndangitumbila kwa hegwe chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ukumbuchile isungu na igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">viwele navyali kulawa katali.<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>Uleche kukumbuchila gehile ga usongolo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">ung'humbuche kwa kiwhana na igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha kunoga kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka yanojile na yagoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">ahyo kanguwalangusaga nzila wawele na gehile.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Kanguwalongozaga walingunyenyetela kuli hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">ena, kanguwalangusaga nzila ya heye.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguditaga kwa igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">kwa wala walingibatilila malajizo ga ilagano lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">undechele nongwa ya heni hanga ndo ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Chila munhu yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Mkulu Nguluwi komlangusa nzila ya kuwinza.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Mbuli za munhu ayo zomlutila goya mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">walelwa wa heye woihalila isi.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka goloko wa hewo walingumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">heye kanguwazelesaga ilagano lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>Meho ga heni gangumlola Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">naye kogalavya magulu ga heni kuli idiwa.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uye kwa heni na kumbonela isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">kwa vila ndayeka na ndangugazika.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Umbusile kusanzalima kwa nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">na umbuse kuli lunhwinhwi.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>Ulole magazo na kusanzalima kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">undechele gehile ga heni geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>Lole ndaze vyowawele wenji wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">lole ndaze vyowalingunzudila ng'hatu na kugana kundumiza.<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Uwamile ukomu wa heni, undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">uleche kukunda mbasigwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">ndangubilimila kikala goya kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>Kugoloka na kutanganika vinyamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">kwa vila ndangukutumbila hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwagombole wanhu wa hegwe, Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:22">kuli magazo ga hewo geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa munhu yanojile</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, umhe heni hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">kwa vila nandikala kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">nanditumbila kwa hegwe ne kukuleka.<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, umhugajize na kunjeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">uitaguse nhumbula ya heni na nyhala za heni.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>Mazuwa gose silisemwa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">ndangikala kwa chiwalo cha kukundigwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>Hambe ndilumbe hamwe na wanhu wadesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">hambe ndihanze na wanhu wahadi.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Ndanguzizudila nhing'hano za wajilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">na kilumba hamwe na wehile.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Ndanguhovuga moko ga heni kulajila ndahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">na kuhahejelela honhu ha hegwe ha kulavila nhambiko, Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>kuno ndikwimba lwimbo lwa kuta malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">na kusimila madito ga hegwe geng'ha ga kububuwaza.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, nojezwa na ng'handa ya hegwe, honhu houlingikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">honhu houlingikala ukulu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>Uleche kundumya hamwe na wawele na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">ne kunhoza hamwe na walingukopola,<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>wanhu wawele madito ga hewo ndo ga wihe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">wanhu wawele wamema kugana kubochela chinhu leka kwajiliza hachi.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Ila heni ndangikala kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">ungombole na kumbonela isungu.<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>Ndangwima hali honhu hawele na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">ndomtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, kuli nhing'hano ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo lumuli lwa heni na ulohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">ndimdumbe whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ngome ya ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">ndimdumbe whaani?<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Wehile howonhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">na kugana kundumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">wang'honyo na walingitwanza na heni wochikwang'wala na kugwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Hanga wamizi howonzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">nhumbula ya heni haidumba chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">hanga ngondo hoilawila kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">ndowa nding'hali na kitumbila.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>Mbuli imwe nandimlanda Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">ayo ndo ndilinguipala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">ndikale mng'handa mwa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">mazuwa geng'ha ga ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">ndijese ng'hatu kunoga kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na kupala ulongozi wa heye kuli ng'handa ya heye.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Kukomya, zuwa lya magazo konyamila kuli chibumuli cha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">kovisa heni kuli ihema lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">na kumbika kwa kikala goya mchanya mwa italawe.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>Kwa kusumya nani ndolola mchanya mwa wang'honyo wa heni walingunzunguluta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">Ndomlavila nhambiko kwa kutowa luchenze mgati mwa ng'handa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">ndokwimba na kumtowela luchenze Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unyhulichize hondikulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">umbonele isungu na kunyhidichila.<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>Nhumbula ya heni yangundonjela, “Uye umpale Nguluwi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Lelo, ndanguya kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>Uleche kuleka kundola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">uleche kundema kwa ng'halazi heni chitumagwa wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Hegwe nawali utanzi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Uleche kunhoza ne kundeka, gwa Nguluwi Mlohozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Hanga mhaza na mayangu howondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">Mkulu Nguluwi kombochela.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undanguse nzila ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">undongoze kuli nzila igoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">kwa chiwalo cha wang'honyo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>Uleche kundeka leka wang'honyo wa heni wanditile vyowogana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">kwa vila walolezi wa udesi nawambuyila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">hewo walingulavya ulonjelezi wihile.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>Ndangukunda kota ndolyona isungu lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">kuli isi ya wawele wakomu.<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>Witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Wime nzinzili, uleche kugozola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Ena, witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Ndangukulilila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">gwa italawe lya heni, uleche kunditila kota yohambe yahuliche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Wone hunyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">ndowa kota wala walingudulika kuli ikulubila lya wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>Uhulichize lizi lya kulanda kwa heni kwa isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">hondikulilila unhanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">hondikwinula moko ga heni kuli ng'handa ya hegwe yelile.<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>Uleche kumbulunha heni hamwe na wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">hamwe na wanhu walingudita wihe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">Wala walingulonga na wayao ulonzi wa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">ila nawamema wihe mnhumbula za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>Uwagaze kwa kiwhana na madito ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">kwa kiwhana na wihe wowauditile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">Uwagaze kwa kiwhana na gowalingudita kwa moko ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">uwaditile vila vyowalinguganigwa kuditilwa.<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>Kwa vila hambe wajese kwa chiwalo cha madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">hawazizelele mbuli zoyaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">kwa chiwalo acho kowabomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">howazenga kahi unyale.<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">kwa vila nakahulika kulanda kwa heni kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mong'ho wa heni na ngawo ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">nhumbula ya heni yangitumbila kwa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Nakanhanza nani nditowa luchenze kwa nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">kwa lwimbo lwa heni ndangulonga malumbo kwa chiwalo cha heye.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mong'ho wa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">heye ndo honhu ha kubilimila kwa mndewa wa heye yambakalize mafuta.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uwalohole wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">uwatambichize wanhu wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">Uwe mdimi wa hewo na kuwatanza mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s">Lizi lya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, hemwe vilumbigwe vya kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">mlonje Mkulu Nguluwi kana ukulu na mong'ho.<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Muwikule ukulu wa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">Mumfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi kuli welile ng'hatu wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lwanguhulikwa mchanya mwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Nguluwi yawele na ukulu kangulibumiza limlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyanguhulikwa mchanya mwa bahali.<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lina mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi limema ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyangubena migodi mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">Mkulu Nguluwi kangubenanga migodi mikulu ja Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>Kangwambuzaga limachinyhina kuli vidunda vya Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">chidunda cha Helimoni chitigasiche.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyangulavyaga lumwemwesa.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyangukudita kugunuche kukakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">Mkulu Nguluwi nakakudita kugunuche ako Kadeshi kukakame.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyangutigasa migodi ja kumhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">lyangulagaza mahamba ga migodi kuli kisolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">na mgati mwa ng'handa ya heye kweng'ha wangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">“Ukulu kwa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yalingulongoza mchanya mwa mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mndewa yalingulongoza mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yawape mong'ho wanhu wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">Mkulu Nguluwi yawatambichize wanhu wa heye kwa kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Lwimbo lwa kuiwika chiuyeng'ha ng'handa ya Nguluwi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangukutogola kwa vila nakunyinula kulawa kuli ikulubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">huwalechile wang'honyo wa heni wasangalale kwa kusumya heni.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">nandikulilila unhanze, nagwe nakumhonya.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakundohola kulawa kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">nakumha kahi heni ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">nakundavya hali walinguluta kuli vilaga.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi lutogo, hemwe wa kukundigwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">mkumbuchile welile wa heye na kumlonjela malumbo.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>Ng'halazi ya heye yangikala kwa mhela udo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">kukundigwa kwa heye kwangikala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">Chililo choweza kuwa baho mbaka nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">ila mitondo usangalalo wanguya.<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Mbuli za heni hoziwele zilutilila goya, nandonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">“Silemwela hebu.”<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>Kwa kunoga kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">nakunyimiza nzinzili kota chidunda chikulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">Ila louwele wivisile kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">nandumba ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>Gwa Nguluwi, nandikulilila hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">ena nandikudedeza, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>“Ndaze, kopegwa choni hondibagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">na kudulika mbaka kuli wabagame?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Ndaze, nhimbwisi ya wabagame yoweza kukutogola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Ndaze, yoweza kusimila kukundigwa kwa hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>Unyhulichize, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kumbonela isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unhanze.”<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Hegwe nakugalula kulombocheza kwa heni kuwa ngoma ya kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">nakumbusila masinzo ga heni, nakunzungulusila usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>Ndokutogola hambe nyamalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni ndokulonjela malumbo mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuli magazo makulu</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa hegwe ndangubilimila kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">uleche kundeka ne hado mbasigwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">kwa kutanganika kwa hegwe undohole himahima.<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>Umbichile goya ikutu lyako, undohole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">Uwe kwa heni italawe lya kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">ngome iwele nzinzili kundohola.<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>Ena, hegwe ndo italawe na ngome ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya hegwe undongoze na kundajila.<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Undavye kuli idiwa lyowambichile chinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">kwa vila hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kubilimila.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>Mmoko mwa hegwe ndanguwika muhe wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">nakungombola, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa kitumbila.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Ndanguwazudila walingufugamila milungu ja udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">ila heni ndangitumbila kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Ndotowa luchenze na kusangalala kwa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwa vila hegwe nakukona kugaya kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">nakukuzela kusanzalima kwa nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>Hegwe hundechile mbichigwe kuli moko ga wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">nakunyimiza honhu hawele na kilejeha.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, umbonele isungu, nda kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">meho ga heni nagatoka kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">ndahela mong'ho kuli lukuli na kuli nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Ukomu wa heni naumala kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">ena, miyaka jangu kwa kung'ung'uta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Mong'ho wa heni naumala kwa kugazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">mbaka mizeje ja heni jahela mong'ho.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Nandiwa wa kubezigwa kwa wang'honyo wa heni weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">kwa wawele habehi na heni nambezigwa ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">Goloko wa heni wangumbona heni nda chinhu cha kukabusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">howombona mnzila wangumbilima heni.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>Semwigwa kota munhu yabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">ndiwa kota chiya chibeneche.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>Ndanguhulika wanhu woheha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">“Kukabusa chila ubanzi!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">Wangijesa mbuli zihile kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">wangiwika goya kung'hopola.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>Ila heni ndangitumbila kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">Ndangulonga, “Hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni.”<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Mazuwa ga ukomu wa heni ga mmoko mwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">undohole kulawa kwa wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">undohole kulawa kwa hewo walingumbinga.<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>Undole kwa kunoga heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">undohole kwa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kundeka mbasigwe soni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">kwa vila heni ndangukulanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">ila waleche wehile wabasigwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">waleche wajilile kwa kububuwala ako kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Ujidinye milomo ja wanhu wadesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">wanhu wawele na kidaya na izudizo kwa wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">wawele wanguwabezaga wanhu watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Ndaze vyokuwele kwinji kunoga kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">kouwawichile wala walingukudumba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">Walingubilimila kikala goya kwa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">kwanguwapa ganojile kuno wanhu weng'ha wolola.<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>Kwanguwavisa hali honhu hawele na kikala goya aho houwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kutali na majesa gehile ga wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">Kwanguwawika kuli kikala goya hali ng'handa ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kutali na maligo ga wang'honyo wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">kwa vila nakandajila igano lya kwimilila lya heye lya kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">lonzungulutwe kota muji ulingutowigwa.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Nandumba lukami na kijesa kota nawali undechile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">hambi, nakuhulika chililo cha heni londikuchemile unhanze.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Mumgane Mkulu Nguluwi, hemwe welile wa heye weng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwamilaga wanhu wa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">ila kanguwagazaga walingidaya kota vyowalinguganigwa.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Muwe mzidahe na mikangaze nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">hemwe mweng'ha mlingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s">Kulonga malumbo kwa chiwalo cha kulechelwa gehile</para>
  <para style="d">(Ilanguso lya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Nakatambichizwa munhu yalechelwe nongwa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">munhu yawele gehile ga heye nagosigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Nakatambichizwa munhu yawele Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yamuwazile nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">munhu yawele muhe wa heye wahela uhadi.<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>Mhela lombele ndilutilila kuleka kulonga gehile ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">nandali ng'hochele kwa kulila nemisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Nemisi na nechilo moko wa hegwe naunhunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">mong'ho wa heni nawali wusigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">kota mazi mhela wa chipalangule.<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Hamba nandonga gehile ga heni kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">siuvisile wihe wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Nandonga, “Ndangulonga wihe wa heni gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Aho ndo nagwe loumbusile gehile ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>Ahyo, chila yalingukundigwa yakulande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">mhela houwa baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">kukomya mazi makulu hogomema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">hagomfichila heye.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>Hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kivisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">kombika kutali na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">na kunzunguluta kwa nzimbo za ulohozi.<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>Nguluwi kangulonga, “Ndokulangusa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">na kukulajila nzila youlinguganigwa kuwinza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">Ndokulonjela mbuli na kukulola ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>Uleche kuwa mpoka kota falasi ama falasi-idogowi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">jiwele janguganigwa jikowelwe lijamu na hatamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">ama hebu hawokuhejelela.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Wanhu wehile wofichigwa na magazo menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">ila walingumtumbila Mkulu Nguluwi wanguzungulutwa na igano lya heye lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Mtowe luchenze na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi hemwe watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">mtowe luchenze lwa kusangalala hemwe mgoloche nhumbula!<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Mtowe luchenze kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi hemwe watanganiche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">Kumtogola Nguluwi kwanguwawala wanhu wawele na nhumbula zigoloche.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi kwa igombogombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">mumtogole kwa ching'weleng'wele cha ng'weso kumi.<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Mmwimbile lwimbo lunyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">mtowe goya ching'weleng'wele na luchenze,<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>kwa vila ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi ugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">na madito ga heye ndo ga kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangugana kutanganika na hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">isi naimema igano lya kwimilila lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Kwa ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi ulanga naulumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">na vyeng'ha viwele mumo kwa lweselo lwa mlomo wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>Nakakungajiza mazi ga bahali kota kuli ibuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">mazi menji nakagahindila kung'hano.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Isi yeng'ha imdumbe Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">Wenyeng'haye weng'ha muisi, wamhulichize.<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>Kwa vila nakalonga na isi naiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">nakalajiza nayo nayima nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangutengulaga kunuwila kwa wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">kangutengulaga majesa ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Choyogana kudita Mkulu Nguluwi changikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">kunuwila kwa heye kwangikala kuli lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Nawatambichizwa wanhu wa isi wawele Nguluwi wa hewo ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">nawatambichizwa wanhu woyawahagule wawe wa heye yuye.<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulolaga hasi kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">na kuwona wanhu weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>Kulawa kuli chigoda cha heye cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">kangulolaga weng'ha walingikala muisi.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>Heye kangulumbaga nhumbula za wanhu weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">heye kanguvizela chila chinhu chowalingudita.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Mndewa halinguloholigwa kwa chilundo chikulu cha wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">ne mwamizi muwanzi hawaga na kusumya kwa mong'ho wa heye ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Falasi wa ngondo hawele chinhu kwa kusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">mong'ho wa heye winji hauweza hebu kumlohola munhu.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwalola wala walingumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">wanhu wawele wangitumbila igano lya heye lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>Heye kanguwaloholaga kulawa kuli kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">kanguwaditaga wawe wakomu mhela wa lufemba.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>Nhumbula za hetwe zangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">Heye ndo utanzi wa hetwe na ngawo ya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>Ena twangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">twangitumbila kuli itagwa lya heye lyelile.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila likale na hetwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">kwa vila hetwe natukuwichila kitumbila kwa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo na kunoga kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi loyeditile kota kana lukwale hali Abimeleki, yawele nakamuwinga, naye nakoka.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Ndomtogola Mkulu Nguluwi mihela jeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:1">sileka hebu kulonga lutogo lwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>Heni ndowa na lutogo hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">ng'hochele wahuliche na kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi hamwe na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">tweng'ha hamwe tulitogole itagwa lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>Nandimlanda Mkulu Nguluwi naye nakanyidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">nakambusa kulawa kuli kudumba kwa heni kweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Wala walingumlola, wowichigwa lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">kumeho kwa hewo hakuwa na soni hebu.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Yalingubunzwa nakamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi, naye nakamhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">na kumlohola kuli magazo ga heye geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwamilaga banzi zeng'ha na kuwalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">weng'ha walingumdumba.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Mjeze mone Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyawele yanojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">Nakatambichizwa munhu yalingubilimila kikala goya kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>Mumdumbe Mkulu Nguluwi hemwe welile wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">kwa vila walingumdumba hawokwisilwa chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>Mbaka misimba jangwisilwa na kona nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">ila walingumpala Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">hawalingupunguchilwa na chinhu choneche chinojile.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Muye hemwe wasongolo mnyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">nani ndowalangusa kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>Whaani yalingunojezwa na ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">yalingugana mazuwa menji leka yagone ganojile?<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>Lelo, uleche kulonga gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">na kiwika kutali na kulonga udesi.<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>Wiwiche kutali na wihe, udite ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">upale kikala goya na kibatilila.<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Meho ga Mkulu Nguluwi ganguwalolaga watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">na kuhulichiza kung'ung'uta kwa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>ila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwaga yochitwanza na walingudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">leka yose kukumbuchila kwa hewo muisi.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Watanganiche howomlilila Mkulu Nguluwi, heye kanguwahulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">na kuwalohola kulawa kuli magazo ga hewo geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka habehi na hewo watweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">kanguwalohola weng'ha wagozole ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Magazo ga yatanganiche ndo menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangumlohola kulawa geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Kangujamila mizeje ja heye jeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">haduhu ne limwe lyobeneka.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Wihe wanguwegalilaga wehile kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">walinguwazudila watanganiche wotagusigwa kwa wihe.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguloholaga ukomu wa vitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">weng'ha walingumbilimila hawotagusigwa kwa wihe.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, witwanze na walingitwanza na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">uwatowe hewo walingunhowa.<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Uhole ngawo ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">winuche uye unhanze.<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Uwiche goya igoha na ipanga lya hegwe kwa chiwalo cha walingumbilimisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">Undonjele kota kondohola.<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Wabasigwe soni na kudeula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">hewo walingugana kung'hopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Wahiluse kumbele kwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">hewo walingijesa kundumya.<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>Wawe kota mhumba hali mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">lowobilimiswa na mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Nzila ya hewo iwe ya jiza na kutelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">lowowinjigwa na mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Kwa vila ne chiwalo choneche nawambichila midiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">wambawila ikulubila ne nongwa yoneche.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Kudumigwa kuwafiche hewo himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">wagwilizwe kuli idiwa hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">wagwe mgati na kudumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Aho ndosangalala kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">ndotowa luchenze kwa vila heye nakandohola.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>Ndomlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, haduhu yawele kota hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Hegwe kwanguwalohola ng'hochele kuli ndole za wawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">wazunwa na walihela chinhu mmoko mwa wabokaji.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Walolezi wajuvi wangilajila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">wangumbuza mbuli zohambe ndizizele.<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>Wangunyhilusila gehile honhu ha ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">mbaka heni ndanguwa kuli uchiwa.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Ila hewo nalowawele watamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">heni navala migunila kulajila masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">nandingaza kwa kuleka kulya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">Ndilanda kwa kinamiza mutwi,<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>kota ndangumlilila goloko wa heni ama mng'holozangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">Nanduta nandinamiza mutwi kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">kota munhu yalingulombocheza kubagama kwa mayake.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Ila vyondikwang'hwale nawekungajiza na kusangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">Nawekungajiza hamwe kwa chiwalo cha heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">Wanhu wohambe ndiwazele nawanhowa ne kuleka.<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>Wanhu wawele wanguwabezaga mbaka vyete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">nawang'hanuchila kwa kuzudila.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kolola hela mbaka hanili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Undohole kulawa kuli kudumigwa na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">ulohole ukomu wa heni kulawa kuli misimba ajo.<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Ndolonga malumbo hali nhing'hano ng'hulu ya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">ndokutogola hali wanhu wenji.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>Uleche kuwaleka wang'honyo awo wandonje vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">hewo walingunzudila hela wasangalale kwa chiwalo cha magazo ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Hambe walonje kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">ila wangulonga ulonjelezi wa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">kwa kitwanza na wenyeng'haye wasindamale.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Wangundonjeleza kwa lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">“Goya! Goya! Natona gouditile.”<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Ila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwanguyona mbuli ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kunyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">uleche kuwa kutali na heni.<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi unhowanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">unyamile gwa Nguluwi na Mkulu wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, unhowanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">udite kwa kiwhana na kutanganika kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">uleche kuwaleka wang'honyo wa heni wandonje vibi.<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Uleche kuwaleka wejese, “Mbuli za hetwe nazitulutila goya kota vyotuganile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">Ama walonje, “Natumdumya ayu.”<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Waleche hewo walingusangalalila kudumigwa kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">walemwele weng'ha na kudeula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Hewo weng'ha walingiwona wanojile kusinda heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wadeule na kona soni.<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Ila walingugana kona kota heni nda yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">wakwinize lizi kwa kusangalala walonje mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">“Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mkulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">Kangunojezwa na kunoga kwa chitumagwa wa heye.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Aho nani ndowikula kutanganika kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">ndolonga lutogo lwa hegwe nemisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s">Kunoga kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwanguusumya wihe wa munhu</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi, chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Gehile gangulongaga na munhu mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">mgati ng'hatu mwa nhumbula ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">mbuli ya kumdumba Nguluwi ya haduhu ng'hatu kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Mwihe kangiganililaga yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">mbaka kangulemwela kuvizela na kugazudila gehile ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Chila choyalingulonga ndo wihe na udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">nakaleka kuwa na luhala na kudita ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Hoyowasa kangijesaga kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">kangiwikaga kuli nzila yohaiwele inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">halingileka na wihe hebu.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>Igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi lyangwenela mbaka kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">kukundigwa kwa hegwe kwangufika mbaka kuli ng'hungugu.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Kutanganika kwa hegwe ndo kota vidunda vikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">utaguso wa hegwe ndo kota mgati ng'hatu mwa bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwanguwamila wanhu na migongolo.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ndaze vyoliwele linojile igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">Wanhu wangubilimilaga kuli lubehelo lwa mbawa za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Kwanguwagutiza kwa lufufu lwa ng'handa ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">kwanguwanweza kulawa kuli lwanda lwa kunoga kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>Hegwe ndo mwaluko wa ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">kwa lumuli lwa hegwe, twangona lumuli.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Ulutilile kuwa na igano lya kwimilila kwa walingukuzela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">ulutilile kuwa wa hachi kwa wagoloche nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Uleche kukunda walingidaya wavabe heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">ne wanhu wehile wambilimise heni.<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Hambi walingudita wihe nawagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">nawagwiswa hasi hawoweza kwinuka.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s">Kulutilila goya kwa mbuli za wehile kuleche kukudeuza</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Uleche kitunya kwa chiwalo cha wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">uleche kuwonela fihi walingudita gehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>Kwa vila hewo wokwajilila himahima kota misolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">woswinha kota mizuchila.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kudita ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">wikale kuli isi iwele na kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>Upale usangalalo wa hegwe kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">naye kokuditila kota vyoilingugana nhumbula ya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>Umhe Mkulu Nguluwi ukomu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">witumbile kwa heye,<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>naye kokudita kunoga kwa hegwe kupuliche kota lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">na hachi ya hegwe yuye kota isanya lya nemisi.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>Usindamale hali Mkulu Nguluwi, umbeteze kwa kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">uleche kitunya kwa chiwalo cha wala wawele mbuli za hewo zanguwalutila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">wala walingudita goya kuli mbuli za hewo za wihe.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>Wiyuse na ng'halazi na uleche kuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">uleche kusanzalima kwa vila ako ndo kulutiliza wihe.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Wanhu walingudita wihe wodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">ila walingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi woihalila isi iwele heye nakalagana kuwapa.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>Ung'hali mhela uchefu, wehile wokwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">kowapala hala howawele, howona hebu.<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Ila wawele liholile woihalila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">wosangalalila winji wa kikala goya na ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Wehile wangiwikaga goya kudita gehile kwa yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">na kumjejedela mizino kwa kuzudila.<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwasekaga wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">kwa vila kanguvizela kota kuduma kwa hewo kwa habehi.<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Wehile wangusomolaga mipanga ja hewo na kukwega mipinde jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">leka wawakopole wazunwa na walihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wawadumule singo wanhu walingikala kwa kugoloka.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Ila mipanga jawo jokwinjila kwa hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">na mipinde jawo jobeneka.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Fola lufufu ludo lwa munhu yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">kusinda lufufu lwinji lwa wehile wenji.<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>Kwa vila mong'ho wa wehile wobenangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwatanza watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulolelaga ukomu wa wanhu walihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">na uhalizi wa hewo wochikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>Hawobasigwa soni hojifika mihela jihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">mazuwa ga lufemba wowa na chilyo chekwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Ila wehile wodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">wang'honyo wa Mkulu Nguluwi woswinha kota uluwa wa kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">ena, wokwajilila kota iyosi.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Wehile wangwazika ne kuhilusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">ila yatanganiche kangulavyaga kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Walingutambichizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi woihalila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">ila walingupanjilwa naye wodumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongozaga magulu ga munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">kangumwamilaga yula yamganile heye.<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Hoyochikwang'wala, hogwa na kupona hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi komibata moko.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Nandali msongolo na sambi nda sekulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">ila nasimuwene yatanganiche nakalechigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">ama wana wa heye wodedeza chilyo.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Mazuwa gose kanguwapaga wanji kwa kusangalala na kuwazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">na wana wa heye ndo utambichizo.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Wiyuse kuli wihe, udite ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">nagwe kochikala muisi mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwagana wawele na hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">hambe yawaleche wanhu wa heye wa kukundigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">Kanguwamilaga mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">ila walelwa wa wehile wodumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Watanganiche woihalila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">wochikala amo mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Munhu yatanganiche kangulongaga ulonzi wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">kwa umyango wa heye kangulongaga gawele na hachi.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>Kangibatililaga malajizo ga Nguluwi wa heye mnhumbula mwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">naye hambe yajilile kuli kudita mbuli za heye.<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Wehile wangumpugajizaga munhu yanojile na kujeza kumkopola,<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>ila Mkulu Nguluwi homuwika hebu munhu yanojile kuli ndole za wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">homleka yafichigwe na nongwa hoyotagusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kibata nzila za heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">naye kokwinula leka uihalile isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">na kuwona wehile wodumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>Ndiwona wehile wang'ang'ale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">wewichile mchanya mwa weng'ha kota mielezi ja Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Hamba nang'hola aho, nawo hawawele hala kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">nandiwapala ila hawoneche kahi.<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>Umjese munhu yalihela nongwa, munhu yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">munhu yalingugana kikala goya kotambichizwa walelwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Wawele na nongwa weng'ha wodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">na walelwa wa hewo wokwajilizwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwaloholaga watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">na kuwamila mhela wa magazo.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwatanza na kuwalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kanguwaloholaga kulawa kwa wehile na kuwawika hali kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kwa vila wangubilimila kikala goya kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuli magazo</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kukumbuchila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kung'hanuchila heni kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:1">uleche kungaza kwa kuzudila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Misale ja hegwe najihoma lukuli lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">moko wa hegwe naung'hundujiza hasi.<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>Kuduhuli honhu hawele hanojile mlukuli lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwa vila nakuzudila kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">haduhuli hawele na mong'ho mbaka kuli mizeje ja heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Nangubikwa ng'hatu na gehile ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">gangunhunya kota mhomholo ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Vilonda vya heni vyola na kunhung'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">kwa chiwalo cha upoka wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Ndibina mbaka hasi na kuhondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">nemisi yeng'ha ndanguzunguluta ndilombocheza.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Lukuli lwa heni nalumema utamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">mlukuli mwa heni mwa haduhu honhu hawele goya ne hado.<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Nganda na kupondigwa pondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">ndangulila kwa kugazigwa mnhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>Gwa Mkulu, hegwe kuvizela maya ga heni geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">kwa hegwe hachivisile hebu chililo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Nhumbula yangutama, mong'ho umalila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">mbaka meho ga heni kahi hambe galole goya.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Goloko na wayangu wangiwika kutali na heni kona magazo ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">nhanzi ya heni yanguwa kutali na heni kahi.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Walingugana kung'hopola wanguwika goya midiwa ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">walingugana ndumile, wanguwika goya udesi kundumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">Nemisi yeng'ha wangiwika goya kwa chiwalo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Ila heni ndiwa kota yohambe yahuliche, hambe nyhuliche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">ndiwa kota yohambe yalonje, hawezile kulonga chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Ena, ndiwa kota munhu yohambe yahuliche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">kota munhu yohawele na choneche cha kilewela.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>Ila ndangukubeteza, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">hegwe konyhidichila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Ndangukulanda hela wang'honyo waleche kundonga vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">waleche kitogola kwa kugwa kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Habehi ng'hatu ndogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">ndina usungu wa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>Ndangulonga kwa mlomo wa heni wihe wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">gehile ga heni gangungalila masinzo.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Wang'honyo wa heni wa goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">wenji lukami walingunzudila ne chiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Walinguhilusa wihe kwa ganojile ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">wangundonjeleza kwa vila ndangudita ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Uleche kunhoza, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">uleche kuwa kutali na heni, Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Uye himahima kunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwele ndo ulohozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda luhala na kulechelwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwimba kwa Yedutuni. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Nandonga, “Ndozilolela nzila za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">ndeche kudita gehile kwa ulonzi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">Ndodinya mlomo wa heni, wehile howowa habehi na heni.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Nandali kota yohambe yalonje, ne kulonga chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">nandali ndinyamalile, ila siwele goya hebu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">Magazo ga heni nagalutilila kuwa gang'ang'ale,<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>kugaya kwa heni nakundumiza mnhumbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">Vyombele ndijesa, ndo vyondutilile kugaya kwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">hamba ulonzi awu naulawa kwa heni,<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unzelese kuduma kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">mazuwa ga heni ga kikala gapona galinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">ndivizele vyoulingukola himahima ukomu wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>“Hambi kumbichila ukomu udo ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">Ukomu wa heni hauwele chinhu hali hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">Kukomya, chila munhu ndo kota lweselo hela.<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Ndangukomya, chila munhu kangukola kota isisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">mijito ja heye jeng'ha ja hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">kangukungajiza lufufu ne kuvizela whaani yohola.<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>“Ila, gwa Mkulu, ndangubeteza choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Kitumbila kwa heni ndo kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Undohole kulawa kuli nongwa za heni zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">uleche kukunda wapoka waseche heni.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Nda kota yohambe yalonje, hambe ndonje chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">kwa vila hegwe ndo unditile ahi.<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Uleche kunzapa kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">ndangumala kwa magazo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Houmgaza munhu gehile ga heye kwa kumng'hanuchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">kwanguwifya ng'hano ya hewo kota lung'hwawa vyowalingulya mahamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">Kukomya, chila munhu ndo kota lweselo hela.<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uhulichize kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">uhulichize chililo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">uleche kuwa tulu hondilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Kwa vila heni nda mjenzi hela yalingukola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">nda mmajendo kota wasekulu wa heni weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Uleche kundola leka sangalale hado,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">londing'hali bagama na kwajilila.”<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa lutogo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Nandimbeteza Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:1">nakanyuyila na kuhulika chililo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>Nakambusa kulawa kuli ikulubila likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">nakandavya kuli ndidi za ilamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">nakemiza goya magulu ga heni mchanya mwa italawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">nakagapa mong'ho magulu ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>Nakandangusa lwimbo lunyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">lwimbo lwa lutogo kwa Nguluwi wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">Wenji womlola na kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">na kitumbila kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>Nakatambichizwa munhu yalingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">munhu yohambe yelumbe na wanhu walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">wala walingujifugamila milungu ja udesi.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, nakutuditila kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">vinduzanduza na majesa ga hegwe kwa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">Haduhu yoweza kuwhanizwa na hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">Wone ndahaganile kugawikula na kugadamla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">ndo menji lukami kugawaza.<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>Hegwe hulingunojezwa na nhambiko ne nhambiko za kulakazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">ila nakumha heni makutu ndikuhuliche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">Nhambiko za kulakazwa na nhambiko za kusa gehile hulinguzigana.<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>Aho nandonga, “Ulole nambuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">kuli chitabu nagandichigwa kuwala heni,<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>kota ndangusangalala kweneza goulingugana, gwa Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">ilajizo lya hegwe ndangulibatilila kwa nhumbula ya heni.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>Nasimila mbuli inojile ya kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">hali nhing'hano ng'hulu ya wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">Kota vyouvizelele, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">heni hambe ndilemeze kuiwikula.<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>Sivisile mnhumbula mwa heni kutanganika kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">nandiwikula kota hegwe kwa mlohozi wa kukundigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">Siivisile nhing'hano ng'hulu ya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila na kukundigwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kuleka kumha heni isungu lya hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">Igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila na kukundigwa kwa hegwe vinyamile mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 70">Zabuli 70</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>Kudumya kohambe kuwazigwe, kwangunzunguluta heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">gehile ga heni gangundinya mbaka ndangulemwela kona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">ga menji kusinda mnvili kumutwi kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">nani ngozola.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ugane kundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uye himahima kunhanza.<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Walingugana kundumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wabasigwe soni na kudeula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">Hewo walingugana ndumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wahiluche kumbele na kubezigwa.<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Hewo walinguseka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">wabubuwale kwa kulemwela kwa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Ila wala weng'ha walingukupala hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wasangalale na kutowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">Walinguugana ulohozi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">walonje mazuwa gose, “Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Mkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Nani nda mzunwa na ndilihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">ila gwa Mkulu, hegwe kwangung'humbuka heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Hegwe ndo mtanzi wa heni na mlohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uye uleche kukawila.<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa mtamwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Katambichizwa yalingijesa kwa chiwalo cha mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:1">Mkulu Nguluwi komlohola zuwa lya magazo.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi komwamila na kumuwika yawe mkomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">mbuli za heye zolutilila goya kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Nguluwi homleka kuli ndole za wang'honyo wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Mkulu Nguluwi komtanza hoyowa mtamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">komusila matamwa ga heye geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Nani nandonga, “Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, umbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">umhonye kwa vila nandikuditila gehile.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Wang'honyo wa heni wangulongaga vibi kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Kobagama hanili na itagwa lya heye lyajilile?”<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Lowonjendela wangulongaga ulonzi wa hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">wangukungajizaga gehile kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">lowofika kunze wanguwikulaga kwa wanji.<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Weng'ha walingunzudila, hewo wangupwepwaga kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">wangunjesela mbuli zihile za kunditila wihe.<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>Wangulongaga, “Matamwa ago gomkopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">holawa kahi mchinhanda cha heye.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>Mbaka goloko wa heni ndimkundile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">goloko yawele yehanzile na heni ibumunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">nakambelenhuka.<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, umbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">unyhinule kahi, nani ndowahilusila chibida.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Ahyo ndovizela kota kwangunojezwa na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">kwa vila wang'honyo wa heni hawoweza kusumya heni.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Hegwe nakunyimiza kwa vila ndahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">kwangumbika kumwando kwa hegwe mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">kulawa mazuwa gose, mbaka mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">Ena! Ena!<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cha Keli</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 42:-1-72">Zabuli 42-72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Ilanguso lya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa yabilimiswe kuli isi ya heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>Kota ibala vyolilingugana mazi ga kazanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:1">ndo vyondilingukugana, gwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Ndina ng'halu ya Nguluwi, ng'halu ya Nguluwi yawele mkomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">Ndofika hanili kwa heye na kukona kumeho kwa heye?<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>Mahozi nagawa chilyo cha heni nemisi na nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">lowandonjele chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">“Kakohi Nguluwi wa hegwe?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>Ndangukumbuka kahi mbuli azi kwa masinzo mnhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">ndaze vyondutile na chilundo cha wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">nandiwalongoza kuluta haluga ha Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">wotowa luchenze lwa lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">hali chilundo cha wanhu wodita mnvina.<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Lekachoni ndangutweguka nhumbula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Lekachoni ndangusumajila ahyo mgati mwa heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Ndochitumbila kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">kwa vila ndomtogola kahi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">heye yawele ulohozi wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Nanzungulutwa na masinzo mnhumbula mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">lelo ndangukukumbuchila hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">kulawa kuli honhu ha Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">kulawa chidunda cha Helimoni na Misali.<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Nafikwa na mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">mazi tendema ga hegwe ganguchema kubuguma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">nhigu na magazo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">vya mchanya mwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kongana heni kwa igano lya heye lya kwimilila nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">nakamha heni lwimbo lwa lutogo nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">lwimbo lwa kumlanda Nguluwi wa ukomu wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Ndangumlonjela Nguluwi, italawe lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">“Lekachoni nakusemwa heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Lekachoni ndute aku na ako ndilombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">kwa kubunzwa na wang'honyo wa heni?”<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Mhondigwa kwa maligo ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">vyowombuza chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">“Kakohi Nguluwi wa hegwe?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Lekachoni ndangutweguka nhumbula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Lekachoni ndangusumajila ahyo mgati mwa heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Ndochitumbila kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">kwa vila ndomtogola kahi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">heye yawele ulohozi wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa yabilimiswe kuli isi ya heye</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa 42 lwangulutilila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ulajile kota ndahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">uilewele mbuli ya heni kwa wanhu wa isi yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">undohole kulawa kwa wanhu wadesi na wehile.<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>Ndangubilimila kikala goya kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Lekachoni kunhoza kutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Lekachoni ndute aku na ako ndilombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">kwa kubunzwa na wang'honyo wa heni?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>Uhiliche lumuli na kukomya kwa hegwe vindongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">vifichize heni kuli chidunda cha hegwe chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">haluga ha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>Hamba, Nguluwi wa heni, ndoluta hali honhu ha hegwe ha kulavila nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">ndokuya kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi, usangalalo wa heni ukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">Ndokutogola kwa igombogombo, gwa Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Lekachoni ndangutweguka nhumbula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Lekachoni ndangusumajila ahyo mgati mwa heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Ndochitumbila kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">kwa vila ndomtogola kahi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">heye yawele ulohozi wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwamilwa na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Ilanguso lya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, hetwe natuhulika kwa makutu ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">wasekulu wa hetwe nawatusimila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">mbuli zouditile mihela ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">ena, mbuli zouditile aho katali.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Kwa moko wa gwegwe baho nakuwawinga wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">honhu ha hewo nakuwawika wasekulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">nakuwagaza wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">nakuzidita mbuli za wasekulu wa hetwe zilutilile goya.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>Wasekulu wa hetwe hawaiholile isi kwa mipanga ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">ne kusumya kwa mong'ho wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">ila nakuwadita wasumye kwa moko wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kwa kuwalangazila kumeho kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kwa vila nakuwagana hewo.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>Hegwe ndo mndewa wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">Wamule walelwa wa Yakobo wasumye.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>Kwa mong'ho wa hegwe twanguwasumya wang'honyo wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">kwa ludali lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">twanguwabiga walingututowa.<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Heni hambe nditumbile ipinde lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">ne ipanga lya heni haliweza kundohola.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Hegwe ndo uwele utulohole kwa wang'honyo wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">nakuwadita walingutuzudila wabasigwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Mazuwa gose tochidayila hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">tolitogola itagwa lya hegwe mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Ila nakutuleka na kutubasa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">hambe ulutase kahi na chilundo cha wamizi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Nakutudita tuwabilime wang'honyo wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">nawo nawahola lufufu lwa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>Nakutudita kota ming'holo jilinguhilikwa kudumuligwa singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">nakutusambalula kuli isi zinji.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>Nakuwaguza wanhu wa hegwe kwa sendi nyindo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">ne kuwa na chinhu choneche cha mzidi kulawa kuli kuwaguza hewo.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>Nakutudita tulonjelezwe na wotulingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">nawo wangutubeza na kutuseka.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>Nakutudita tubezigwe na wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">wangutigasa vitwi vya hewo kwa kutubeza.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>Nemisi yeng'ha soni naingubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">kumeho kwa heni kumema soni,<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>kwa ulonzi na kubeza kwa walingundiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">kwa chiwalo cha wang'honyo wa heni na wahilula chibida.<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>Aga geng'ha nagatufika hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">hanga hatukusemwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">ne hatubenile ilagano lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Hatukubelenhuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">ne kuzileka nzila za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>Ila nakutuleka tuwele tutochile ng'hatu hali honhu ha mibwa ja kisolo jing'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">nakutuleka kuli jiza ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>Wone twahakusemwile hegwe Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">na kumbilimila mlungu wa udesi,<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>gwa Nguluwi, wahavizelele mbuli ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">kwa vila hegwe nakuuzela uviso wa mnhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>Ila kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, twangukopoligwa chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">twanguditilwa kota ming'holo jilinguhilikwa kudumuligwa singo.<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Gwa Mkulu, ulilimche. Lekachoni nakuwasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Winuche. Dedede uleche kututoza mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Lekachoni kwangivisa kutali na hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">na kusemwa magazo na kubunzwa kwa hetwe?<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Natuduliswa mbaka kuli nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">natunanahila kuli misanga.<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Winuche, uye kututanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">Utugombole kwa chiwalo cha igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola mndewa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwimba kwa Yunjiyunji. Ilanguso lya Wakola. Lwimbo lwa mnvina ya kuhesa.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Nhumbula ya heni imema majesa ganojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">Ndangumlonjela mndewa misitali ja lwimbo lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">umyango wa heni ndo kota kalamu ya yalinguweza kwandika goya.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Kumeho kwa hegwe ndo kunoga kusinda wanhu weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">ulonzi wa hegwe ndo isungu hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">Ahyo Nguluwi nakakutambichiza mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Uwohe ipanga lya hegwe, hegwe ulingitowa ngondo uzidahe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">Hegwe kuna ukulu na lutogo.<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Kuli ukulu wa hegwe, ulutilile kumwando kwa kusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">ukulewele kukomya na kunyenyetela na kwamila hachi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">Moko wa hegwe wa kudilo udite mbuli ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Misale ja hegwe jihongoka lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">jangukola kuli nhumbula za wang'honyo wa mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">wanhu wa isi wangugwa hasi ha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>Gwa Nguluwi, chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa ndo cha mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">Kwangulongoza wanhu wa hegwe kwa hachi.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Nakugana gatanganiche na kuzudila wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">kwa chiwalo acho, Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">nakakuhagula kwa kukubakaliza mafuta ga usangalalo, kusinda wayago.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Mivalo ja hegwe jangunhunyhilila manemane na udi na mdalasini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">lizi lya vinhu vya muziki vya ng'weso lyangukusangalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">kuli ng'handa ng'hulu zinoligwe kwa mizino mikulu ja itembo,<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Wahinza wa wandewa wa hali wadala wa hegwe walingutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">naye mche wa mndewa kema kudilo kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">yavalile vinoligo vya zahabu inojile ya Ofili.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Uhulichize mhinza, wijese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">Uwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">Uleche kukumbuchila wanhu wa hegwe na ivyazi lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Kumeho kwa hegwe ndo kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">heye ka mkulu wa hegwe igana umhulichize.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Wanhu wa Tilo wokugalila ndolendole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">wawele na lufufu wogana uganililo wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Ukulu weng'ha ndo kwa mhinza wa mndewa kuli chihengo cha heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">Ivalo lyake nalitawigwa kwa ng'weso za zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Yawele yavalile ivalo lya lanji nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">kangulongozwa kwa mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">wayage mhinza wangumuwinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">nawo wangugaligwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Kwa usangalalo na luchenze wangufika ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">na kwinjila kuli ng'handa ng'hulu ya mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>Gwa mndewa, kowa na wana wenji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">wawele wolongoza honhu ha wasekulu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">kowadita walongoze kuli isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>Ndolidita itagwa lyako likumbuchilwe kuli lulelo lweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">isi zeng'ha zokutogola mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi ka hamwe na hetwe</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Lwimbo lwa Wakola. Kwa kiwhana na Alamoti.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Nguluwi ndo honhu ha hetwe ha kubilimila na mong'ho wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">heye ndo utanzi wa hetwe mazuwa gose mhela wa magazo.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>Ahyo hatudumba choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">hanga limachinyhina holilawila na vidunda kugwa mbahali,<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>hanga bahali yobuguma na kukabusa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">na vidunda hovikakama kwa kukabusa kwake.<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>Hana lwanda luwele mazi gake ganguusangalaza muji wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">honhu helile ha kikala Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Nguluwi ka kuli muji awo, nawo hauweza kutigaswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">Nguluwi koutanza lufuku.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wangulila kwa kukabuswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">na ulongozi wangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">Nguluwi kangubuma na isi yangusungulumuka.<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho ka hamwe na hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Nguluwi wa Yakobo ndo ngome ya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Muye mlole madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">mlole vinduzanduza vya kudumbiza vyoyaditile muisi.<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>Kangudumya ngondo muisi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">kangubenanga mipinde na migoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">ngawo kanguzilakaza kwa chiluli.<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>Kangulonga, “Mnyamalile na kuvizela kota heni nda Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">Ndina ukulu kuli wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">ndikomya, ndina ukulu muisi.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho ka hamwe na hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Nguluwi wa Yakobo ndo ngome ya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi, Mndewa wa isi zeng'ha</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Hemwe wanhu weng'ha mtowe vimbamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:1">Mumtogole Nguluwi kwa lizi lya kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya, kangukabusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">Heye ndo Mndewa mkulu kuli isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Nakatudita tuwasumye wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">nakawawika wanhu wa isi hanyi, hali magulu ga hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>Nakatuhagulila isi ayi iwe uhalizi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">iwele ndo lutogo lwa walelwa wa Yakobo yalingumgana.<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>Nguluwi nakenuka kuchanya hali walingutowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">Mkulu Nguluwi hali walingutowa mhalamanda.<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>Mumwimbile Nguluwi lutogo, mumwimbile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">Mumwimbile lutogo mndewa wa hetwe, mumwimbile.<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>Mumwimbile Nguluwi lwimbo lwa lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">kwa vila heye ndo mndewa wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Nguluwi yalinguwalongoza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">nakekala kuli chigoda cha heye cha undewa chelile.<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Vilongozi wa wanhu wa isi wangikungajiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">wangilumba na wanhu wa Nguluwi wa Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">kwa vila ludali lweng'ha lwa muisi ndo lwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">heye kana ukulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s">Siyoni muji wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Lwimbo. Zabuli ya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo mkulu, kanguganigwa yatogoligwe ng'hatu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:1">kuli muji wa heye, chiwele ndo chidunda cha heye chelile.<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>Chidunda cha Siyoni ako kasikazini ndo kota chidunda cha Safoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">changunojeza kwa ung'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">muji wa Mndewa mkulu, ndo kusangalala kwa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Nguluwi kangwamila ngome za muji awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">ena, heye ndo ngome.<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Ulole, wandewa nawekungajiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">nawaluta hamwe kuutowa,<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>ila lowauwene muji wa Siyoni, nawabubuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:5">nawebatigwa na lunhwinhwi, nawabilima.<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>Kudumba kukulu nakuwebata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">nawali na usungu kota wa mdala yalinguponda.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Nakuwadumya kwa chivuluvumbi cha kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">nachiwabenanga kota meli za Talishishi.<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>Geng'ha gotuhuliche natugona twetwe baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">kuli muji wa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">ena, kuli muji wa Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">Nguluwi kowimiza nzinzili mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Gwa Nguluwi, twangijesa igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">tuwele kuli ng'handa ya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Itagwa lya hegwe, gwa Nguluwi lyangutogoligwa chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">lutogo lwa hegwe lwangwenela honeche muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">Kwa moko wa hegwe wa kudilo nakudita kwa hachi,<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>leka wanhu wa Siyoni wasangalale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">Wanhu wa Yuda watowe luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">kwa chiwalo cha utaguso wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Mjende ako Siyoni muuzungulute muji weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">kuno muwaza milingo jake.<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Mlole ng'hanzi zake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">na kupugajiza ngome za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">leka msimile kuli lulelo lulinguya kota,<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>“Ayu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi wa hetwe mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">Kowa chilongozi wa hetwe mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s">Upoka wa kitumbila kuli lufufu</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Mhulichize mbuli ayi hemwe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:1">muwiche goya makutu hemwe wenyeng'haye mweng'ha wa isi,<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>mhulichize mweng'ha wakulu na wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">wawele na lufufu na wazunwa hamwe.<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Majesa ga heni gowa ga kitunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">ndolonga ulonzi uwele na luhala.<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Ndowika goya ikutu lyangu leka nyhulichize nhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">ndotang'hula nhelo kwa muziki wa igombogombo.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>Lekachoni ndumbe zuwa lihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">hondizungulutwa na wihe wa mng'honyo?<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Wanhu wehile wangitumbila lufufu lwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">wangitogola kwa winji wa lufufu lwao.<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>Ila munhu howeza kumgombola yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">hambe yaweze kumhilusila Nguluwi chasi cha ukomu wa heye,<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>kwa vila chasi cha ukomu ndo chikulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">Howeza kulavya chinhu choneche chiwele chohega,<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>chiwele chomdita yekale mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">yaleche kwinjila kuli chilaga.<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>Weng'ha wanguvizela kota mbaka wawele na luhala wangubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">wasowile nyhala mbaka wapoka kahi wangubagama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">Weng'ha awo wanguwalechelaga wanji lufufu lwao.<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Vilaga vyopona kuwa haluga ha hewo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">ndo ng'handa ya lulelo mbaka lulelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">hanga nawali na migunda jiwele nawajichema kwa matagwa ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Munhu halingikala ng'hatu kuli lufufu lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">kobagama hela kota igongolo.<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Ago ndo gowapata hewo wapoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">kahi walinguwawinza hewo wawele nawakunda ulonzi wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Wolongozwa kota ming'holo mbaka kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">kubagama kowa mdimi wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">Watanganiche wowasumya hamitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">ng'huli za hewo zokola kuli chilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">kutali na ng'handa ng'hulu za hewo zinojile ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>Ila Nguluwi kongombola na ako kuli isi ya wabagame.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Kombika habehi na heye.<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Uleche kusumajila houmona munhu yowa na lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">ne lutogo lwa ng'handa ya heye holukonjezeka ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>Kwa vila hoyobagama hohola choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">lufufu lwa heye haludulika ako hasi hamwe na heye.<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>Hoyochidita ndo mkulu kuli ukomu awu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">na kutogoligwa kwa chiwalo cha mbuli za heye kumlutila goya,<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>kochilumba na wasekulu wowamlongole kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">wawele hawoweza kona kahi lumuli.<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>Munhu yawele na lufufu ne luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">ndo kota migongolo jilingubagama.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s">Kufugamila kwa kukomya</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Nguluwi wa mong'ho, Mkulu Nguluwi, nakalonga na kuwachema walingikala muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">kulawa kwa isanya mbaka kuzibila kwake.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>Kulawa Siyoni, muji unojile lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">Nguluwi nakelajila, yolangaza.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>Nguluwi wa hetwe kanguya, haiwele tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">chiluli chilingulakaza nhimwa changumlongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">chivuluvumbi chikulu changumzunguluta.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>Kulawa kuchanya kanguvichema kilanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">vilole vyoyalinguwatagusa wanhu wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>Mng'hungajizile wanhu wa heni wa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">wawele nawadita ilagano na heni kwa nhambiko.<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Ulanga wanguwikula kutanganika kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">kota Nguluwi yuye ndo mtagusa.<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>“Mhulichize wanhu wa heni, chondilingulonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Isilaeli, ndangukulonjeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Heni nda Nguluwi. Heni nda Nguluwi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Hambe ndikung'hanuchile kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">hulechile kundavila nhambiko za kulakazwa.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Kwa kukomya hambe ndiligane ibuguma lya ibani lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">ne ipongo kuli ibani lya hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>kwa vila migongolo jeng'ha ja kisolo ndo ja heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">maelufu ga migongolo kuli vidunda ndo ja heni.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Ndanguchizela chila chideje cha kuli vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vya kuli chiwala ndo vya heni.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>“Wone ndahawele na nzala hanasali kukulonjela hebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">kwa vila isi zeng'ha na vyeng'ha viwele mgati ndo vya heni.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Ndaze, wangijesa ndangulya iwunde lya ibuguma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">ama kunwa danda ya mhene?<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Kulonga malumbo kuwe ndo nhambiko ya hegwe kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">mwenezele Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya chilaho cha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>Unyheme mhela wa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">nani ndokulohola, nagwe konyhulichiza.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>Ila Nguluwi kangumlonjela munhu mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">“Kuna choni kugalongalonga hela mizilo ja heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">Lekachoni kwangulongalonga kwa chiwalo cha ilagano lya heni?<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>Hegwe kwanguzudila makanyo ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">ulonzi wa heni hulingugana kuuwinza.<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Loumona mhizi kwanguwa hamwe na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">wang'hondwa kwangihanza nawo.<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>Kwa goya mazuwa gose kulonga gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">mijito ja umyango wa hegwe ndo kulonga udesi.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Kwangikalisa na kumheha myago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">ena kumlonjeleza mng'holozo.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>Nakudita aga geng'ha nani nanyamalila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Ndaze, wangijesa kukomya heni nda kota hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Ila sambi ndangukung'hanuchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">ndangulonga nongwa za hegwe hazelu.<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>“Mijese goya mbuli ayi, hemwe mlingumsemwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">ama ndowadumya hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">ne hakuwa na wa kuwalohola.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Yalingumha heni malumbo kota ndo nhambiko ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">ayo ndo yalingunyhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">yoneche yalingibatilila nzila ya heni Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">ayo ndo yondimlohola.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kulechelwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi loyang'hanuchilwe na mloli Natani kwa nongwa ya heye kuwala Batisheba.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, mbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kwa winji wa igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">Kwa winji wa isungu lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">wuse gehile ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>Uhovuje ng'hatu nongwa ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:2">welize gehile ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Kwa vila ndanguzizela nongwa za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">na ndangugona hazelu gehile ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>Nandikuditila gehile gwegwe uliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">nandita nongwa hali hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">Lelo, uzeleche kota kuna hachi houlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">na haulingung'ung'utilwa kuli nhaguso za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>Ulole, ndina nongwa kulawa lomhondigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">mbele na gehile kulawa mmunda wa mayangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>Hegwe kwangugana kugoloka kwa mgati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">ahyo undanguse luhala mnhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>Welize gehile kwa heni kwa izuchila lya isopolo nani ndiwe yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">undite ndiwe mzelu kusinda seluji.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>Memeze kusangalala na luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">hanga nakumhonda, undite sangalale kahi.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>Uhinduche, uleche kugalola gehile ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">wuse nongwa za heni zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>Gwa Nguluwi, umhe heni nhumbula yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">uwiche mgati mwa heni muhe unyale na uwele nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>Uleche kumbika kutali na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">uleche kumbusila Muhe Welile wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Nyhilulile kahi kusangalala kwa kundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">uwiche mgati mwa heni nhumbula ya kuhulichiza leka iwe lwega lwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>Hamba ndowalangusa wehile nzila za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">na wawele na gehile wohiluka kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>Gwa Nguluwi, Nguluwi ulingundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">undohole kulawa kuli nongwa ya kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">nani ndokwimba kwa lizi kutanganika kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Undite ndonje, gwa Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">mlomo wa heni uwikule lutogo lwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>Kwa vila hulingunojezwa na nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">wone wahaganile, heni ndahakulavile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">Hegwe hulingusangalazwa na nhambiko za kulakazwa.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Nhambiko ya heni kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">ndo nhumbula ilingunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">hegwe, gwa Nguluwi, hambe uileme nhumbula ilingunyenyetela na ilinguhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ugane kuuditila ganojile muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">uzenje kahi ng'hanzi za muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Aho ndo konojezwa na nhambiko za kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">ndolendole za kulakazwa na za kulakazwa ne kugawilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">Mibuguma jolavigwa nhambiko hali honhu ha hegwe ha kulavila nhambiko.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s">Utaguso wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Ilanguso lya Daudi mhela Doegi, Mwedomu loyamlutile Sauli na kumlonjela, “Daudi nakaluta kaye kwa Ahimeleki.”)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Lekachoni kwangivuna kwa wihe wa hegwe, gwa mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">Igano lya kwimilila lya Nguluwi lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>Gwa mhadi, chila mhela kwanguwika goya kudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">umyango wa hegwe ndo kota nzembe.<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Hegwe kwangugana wihe kusinda kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">kwangugana udesi kusinda kulonga kukomya.<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Gwa mhadi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">kwangugana mbuli za kuwadumya wanji.<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Ahyo Nguluwi kokudumya mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">kokunyasula na kukusa kaye kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">kokung'umbula kuli isi ya wawele wakomu.<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Watanganiche wogona ago na kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">hamba wokuseka na kulonga,<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>“Mlole gamfichile munhu ayu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">Heye nahaganile Nguluwi yawe honhu ha heye ha kubilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">ila nayali yochitumbila winji wa lufufu lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">yochitumbila vinhu vyoyaholile kulawa kwa wanji.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Ila heni ndo kota igodi idodi lya mzeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">lilingudedemka kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">Ndangitumbila igano lya heye lya kwimilila mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>Gwa Nguluwi ndokulonjela malumbo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">kwa chiwalo cha mbuli zouditile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">Ndowikula kota hegwe ndo unojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">hali wanhu wa kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s">Wihe wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 14">Zabuli 14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Mahalati. Ilanguso lya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Wapoka wangilonjelaga mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">“Haduhuli Nguluwi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">Weng'ha nawajilila lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">nawadita gehile ga kuzudiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">haduhuli ne yumwe yalingudita linojile.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Nguluwi kanguwalola wanhu kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">yalole kota hana yoneche yawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">kota hana yoneche yalingumuwinza Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Ila weng'ha nawabelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">weng'ha nawajilila hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">haduhuli yaditile ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">haduhuli ne yumwe.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Ndaze, hewo walingudita wihe wahela nyhala?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 53:4"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Wanguwadakula wanhu wa heni kota mhau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">hambe wamlande Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Aho wowa na kukabusa kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kukabusa kuwele hawanakona hamwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwa vila Nguluwi kojisambalula mizeje ja wang'honyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">hewo wobasigwa soni kwa vila Nguluwi nakawalema.<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Twangugana ulohozi wa Isilaeli ufiche kulawa Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Nguluwi hoyowahilula goya wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">walelwa wa Yakobo wotowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Waisilaeli wosangalala.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa kiyamila na wang'honyo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Na vinhu vya ng'weso vya muziki. Ilanguso lya Daudi mhela munhu yumwe kulawa Sifu loyamlutile Sauli na kumzelesa kota Daudi nakevisa kwa hewo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Undohole, gwa Nguluwi kwa itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:1">kwa mong'ho wa hegwe, ulajile kota ndahela nongwa.<verse eid="PSA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uhulichize kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:2">uhulichize ulonzi wa mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Wajenzi wangunhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wanhu wawele na nhumbula zigagadale wanguuwinga ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wanhu wohambe wamdumbe Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Ndivizela Nguluwi ndo utanzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">Mkulu ndo yalingunyimiza nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Heye kowagaza wang'honyo wa heni kwa wihe wa hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">kwa kukundigwa kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi, uwadumye.<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Ndokulavila nhambiko ya kunuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndolitogola itagwa lya hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">kwa vila ndo linoga.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>Kwa vila nakundohola kuli magazo ga heni geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">nani ndiwona wang'honyo wa heni nawalemwela.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa munhu yalingubunzwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Na vinhu vya ng'weso vya muziki. Ilanguso lya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe uhulichize kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:1">uleche kulola hafungo hondikulanda.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Uhulichize na kunyhidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">majesa ga heni gangunhunya na ngozola,<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>kwa lizi lya wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">kwa kubunzwa na wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">kwa vila wangingalila magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">na kundiga kwa ng'halazi za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>Nhumbula ya heni imema lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">kukabusa kwa kubagama nakunzunguluta.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Ndangukakama kwa lunhwinhwi lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">kukabusa kukulu nakwinjila kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Wone ndahawele na mabawa kota ng'hunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">ndahaguluche kutali na kwesela,<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>ena, ndahajendile kutali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">ndahawele na haluga kuchiwala.<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Ndahabilimile kutali hawele na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">kutali na mbeho ng'hulu na chivuluvumbi.<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>Gwa Mkulu, udumye majesa ga wehile na kuwifya ndonga ya hewo, leka walemwele kulongosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">kwa vila ndangona nhumbula zihile na kilewa kuli muji.<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Nemisi na nechilo wanguzunguluta kuli ng'hanzi zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">na kuumemeza magazo na wihe.<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Kuwifya kwangwenela kweng'ha kuli muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">ung'honyo na udesi chila honhu.<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Wone mng'honyo wa heni yahawele nakandiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">ndahawezile kwimilila ago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">wone yalingitwanza na heni yahawele yambezile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">ndahawezile kivisa kutali na heye.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Ila hambi ndo hegwe myangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">ndo hegwe goloko wa heni na ulinguzizela mbuli za heni zeng'ha!<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Hetwe natuzowela kulongasa kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">natujenda hamwe kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, hali walingufugamila wanji.<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Leka kubagama kuwafiche wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">waduliche kuli isi ya wabagame wawele wang'hali wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">kwa vila wihe naumema mnhumbula za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Ila heni ndangumlilila Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">naye Mkulu Nguluwi kondohola.<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Mitondo na nemisi na matinazo, ndangung'ung'uta na kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">naye kohulika lizi lya heni.<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Kongombola kulawa kuli ngondo yombele nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">hanga wang'honyo wa heni ndo wenji.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Nguluwi yalingulongoza kulawa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">konyhulika na kuwabasa soni wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">kwa vila hawalingugana kidita wawe wanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">ne kumdumba Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Myangu nakawatowa goloko wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">nakabena kulagana kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>Ulonzi wa heye ndo udeche kusinda siagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">ila majesa ga heye ndo kudita ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">Ulonzi wa heye ndo udeche kota mafuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">ila wangutema kota ipanga likali.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>Mlechele Mkulu Nguluwi itunyo lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">naye kokutanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">homleka hebu yatanganiche yalemwele.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>Gwa Nguluwi, kowadulisa kuli ikulubila hasi ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">wanhu awo ndo walingukopola na wahadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">hewo hawofika hebu ne nusu ya ukomu wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Ila heni ndochitumbila kwa hegwe gwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s">Kitumbila kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na “Ng'hunda ya Kutali Isindamale.” Zabuli ya Daudi mhela loyebatigwe na Wafilisti kula Gati.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, mbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">kwa vila wanhu wangunhowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">Nemisi yeng'ha wanhu wangumbunza heni.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Nemisi yeng'ha wanhu wangitwanza na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">wenji walingidaya wangunhowa.<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Gwa Nguluwi, lunhwinhwi holukuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">ndochitumbila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>Ndanguutogola ulonzi wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">ndangitumbila kwa Nguluwi hambe ndumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Wanhu wohambe wekale mazuwa gose kota Nguluwi, wondita choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Nemisi yeng'ha wangulonga udesi kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">majesa ga hewo geng'ha ndo kumbunza heni.<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Wangiting'hana kiwika goya na kumbinza chinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">wangupugajiza geng'ha gondilingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">wangugana kung'hopola.<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uwahilusile kwa winji wa wihe wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">uwagwise wanhu wa isi azo kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Hegwe kugazela magazo ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">kwanguwika kukumbuchila kwa mahozi ga heni geng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Ndaze, geng'ha hagawele kuli chitabu cha hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>Chila hondilanda utanzi kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">wang'honyo wa heni wanguhiluswa kumbele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">Ndanguvizela ndikomya Nguluwi ka ubanzi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Ndangitumbila kwa Nguluwi na kuutogola ulonzi wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">Ndangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kuutogola ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>Ndangitumbila kwa Nguluwi hambe ndumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">Munhu kondita choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ndokweneza chilaho cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">ndokulavila nhambiko za kulonga malumbo.<verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Kwa vila nakundohola kulawa kuli kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">ena, nakunyamila leka ndeche kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">leka njende hali hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">kuli lumuli lwa ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na “Uleche kuwifya.” Zabuli ya Daudi loyasulupuche kwa Sauli na kivisa hali mhalika.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Umbonele isungu, gwa Nguluwi umbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">kwa vila kwa hegwe ndangubilimila kikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">Kuli lubehelo lwa mabawa ga hegwe ndobilimila kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">mbaka aho chivuluvumbi cha kudumya hochikola.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Ndangumlilila Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Nguluwi yalingweneza kunuwila kwa heye, kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>Kongalila utanzi kulawa kilanga na kundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">kowabasa soni hewo walingunhowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">Nguluwi kondajila igano lya heye lya kwimilila na kukundigwa kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>Nanzungulutwa na wang'honyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">mbasa hali walingugana danda kota isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">mizino ja hewo ndo kota migoha na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">umyango wa hewo ndo kota ipanga likali.<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Utogoligwe, gwa Nguluwi, kuchanya kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">Ukulu wa hegwe wenele muisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Wang'honyo nawambichila utandawala leka wangwilize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">nani nang'ung'uta kwa masinzo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">Nawabawa isimo kuli nzila ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">ila hewo wawo ndo nawagwa amo.<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>Nda nzinzili mnhumbula, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">nda nzinzili mnhumbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">Ndokwimba na kukutowela luchenze.<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Ulilimche, gwa nhumbula ya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Vililimche avyo ching'weleng'wele na igombogombo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Ndolililimla isanya kuwe mitondo.<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>Gwa Mkulu, ndolonga malumbo kwa hegwe hali wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">ndokwimbila lutogo hali wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila ndo likulu kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">kukundigwa kwa hegwe kwangwenela mbaka kuli ng'hungugu.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>Utogoligwe, gwa Nguluwi, kuchanya kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">Ukulu wa hegwe wenele muisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi ndo mtagusa wa watagusa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na “Uleche kuwifya.” Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Hemwe vilongozi, ndaze, hambi ndo kukomya mwangutagusa kwa hachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">Ndaze, mwanguwatagusa wanhu kwa kutanganika?<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Hebu! Hemwe mwangijesa hela kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">hemwe mwemwe mwangweneza kubunza kuli isi.<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Wehile nawajilila kulawa kupondigwa kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">wehile awo, nawadita wihe kulawa mmunda mwa wamai wa hewo, wangulonga udesi.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Wana dunga kota dunga ya izoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">wa wohambe wahuliche kota izoka lilingudinya makutu,<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>lyohambe lihuliche ne lizi lya wateleka mikwandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">ama lwimbo lwa mteleka mikwandi yazidahe ng'hatu kwa uhawi.<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ubene mizino ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">ung'humbule, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mizino ja misimba ajo.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Wajilile kota mazi galigwajilila kuli sangalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">howokwega mipinde ja hewo, misale ja hewo jigwe habehi.<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>Wajilile kota ikola vyolilingubagama kuli isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">kota himila iwifigwe ne kona isanya.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Wang'hali hawavizelele, wang'humbuligwe himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">kota miwa ama mikwangwasale ama misolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">Kwa ng'halazi ya Nguluwi, kwa mbeho wosigwe kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">wawele wang'hali wakomu.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Watanganiche wosangalala howowona wehile wangugazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">wojenda kuli danda ya wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Wanhu weng'ha wolonga, “Ena, watanganiche wopegwa chonolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">Kwa kukomya ka baho Nguluwi yalinguwatagusa wanhu wa isi.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwamilwa na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na “Uleche kuwifya.” Lwimbo lwa Daudi, mhela Sauli loyalajize wapugajizi haluga ha Daudi leka wamkopole.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi wa heni, undohole na wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:1">unyamile na hewo walingunhowa.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Undohole na hewo walingudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">umbiche kutali na hewo walingukopola.<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Lole Mkulu Nguluwi, wangumhugajiza leka wang'hopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">wanhu wawele na nhumbula zigagadale wangwambuza magazo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">hanga sibelenhuche ne kudita gehile.<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Siditile nongwa, ila nawewika goya kunhowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">uye unhanze.<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Nguluwi yawele na Mong'ho, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Ulilimche, uwagaze hewo wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">uleche kuwonela isungu wala wabelenhuche.<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Chila matinazo wang'honyo wanguhilukaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">wobwaka kota libwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">na kulubaluba kuli muji.<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Lole, ndo maligo yeka galingulawa kuli milomo ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">ulonzi wa hewo wangudumula kota ipanga likali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">wangijesa haduhu yalinguwahulika.<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>Ila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwanguwaseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">kwanguwabeza wanhu wa isi azo zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Ndokubeteza, hegwe uwele mong'ho wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">kwa vila hegwe, gwa Nguluwi, ndo ngome ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Nguluwi wa heni kokuya kwa heni na igano lya heye lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">kondita ndiwone wang'honyo wa heni nawalemwela.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>Uleche kuwakopola kamwe hela, leka wanhu wa heni waleche kukusemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">ila uwasambalule kwa ludali lwa hegwe, uwadulise.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">Gwa Mkulu, hegwe ndo ngawo ya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Hewo wanguditaga gehile kwa geng'ha gowalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">ahyo wagwilizwe kuli kidaya kwa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">Kwa chiwalo cha kupanjilwa na udesi wa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>uwalakaze kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">uwalakaze leka waleche koneka kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">leka wanhu weng'ha wavizele kota hegwe Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">kwangulongoza walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">mbaka kuli kuduma kwa isi.<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Chila matinazo wang'honyo wanguhilukaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">wobwaka kota libwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">na kulubaluba kuli muji.<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Wangukolaga kuno na kula wopala chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">na howowa hawegute wangubumaga.<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>Ila heni ndokwimba lutogo lwa mong'ho wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">ndotowa luchenze mitondo kwa chiwalo cha igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">kwa vila hegwe nakuwa ngome ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">honhu ha heni ha kubilimila mhela wa magazo.<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Hegwe uwele mong'ho wa heni, ndokwimbila lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">gwa Nguluwi, hegwe ndo ngome ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Nguluwi ulingumha heni igano lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s">Kusumya hala du lokukolile kulemwela</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Shushani Eduti. Lwimbo lwa Daudi lwa kulangusa, mhela loyetowile na Waalamu kulawa Nahalaimu na Soba, hala Yoabu naloyahiluche kumbele na kuwakopola Waedomu elufu kumi na mbili kuli Ibindi lya Mwino.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, nakututoza na kutuhonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">nakuwika ng'halazi, dedede utuhilusile mong'ho.<verse eid="PSA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Nakuidita isi ikakame na kuitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:2">uhadinye hala honhu hatuliche kwa vila nahawifigwa.<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Nakuwadwika wanhu wa hegwe magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">nakutunweza divai ilingutudita tuzebeduche.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>Uwalajile ulajilo wala walingukudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">waweze kuhepa msale.<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>Leka woulingugana waloholigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">ulohole kwa moko wa hegwe wa kudilo, utwidichile.<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>Nguluwi nakalonga kulawa helile ha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">“Lelo, hondisumya ndoigawanula Shekemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">ibindi lya Sukoti ndolipima chila honhu.<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Gileadi ndo ya heni na Manase ndo ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">Efulaimu ndo kofia ya heni ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">na Yuda ndo ng'hweku ya heni ya undewa.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Moabu ndo kota chisaye cha heni cha kihovujila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">makwamba ga heni ndogatozela Edomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">Ndotowa iyowe lya kusumya kwa chiwalo cha Filistiya.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>Whaani yonyhilika kuli muji wa ngome?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Whaani yondongoza mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Ndaze, nakutuleka ng'hatu gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">nakuwaleka wamizi wa hetwe?<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Utugalile utanzi kwa chiwalo cha walingutugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">kwa vila ulohozi wa munhu hauwele chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Kwa utanzi wa Nguluwi tosumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">heye kowabiga walingutugaza.<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwamilwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Na vinhu vya ng'weso vya muziki. Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uhuliche kulila kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:1">uhulichize kulanda kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Kulawa kuli kuduma kwa isi ndangukulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">mbele nweguche nhumbula.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 61:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">Undongoze mbaka kuchanya kuwele na italawe ikulu, hali honhu ha kubilimila kikala goya,<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>kwa vila hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kubilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">ngome ya heni iwele nzinzili, wang'honyo hawoweza kufika heni.<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Ndangulanda ndikale kuli ihema lya hegwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">leka ndiwe hali kikala goya hanyi ha mabawa ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>Gwa Nguluwi, nakuhulika chilaho cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">nakumha heni uhalizi wa wala walingukudumba.<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Wonjeze ukomu wa mndewa uwe wa mazuwa menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">miyaka ja heye jiwe ja lulelo lwinji.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Yalongoze mazuwa gose hali hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa kwa hegwe vimwamile.<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>Ahyo ndokwimbila nzimbo za kulitogola itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">ndikweneza chilaho cha heni chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s">Ndomtumbila Nguluwi kunyamila</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Yedutuni. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Ndangumbeteza Nguluwi yaliyeka kwa kusindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:1">kwa heye wangulawa ulohozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>Heye yaliyeka ndo italawe na ulohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">heye ndo ngome ya heni, sitigasika ng'o.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Mbaka hanili monhowa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">Mbaka hanili hemwe mweng'ha momhonda heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">heni mbele kota lukanzi lwiname,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">kota lugagala lulingwaluka kugwa?<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Mwangugana kungwisa kulawa honhu hangu ha lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">usangalalo wa hemwe ndo kulonga udesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">Kwa ulonzi, mwangutambichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">ila mnhumbula mwangupanjila.<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>Gwa nhumbula ya heni, usindamale kwa Nguluwi yaliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">kitumbila kwa heni kwangulawa kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>Heye yaliyeka ndo italawe na ulohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">heye ndo ngome ya heni, sitigasika.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>Ulohozi na ukulu wa heni vyangulawa kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">italawe lya heni ikulu na honhu ha heni ha kubilimila ndo Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>Hemwe wanhu, mitumbile kwa Nguluwi mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">mumchumulile Mkulu gawele mnhumbula za hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Nguluwi ndo honhu ha hetwe ha kubilimila.<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Wanhu weng'ha ndo kota lweselo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">weng'ha, wakulu na wadodo, hawawele chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">Kahi houwapima itunyo hambe wafiche kilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">weng'ha hamwe ndo wabewe kusinda lweselo.<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Mleche kipalila sendi kwa kubunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">mleche kitogola kwa lufufu lwa uhizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">wone lufufu lokonjezeka, mleche kitumbila kuli lufufu alo.<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Mbuli imwe Nguluwi nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">mbuli mbili nandizihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">kota mong'ho ndo wa Nguluwi,<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>ena, igano lya kwimilila ndo lya hegwe Mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">Kwangumpaga chila munhu kwa kiwhana na madito ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s">Kugana kuwa hamwe na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi mhela loyawele kuli chiwala cha Yuda.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">nani ndangukupala kwa nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">muhe wa heni wangukugana kota munhu yawele na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">ndina ng'halu kota isi ikalile, ilihela mazi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Nandikona hegwe kuli honhu ha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">ndiwone mong'ho wa hegwe na ukulu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila linoga kusinda ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">nani ndokutogola kwa mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Ndolonga malumbo kuli kikala kwa heni kweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">ndokwinula moko ga heni na kukutogola.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Nhumbula ya heni yangugutizwa kota mnvina na vinonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">kwa mlomo wa heni ndokwimba lutogo lwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>Londiwa mchinhanda ndokukumbuchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">nechilo yeng'ha ndochijesa kwa chiwalo cha hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>kwa vila hegwe nakunhanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">Kuli lubehelo lwa mabawa ga hegwe, ndotowa luchenze.<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Nda hamwe na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">moko wa hegwe wa kudilo wangunhanza.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Wala walinguupala ukomu wa heni, wowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">wokwinjila hanyi kuwele walingikala wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Wokopoligwa kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">wowa chilyo cha mikanhu.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>Ila mndewa kosangalala kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">walingilaha kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi wotowa iyowe lya kusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">ila milomo ja wadesi jodinyigwa.<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwamilwa na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uhuliche kung'ung'uta kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">wamile ukomu wa heni na kukabusa kwa wang'honyo.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Unyamile na majesa gehile ga wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">na ivuche lya wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Wangunola umyango wa hewo kota ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">wangulavya ulonzi wihile kota misale.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Kulawa kuli kivisa wangumtowa munhu yagoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">baho du wangumtowa ne kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>Wangilumba kuli kunuwila kwa hewo kwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">wangikundiza honhu ha kuvisa midiwa ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">wangulonga, “Kuduhu yoweza kujona.”<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Wangijesaga kunuwila kwa hewo kwihile na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">“Sambi natweneza gotuganile kudita ne kulemwela.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Kunuwila kwihile kwa uviso nakuvisigwa mnhumbula mwa munhu.<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Ila Nguluwi kowatowa kwa misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">na kuwalumiza baho du.<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Wodumigwa kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi wa hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">chila hoyowona kotigasa mutwi kwa kubeza.<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Aho wanhu weng'ha wodumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">wowikula goyaditile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">na kijesa kwa chiwalo cha madito ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Watanganiche wosangalala kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">na kubilimila kikala goya kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">wanhu weng'ha wagoloche womtogola.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kuta malumbo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Kwanguganigwa kutogoligwa, gwa Nguluwi, ako Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:1">wanhu wokwenezela hegwe kulagana kwa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>kwa vila hegwe kwanguhulika kulanda kwa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">Wanhu weng'ha wokuyila.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>Vyotuwele tugubikwe ng'hatu na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">gwegwe baho nakugubika nongwa za hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Wotambichizwa wala ulinguwahagula na kigaligwa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">wekale haluga ha hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">Tugutizwe ganojile ga ng'handa ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">ganojile ga ng'handa ya hegwe yelile.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Kwangutwidichila kwa hachi na kudita madito makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">gwa Nguluwi wa ulohozi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">hegwe ndo kitumbila kwa wanhu weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">muisi yeng'ha na kutali mbahali.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>Kwa mong'ho wa hegwe nakuvimiza vidunda honhu hake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">Hegwe kuna mong'ho lukami,<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>ulinguvidita bahali na nhigu visindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">kahi ivuche lya wanhu lisindamale.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>Weng'ha walingikala kutali wangububuwazwa kwa madito ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">Kwangwambuza usangalalo chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kulawa kolilawilaga isanya mbaka kolizinjilaga isanya.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Hegwe kwanguilolela isi kwa kuitowela nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">kwanguitambichiza mboto na kujidita mizuchila jidedemche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Lwanda lwa hegwe Nguluwi nalumema mazi heko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">kwanguidita isi iwe na vilyo vinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Ahi ndo vyoulinguigongomanya isi.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Migunda kwangujitowela nhonya nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kujidodeza kwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">isi kwanguidita idode kwa upesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kujitambichiza mizuchila jizuche.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Kwanguutambichiza mwaka weng'ha kwa ganojile ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">chila houkolile nahamema ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Kisolo nakumema migongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">vidunda navyo navigubikwa usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Honhu ha kudimila migongolo nakugubikwa ming'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">mibindi najigubikwa na ngano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">Chila chinhu changutowa luchenze na kwimba.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Lwimbo. Zabuli.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Hemwe wanhu weng'ha muisi mumtowele luchenze Nguluwi!<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>Mwimbe kwa chiwalo cha lutogo lwa itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">mumlavile lutogo lukulu.<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>Mumlonjele Nguluwi, “Madito ga hegwe ndo ga kububuwaza lukami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Ludali lwa hegwe ndo lukulu ng'hatu mbaka wang'honyo wa hegwe wangisuwata kwa kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>Isi yeng'ha yangukufugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">wanhu weng'ha wangukwimbila lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">wangulimbila lutogo itagwa lya hegwe.”<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>Muye, mlole mbuli zoyaditile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">nakadita mbuli za kudumbiza hali wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>Nakaidita bahali naiwa isi ikalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">wanhu nawakola amo kwa magulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Muye, natwe totowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha heye.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>Kangulongoza mazuwa gose kwa mong'ho wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">meho ga heye ganguwalola wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">leka yoneche yalingumbelenhuka yaleche kujeza kiyinula hali heye.<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Mumtogole Nguluwi wa hetwe, hemwe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">muwikule lutogo lwa heye leka luhulikwe.<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>Heye nakalutiliza ukomu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">hatulechile tugwe.<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Nakutupima, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">nakutweliza kota sendi vyoilingwelizwa mchiluli.<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Nakutuleka tugwilizwe muutandawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">kutupapiza magazo ga kutunya.<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>Nakuwaleka wanhu watubije,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">natukolela mchiluli na mmazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">Ila sambi nakutigala kuli honhu ha kwesela.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>Ndokuya kuli ng'handa ya hegwe na nhambiko za kulakazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">ndokweneza chilaho cha heni,<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>chondonjile na kulagana vyombele kuli magazo.<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>Ndokulavila nhambiko za kulakazwa zinonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">hamwe na iyosi lya nhambiko za ming'holo milume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">ndolavya nhambiko za ibuguma na mhene.<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Hemwe mlingumdumba Nguluwi, muye mweng'ha mhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">nani ndowasimila goyanditile.<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>Nandimlilila kwa mlomo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">lutogo lwa heye nalwali kuli umyango wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Wone ndahalolile gehile mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Nguluwi yahawezile kunyhulichiza,<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>ila ndangukomya Nguluwi nakanyhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">ena, nakahulichiza kulanda kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>Yatogoligwe Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">kwa vila halemile kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">ne kusa igano lya heye lya kwimilila kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa vinhu vya ng'weso vya muziki. Zabuli. Lwimbo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Utonele isungu, gwa Nguluwi, ututambichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:1">utulajile kumeho kwa hegwe kwa kunoga,<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>leka isi yeng'ha ivizele nzila ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wavizele ludali lwa hegwe lwa kulohola.<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Wanhu weng'ha wakupe ukulu, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">wanhu weng'ha wakutogole.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wasangalale na kwimba kwa usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">kwa vila kwanguwatagusa wanhu kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">na kuwalongoza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha muisi.<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Wanhu weng'ha wakupe ukulu, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">wanhu weng'ha wakutogole.<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>Isi nailavya mbena zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, nakatutambichiza.<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Nguluwi yalutilile kututambichiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">Wanhu weng'ha muisi wamdumbe.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kusumya</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi. Lwimbo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Nguluwi kangwinuka na wang'honyo wa heye wangusambaluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">walingumzudila wangubilima kutali na heye.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Kota iyosi vyolilinguwembeluswa na mbeho, ndo vyoyalinguwawembelusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">kota ihota vyolilingusungulumuka vyoliwa habehi na chiluli, ndo wehile vyowalinguduma hali Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Ila watanganiche wangusangalala hali Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">wanguvinanga na kwimba kwa usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Mumwimbile Nguluwi, mlitogole itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">mumgongomanyile nzila ya heye yalingwendesa ng'hungugu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">Itagwa lya heye ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, msangalale hali heye.<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>Nguluwi yalingikala honhu ha heye helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">ndo mhaza wa walekwa na mwamizi wa wafililwe na walume wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Nguluwi kanguwahilula waliyeka leka wawe na ivyazi lya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">kanguwadoholela wanweng'hwa na kuwaleka welejehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">ila walingubelenhuka kanguwahilika kuli kugunuche.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>Gwa Nguluwi, louwalongole wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">vyouwele kuli majendo kula kuchiwala,<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>isi naikakama, ulanga naulagaza nhonya ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">kwa hegwe kuwa baho, Nguluwi wa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">ena, kwa hegwe kuwa baho, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>Gwa Nguluwi, nakuitowela isi nhonya nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">nakuisangalaza isi ya hegwe iwele itochile.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Wanhu wa hegwe nawapata amo honhu ha kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">gwa Nguluwi, nakuwapa chilyo wazunwa kwa kunoga kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>Mkulu nakalavya mzilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">wadala wenji nawawikula mbuli.<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>“Wandewa na wamizi wa hewo wangudwina vibi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">Wadala weng'ha wa haluga nawegawila vinhu vilawile kuli ngondo,<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>hanga hewo nawapona kuli kambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">nawabochela jimalukolo ja ng'hunda za sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">na mabawa gawo gangupulika kwa zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali vyoyawasambalule wandewa ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">kota seluji ilingugwa mchanya mwa chidunda cha Salimoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Chidunda cha Bashani ndo chidunda cha chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">chidunda cha Bashani china vinhembenhembe vihongoche,<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>lekachoni kwanguchonela fihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">chidunda choyachihagule Nguluwi yekalise mchanya mwake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Mkulu Nguluwi kochikala ako mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Mituka ja Nguluwi ndo makumi elufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">na maelufu ga maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Mkulu nakoya honhu ha heye helile kulawa Sinai.<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>Nakukwina kuchanya, nakuhola wapogozi wa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">nakubochela ndolendole kulawa kwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">mbaka kulawa kwa wanhu wabelenhuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Mkulu Nguluwi leka yekale ako.<verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yatogoligwe mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Hegwe kangutupapilaga mhomolo za hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">heye ndo Nguluwi wa ulohozi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Nguluwi wa hetwe ndo Nguluwi yawele kangutuloholaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">Mkulu Nguluwi yaliyeka ndo yalingulohola kulawa kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Nguluwi kovihondanga vitwi vya wang'honyo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">ena, vitwi vya wala walingibatilila nzila ihile.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Mkulu nakalonga, “Ndowahilula wang'honyo kulawa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">ndowahilula kulawa mgati mwa bahali,<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>ubije kuli danda ya wang'honyo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">najo mibwa ja hegwe jimyanje danda za hewo.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>Gwa Nguluwi, majendo ga hegwe ga kusumya goneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">majendo ga Nguluwi wa heni na mndewa, mbaka honhu ha heye helile.<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Kumwando walingwimba, kumbele walingutowa vinhu vya muziki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">hagati wahinza walingutowa ngoma ndodo.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Mumtogole Nguluwi kuli vilundo vikulu vya wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">“Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, hemwe walelwa wa Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Mwaluko ndo Benjamini, mdodo wa weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">hamba vilongozi wa Yuda na chilundo cha hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">hamba wakulu wa Sebuluni na Nafutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ulajile ludali lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">undewa wa hegwe wouutumiye kwa chiwalo cha hetwe,<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>kulawa kuli ng'handa ya hegwe, Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">kuwele wandewa wokuyila na ndolendole za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>Uling'hanuchile lila igongolo lilingikala milamba, Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">chilundo cha mibuguma na myana jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">mbaka wanhu wa isi azo wakupe lutogo na kodi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Uwasambalule awo wanhu walingugana ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Vinhu vya shaba vyokuya kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Wakushi wokugalila Nguluwi lufufu lwa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Hemwe wandewa wa isi, mumwimbile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">mumwimbile Mkulu nzimbo za lutogo,<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>mumwimbile heye yalingwendesa kuli ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">ulanga wa katali uwele kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">mumhulichize yobuma kota limlungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>Muwikule kuwala ludali lukulu lwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">heye kangulongoza mchanya mwa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">ludali lwa heye lwangoneka kuli ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>Gwa Nguluwi, hegwe ndo wa kukabusa kuli honhu ha hegwe helile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Ena, heye ndo Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Kanguwapaga wanhu wa heye ludali na mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Yatogoligwe Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwimba kwa Yunjiyunji. Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:1">mazi gafika msingo.<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Ndanguzulubila mgati mwa ndidimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">haduhu ne honhu ha kuwika magulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Nyinjila mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">ndanguholigwa na nhigu.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>Nhoka kutowa iyowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">na ikolomelo lya heni likala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">Meho ga heni gabilabila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">kuno ndikubeteza hegwe Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Wanhu wenji kusinda mnvili za heni ndo walingunzudila hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Wang'honyo walingugana kung'hopola ndo wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">awo walingunhowa kwa mbuli za udesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Ndaze, nyhilule chinhu chosihizile?<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Gwa Nguluwi, kwanguuzela upoka wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">nongwa za heni hambe zivisigwe kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>Walingitumbila kwa hegwe waleche kubasigwa soni kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">walingukupala waleche kudeula kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">gwa Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Kwa chiwalo cha hegwe mbasigwa soni lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">soni igubika kumeho kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Ndiwa mjenzi hali wang'holozangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">kalumbu na lumbu zangu hambe wanzele.<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>Maya ga ng'handa ya hegwe gamema kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">mbuli zeng'ha zihile zowalingukuditila hegwe zangufika heni.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Vyombele ndinyenyetela kwa kwesela kulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">wanhu nawang'ung'utila heni.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Vyovalile ivalo lya igunila kulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">hewo nawambeza.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Wanhu wanguheha heni mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">wagalile ujimbi wangijesa nzimbo za kumbeza heni.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Ila heni ndangukulanda hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">ung'hundile chondilanda mhela wougana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Gwa Nguluwi, kwa winji wa igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila unyidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">unyidichile kwa ulohozi wa kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Undohole kulawa kuli ndidimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">uleche kundeka nzibile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">undohole na awo walingunzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">umbiche kutali kulawa mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Uleche kundeka fichigwe na mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">ama nzibile mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">ama fichigwe na chilaga.<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unyidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">kwa kunoga kwa igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">umbuyile kwa winji wa isungu lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Uleche kumvisa heni, chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">unyidichile himahima, kwa vila ndangutunyigwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Umbuyile habehi na kungombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">undohole na wang'honyo wa heni wenji.<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Hegwe kwanguvizela vyondilingulijigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">kwanguvizela soni na kubezigwa vyovilingufika heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">kwa vila wang'honyo wa heni weng'ha hegwe kwanguwazela.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>Kubezigwa nakutwegula nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">nani ngozola ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">Nandimpala munhu wa kundajila isungu, ila nakwali haduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">nandimpala wa kunyhembuliza heni, ila simpatile.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Nawamha heni dunga iwe chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">londiwele na ng'halu nawamha heni sichi.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>Visaga vya hewo wawo hali hewo, viwagwilize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">viwe vinhu vya kuwagwiliza.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Meho ga hewo gawichigwe jiza leka walemwele kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">chila mhela uvidite vyuno vya hewo vibiniche.<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Uwaboholele ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">kuzudila kwa hegwe kuwafiche.<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>Kambi za hewo zilechigwe mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">yaleche kikala yoneche kuli mihema ja hewo.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Kwa vila hewo wanguwagaza wala uwazapile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">wangulonga kwa chiwalo cha magazo ga wala uwalumize.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Ukumbuchile nongwa kwa chila wihe wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">uwalemele ng'hatu kulechela kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>Uwose kuli chitabu cha wawele wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">waleche kuwa amo mli matagwa ga watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Ila heni ngazika na nda mtamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">unyinule, gwa Nguluwi, undohole.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Kwa lwimbo ndolitogola itagwa lya Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">ndomha ukulu kwa kulonga malumbo.<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Mbuli ayi yomnojeza ng'hatu Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">kusinda kumlavila nhambiko ya isenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">kusinda kumlavila ibuguma lyeng'ha likomu.<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Wazunwa wogona ago na kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">walingumpala Nguluwi wokangazwa nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwahulichizaga walihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">howasemwa ng'o wanhu wa heye wanweng'hwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Ulanga na isi vimtogole Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">bahali na vyeng'ha viwele amo, vimtogole.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Kwa vila Nguluwi koulohola muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na kujizenga kahi miji ja Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">Wanhu wochikala amo na kuihola,<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>walelwa wa vitumagwa wa heye woihalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">wala walingugana itagwa lya heye wochikala amo.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Lwimbo lwa Daudi lwa kukumbuchila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, undohole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:1">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uye himahima kunhanza.<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Walingugana kundumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wone soni na kudeula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">Awo walingugana ndumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">walingugana ndumile, wahiluche kumbele na kubezigwa.<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Awo walinguseka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">wahiluche kumbele kwa kulemwela kwa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Wala weng'ha walingukupala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">wasangalale na kutowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">Walinguugana ulohozi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">chila yumwe yalonje mazuwa gose, “Nguluwi ndo Mkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Ila heni mbele mzunwa na ndilihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">gwa Nguluwi, umbuyile himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Hegwe ndo mtanzi wa heni na mlohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kukawila.<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa wasekulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa hegwe ndangubilimila kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">uleche kundeka ne hado mbasigwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Kwa kutanganika kwa hegwe undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">uwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe na kundohola.<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Uwe kwa heni italawe lya kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">honhu hondibilimila chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">kwa vila hegwe ndo italawe na ngome ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Gwa Nguluwi wa heni, undohole kulawa mmoko mwa wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">kulawa kuli ndole za walinguleka hachi na wang'hang'hale.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>Kwa vila hegwe Mkulu ndo kitumbila kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">kitumbila kwa heni gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kulawa kuli usongolo wa heni,<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>nandikutumbila hegwe kulawila lomhondigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">ndo hegwe undavile mmunda mwa mayangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">Ndokutogola mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Nandiwa munhu wa kububuwaza kwa wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">ila hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kubilimila hemile nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>Mlomo wa heni umema lutogo lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">na ukulu wa hegwe nemisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>Mhela wa kulala uleche kunhoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">uleche kundeka mong'ho wa heni houmala,<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>kwa vila wang'honyo wa heni wangulonga vibi kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">nawo walingugana kung'hopola wangiwika goya,<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>wolonga, “Nguluwi nakamleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">mumuwinze na kumibata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">kwa vila haduhu wa kumlohola.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uleche kuwa kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">gwa Nguluwi wa heni, uye himahima kunhanza.<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Weng'ha walingundonjeleza wabasigwe soni na kudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">walingugana kundumiza wabasigwe soni na kudeula.<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>Ila heni ndowa na kitumbila mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">ndokutogola lukami.<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Mlomo wa heni wolonga madito ga hegwe ga hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">ndowikula nemisi yeng'ha madito ga hegwe ga ulohozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">hanga ago ndo mzidi wa nyhala za heni.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Ndolonga madito ga hegwe makulu, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">ndowakumbusa kota hegwe uliyeka ndo utanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Gwa Nguluwi, hegwe nakundangusa kulawa usongolo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">ndangulutilila kuwikula madito ga hegwe ga vinduzanduza.<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uleche kundeka hondiwa ndalile ndiwele na mbuliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mbaka ndiluwikulile lulelo lulinguya mong'ho wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mong'ho wa hegwe kwa weng'ha walinguya.<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Gwa Nguluwi, hachi ya hegwe naifika mbaka kuchanya mwa ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">hegwe uwele nakudita mbuli ng'hulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Gwa Nguluwi, whaani yawele kota hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>Nakundita mbone magazo menji ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">ila konyhilusila kahi ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">hegwe konyhilula kahi kulawa ako hasi.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Konyonjezela kuhulichizwa kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">na kunyhembuliza kahi.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Ndokutogola kahi kwa ching'weleng'wele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">kwa chiwalo cha kukundigwa kwa hegwe, gwa Nguluwi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">Ndokwimbila lutogo kwa igombogombo, hegwe Welile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Ndotowa iyowe kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">hondikwimbila lutogo lwa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">na nhumbula ya heni yokutogola kwa vila nakungombola.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Ndolonga kutanganika kwa hegwe nemisi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">kwa vila wowaganile kundumiza nawabasigwa soni na kudeuzwa.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s">Kumlandila mndewa</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa Solomoni.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, umtambichize mndewa yamule kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">umhe mwana wa mndewa kutanganika kwa hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>yalongoze wanhu wa isi ya hegwe kwa kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">na walingugazigwa kwa hachi.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Vidunda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">72:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Vidunda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wasomile wangijesa kota ayi ndo picha ya wasenga walingigala mbuli kwa mndewa.</char></note> viwegalile kikala goya wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">vidunda viwegalile kutanganika.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Mndewa yawalewele wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">yawatanze wana wa walihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">na kuwahonda walingubunza.<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>Mndewa yekale mihela minji kota isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">na kota nyelezi kukolela lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Yawe kota upesi ulingunojeza migunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">kota nhonya ilingutowa kuli misanga.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Watanganiche wakule goya kuli ukomu wa hewo weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">na kikala goya kwa winji mbaka nyelezi hoiduma.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>Yalongoze kulawa bahali mbaka bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">kulawa lwanda lwa Eyufulate mbaka kuli kuduma kwa isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Wang'honyo wa heye walingikala kuli chiwala wanyenyetele hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">walingitwanza na heye wafugame mbaka wamyanje nhimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Wandewa wa Talishishi na vihilwa wamhe kodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">wandewa wa Sheba na Seba wamigalile ndolendole.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Wandewa weng'ha wa isi wamfugamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wamkolele mijito.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Kangumlohola munhu yalihela chinhu yalingumlanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">na yalingugazigwa yawele kahela wa kumtanza.<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Kanguwonela isungu ng'hochele na walihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">kangulohola ukomu wa walihela chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>Kanguwagombola kuwele na kubunza na kitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">kwa vila danda ya hewo ndo chinhu chikulu ng'hatu kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Mndewa yekale kwa mihela minji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">yabochele ndolendole ya zahabu kulawa Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">wanhu wamlandile kwa Nguluwi mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na kumganila utambichizo nemisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Isi ilele nyhule kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">mbaka kuli vinhembenhembe vya vidunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Vidunda vimeme mbena kota ya Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">wanhu wa kuli miji wakule goya kota misolo.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Itagwa lya mndewa likale mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">lizeleche kwa mihela minji isanya holikwaka.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 72:17"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Kukolela heye wanhu wa isi zeng'ha watambichizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">wanhu weng'ha wamcheme yawele yatambichizwe.<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">yawele heye yaliyeka kanguditaga vinduzanduza.<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Itagwa lya heye lyelile litogoligwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">ukulu wa heye umeme kuli isi zeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Ena! Ena!<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Kuduma kwa kulanda kwa Daudi, mwana wa Yese.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cha Kadatu</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 73:-1-89">Zabuli 73-89</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Hachi yolongoza</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Ndangukomya, Nguluwi ndo yanojile kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">ndo yanojile kwa wanhu welile mnhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Behi ng'hatu ndahakwang'wale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">hado hela ndahatelele,<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>kwa vila nandiwonela fihi walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">londiwene mbuli za wehile zangulutilila goya.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Kwa vila hewo hambe wafichigwe na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">ng'huli za hewo za goya na nazineneha.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Magazo ga wanhu hagawafichile hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">hawasumbuligwe kota wanhu wanji.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Kidaya kuwa ugasi wa hewo misingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">kitowa ndo kota nguwo za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Meho ga hewo gangumemaga wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">nhumbula za hewo zangulavya majesa gehile.<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Wanguwalonjeleza wanji na kulonga gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">wangidaya na kiwika goya kubunza.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Kwa milomo ja hewo wangulonga kota wangulongoza kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">na kwa umyango wa hewo kota wangulongoza isi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Mbaka wanhu wa heye wanguwawinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">hambe wone choneche chihile kwa hewo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">na kukunda chila chowalingulonga.<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>Wangulonga, “Nguluwi howeza kuvizela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Ndaze, Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya howeza kuvizela choneche?”<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Ulole, wanhu wehile vyowawele!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">Wana chila chinhu na wangupata lufufu mzidi.<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Ndaze, ndilolela hihi hela welile mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">na kiyamila ndeche kudita gehile?<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>Nemisi yeng'ha nhowigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">chila mitondo nafichigwa na magazo.<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Wone ndahalonjile ago hazelu kota hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">ndahawele mwihe hali walelwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Lelo, nanjeza kijesa kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">ila nayali mbuli inamane kwa heni kutang'hula,<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>mbaka lonyinjile honhu ha hegwe helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">aho ndo ndivizela chowowafika wehile.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Ndangukomya hegwe kwanguwawika honhu kuli halingutelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">kwanguwadita wagwe na kudumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Wangudumigwa baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">na kusigwa kwa kukabusa.<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>Gwa Mkulu, houkwinuka, hewo wangwajilila baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">kota kulota mhela wa munhu kulilimka mitondo.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Lombone usungu mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">na kuhomwa kuli muhe,<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>nandali yasowile nyhala na mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">nandali kota igongolo hali hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Ila, gwa Nguluwi, nda hamwe na hegwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">kwangimbata moko na kunyimiza.<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>Hegwe kwangundongoza kwa ulanguso wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">hamba kombochela kuli ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Whaani yoweza kunhanza kilanga, wone hauwele hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Na muisi haduhuli chondilingugana ila hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>Hanga ndiwe ndilihela mong'ho kuli lukuli na kuli muhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">gwa Nguluwi, hegwe ndo italawe lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">hegwe ndo honhu ha heni mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Ulole! Yalingibagula na hegwe, ndangukomya kodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">yalingukulema kota mng'hondwa, komdumya.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Ila kwa heni, chondilingugana ndo kuwa habehi na Nguluwi hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kubilimila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">Ndowikula madito geng'ha gouditile.<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s">Kulombocheza kwa chiwalo cha kubomoligwa kwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Ilanguso lya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, lekachoni nakututoza ng'hatu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Lekachoni ng'halazi ya hegwe yangulutilila kuli ming'holo ja hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Uwakumbuchile wanhu wa hegwe uwagulile kulawa katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">nhanzi youigombole iwe ya hegwe, uhalizi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">uchikumbuchile chidunda cha Siyoni, honhu hawele nawali wikala.<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>Ukole na kulola mchanya mwa mahame aga ga mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">Wang'honyo nawawifya chila chinhu kuli ng'handa ya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Wang'honyo wa hegwe nawabuma kusumya kuli ng'handa ya hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">Nawawika amo bendela za hewo za kusumya.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Wangiwhana na walingugoda ngodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">walingutema ngodi kwa miwago ja hewo.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Nawabenanga vinoligo vya mbawo vya ng'handa ya Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">kwa miwago na nyundo za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Nawahasoma honhu helile ha hegwe kwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">nawahaliga ng'hatu hala honhu houlingufugamilwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Nawalonga mnhumbula za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">“Towahonda ng'hatu!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">Nawahoma chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">hawele Nguluwi nayali yofugamilwa kuli isi.<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Hatulingona kahi ulajilo wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">twahela kahi mloli yoneche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">Hatulinguvizela kota yowa ahi mbaka hanili.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Gwa Nguluwi, mbaka hanili mng'honyo kokuseka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Ndaze, woliliga itagwa lya hegwe mazuwa gose?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Lekachoni nakuuvisa moko wa hegwe wa kudilo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Lekachoni hambe ugolole moko wa hegwe kuwadumya?<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Ila hegwe Nguluwi ndo mndewa wa hetwe kulawa katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">nakuwalohola wanhu kuli isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>Kwa mong'ho wa hegwe nakuigawanula bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">nakuvihonda vitwi vya mizoka ja bahali.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>Hegwe nakuhondanga vitwi vya linhu Lewiyatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">nakujipa migongolo ja kuchiwala itufi lyake.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>Hegwe nakudita nzasa na vikolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">nakuzidita nzanda ng'hulu zikale.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>Nemisi ndo ya hegwe na nechilo ndo ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">nakuwika nyelezi na isanya honhu hawo.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>Hegwe nakuwika mbaka jeng'ha ja isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">nakuwika mhela wa chipalangule na chipute.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ukumbuchile wang'honyo wa hegwe vyowakusechile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">wapoka wanguliliga itagwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Hetwe ndo ng'hochele kota ng'hunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">ahyo, uleche kujitozela migongolo jing'ang'ale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">uleche kuusemwa ukomu wa walingugazigwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>Ulikumbuchile ilagano lyouliditile na hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">kwa vila isi naimema kitowa chila honhu hawele na jiza.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Uleche kuwaleka walingutunywa wabasigwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">uwatambichize wazunwa na walihela chinhu walitogole itagwa lyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Gwa Nguluwi, wime wilewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">ukumbuchile wala vyowalingukubeza chila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Uleche kusemwa iyowe lya wang'honyo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">na ivuche lilingulutilila mazuwa gose lya walingitwanza na hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi ka mtagusa</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na “Uleche kuwifya.” Zabuli ya Asafu. Lwimbo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Twangulonga malumbo, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">twangulonga malumbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">Twanguwikula ukulu wa itagwa lya hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">na kusimila mbuli za madito ga hegwe makulu.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Nguluwi kangulonga, “Nambika mihela jondijihagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">kuli mihela ajo ndotagusa kwa hachi chila mhela.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Isi hoikakama na vyeng'ha viwele amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">heni ndo ndilingwimiza misisi jake.<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Ndanguwalonjela wawele walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">‘Mleche kidaya,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">na wehile, ‘Mleche kwinula mbalati kota namsumya.<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>Mleche kiwona kota mwa wanhu mtanganiche ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">ne kulonga ulonzi wa kidaya.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Kusumya hakulingulawa kolilawilaga isanya ne kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">ne kuchiwala ne kuli chidunda.<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>Nguluwi yuye ndo mtagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">kangumdulisaga yumwe na kumkwiniza yunji.<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangibata chizombe mmoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">chimemile divai ing'ang'ale ya ng'halazi ya heye, kanguijida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">Kukomya wehile weng'ha wanguinwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">ena, wanguinwa mbaka kuduma.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Ila heni ndowikula mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">ndomwimbila lutogo Nguluwi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Kowifya ludali lweng'ha lwa wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">ila mong'ho wa watanganiche kowimiza nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangusumya</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa vinhu vya ng'weso za muziki. Zabuli ya Asafu. Lwimbo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Nguluwi kanguzeleka ako Yuda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:1">itagwa lyake ndo likulu kuli Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>Haluga ha heye ndo ako Salemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">76:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Salemu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Salemu ndo itagwa liyage kwa Yelusalemu.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">honhu ha heye ha kikala ako Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>Ako nakabena misale ja wang'honyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">nakabena ngawo na ipanga na vinhu vya kitowela ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>Gwa Nguluwi, kuna lutogo ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">louhiluche kulawa kuli vidunda, louwasumile wang'honyo wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Wawele na mong'ho nawasukulwa vinhu vya hewo navyowaholile kuli ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">lelo nawawasa usinjizi wa kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">wazidahe kitowa ngondo hawawezile kitowa ne hado.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Gwa Nguluwi wa Yakobo, louwang'hanuchile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">falasi na wakwina falasi nawawasa usinjizi wa kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Gwa Nguluwi, hegwe uliyeka ndo wa kukabusa ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">Whaani yoweza kwima hali hegwe houzudila?<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>Nakuuwikula utaguso wa hegwe kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">isi naidumba na kunyamalila,<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>hegwe Nguluwi, mhela lowinuche kudita utaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">kuwalohola weng'ha walingubunzwa muisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>Kuzudila kwa wanhu kwangwambuza hela lutogo kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">houwika goya ng'halazi ya hegwe isigale.<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Mumwenezele Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe kulagana kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">hemwe muwele habehi mumhe ndolendole Nguluwi wa kukabusa.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>Heye kangubenaga muhe wa wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">kanguwakabusaga wandewa wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s">Kumpala Nguluwi mhela wa magazo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Yedutuni. Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Ndangumlilila Nguluwi leka yanhanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">ndangumlilila Nguluwi leka yanyhuliche.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Mhela wa magazo ndangumlanda Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">ndangumgololela moko ga heni nechilo ne kutoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">hambe mhegwe usangalalo woneche kwa munhu.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Vyondimkumbuchile Nguluwi na kung'ung'uta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">vyonjesile nanweguka nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Wangundemeza mbaka kuwa na usinjizi ne hado,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">ndangusanzalima mbaka ndangulemwela kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Nandijesa mazuwa ga katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">ndangujikumbuchila miyaka ja aho katali.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Nechilo ndangukumbuchila na kupala mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">ndangijesa na kiwuza kuli muhe.<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>“Ndaze, Mkulu nakatulema ng'hatu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">Ndaze, hotonela isungu kahi?<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>Ndaze, igano lya heye lya kwimilila naliduma ng'hatu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Ndaze, hokweneza kahi malagano ga heye?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Ndaze, Nguluwi nakasemwa kuwa na isungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">Ndaze, ng'halazi ya heye nayusa uliholile wa heye?”<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Hamba nandonga, “Chilingundumiza ng'hatu ndo kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya halingudita kahi chinhu kwa chiwalo cha hetwe.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>Ndogakumbuchila madito ga hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">ena, ndovikumbuchila vinduzanduza vya hegwe vya aho katali.<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Ndochijesa kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">na kijesa kwa chiwalo cha madito ga hegwe makulu.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>Chila choulingudita gwa Nguluwi, ndo chelile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">Ndo mlungu wachi yawele mkulu kota Nguluwi wa hetwe?<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Hegwe ndo Nguluwi ulingudita vinduzanduza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">hegwe nakuwalajila wanhu wa isi mong'ho wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Kwa moko wa hegwe uwele na mong'ho nakuwagombola wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">nakuwagombola walelwa wa Yakobo na Yusufu.<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>Mazi vyogakuwene, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">mazi vyogakuwene, nagadumba lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">ena, bahali naikakama mbaka hasi ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Ng'hungugu nailavya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">kubuma nakwaluka kuli ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">milapi ja chiluli najimwemwesa chila ubanzi.<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Lizi lya kubuma kwa hegwe nalulawila kuli chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">lumwemwesa lwa hegwe nalulangazila isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">isi naikakama na kutigasika.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Hegwe nakuwika nzila ya hegwe mchanya mwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">nakujenda kukolela mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">ila nzayo za hegwe hazoneche hebu.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Nakuwalongoza wanhu wa hegwe kota ming'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">kuli ulongozi wa Musa na Aluni.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s">Lulonjele lulelo lulinguya</para>
  <para style="d">(Ilanguso lwa Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>10 Mhulichize malanguso ga heni, hemwe wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">muwiche goya makutu kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi wa mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>Ndogabula mlomo wa heni kwa nhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">ndouwika hazelu ulonzi uvisigwe kulawa katali,<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>mbuli zotuzihuliche na kuzizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">mbuli ziwele wasekulu wa hetwe nawatusimila.<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>Hatuwavisa wana wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">ila tolusimila lulelo lulinguya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">madito makulu ga Mkulu Nguluwi na ludali lwa heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">towalonjela vinduzanduza vya heye vyoyaditile.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>Nakawapa walelwa wa Yakobo malajizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">nakawika mizilo kuli Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">jiwele nakawalajiza wasekulu wa hetwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">wawalanguse wana wa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>leka wanhu wa lulelo lulinguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">wana wawele wopondigwa hamba wagazele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">nawo kahi wawazelese wana wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>Wamuwichile Nguluwi kitumbila kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">waleche kusemwa madito ga Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">ila webate malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>Waleche kuwa kota wasekulu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">wanhu wawele na nhumbula zigagadale na walingubelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">lulelo luwele haluwele na majesa gemile nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">luwele haluwele lwa kukundigwa kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Wanhu wa Efulaimu, mipinde na misale mmoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">nawahiluka kumbele, nawabilima zuwa lila lya ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Hawalibatilile ilagano lya Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">nawalema kuwinza malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>Nawasemwa mbuli zoyawele yaziditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">vinduzanduza vyoyawele yawalajile.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>Nakadita vinduzanduza hali wasekulu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">kuli ibalalika lya Soani, kuli isi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>Nakaigawanula bahali na kuwadita waloche amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">nakagadita mazi geme kota lukanzi.<verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>Nemisi nakawalongoza kwa ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">nechilo yeng'ha kwa lumwemwesa lwa chiluli.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>Nakatula mitalawe ako kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">nakawanweza mazi kulawa kuli mazi menji kota bahali.<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>Nakadita vikolola vilavye mazi kulawa kuli italawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">na kugadita mazi gachililiche kota lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Ila nawalutilila kumditila gehile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">nawambelenhuka Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya kula kugunuche.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>Nawamjeza Nguluwi kwa kunuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">wolanda kupegwa chilyo chowaganile.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Nawamkovula Nguluwi wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">“Ndaze, Nguluwi koweza kutigalila chilyo kuchiwala?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>Kwa kukomya, nakatowa italawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">mazi nagachililika kota lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">ila ndaze, kanguweza kutigalila mibumunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">na kuwegalila wanhu wa heye miwunde?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Mkulu Nguluwi naloyahuliche ago, nayali yamemile kuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">chiluli nachaka kwa walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">ng'halazi ya heye naiwavaba wanhu wa Isilaeli,<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>kwa vila hawamkundile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">ne kuukunda mong'ho wa heye wa kulohola.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>Ila nakalajiza ng'hungugu ya kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">nakachumula lwizi lwa kilanga,<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>nakawadulisila mana leka walye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">nakawapa nyhule kulawa kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Wanhu nawalya chilyo cha wahilisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">naye nakawegalila chilyo cha kuhega.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>Nakegala mbeho ya kolilawilaga isanya kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">kwa ludali lwa heye nakambuza mbeho ya kusini ipute,<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>nakawagalila wanhu wa heye miwunde kota nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">videje vinji kota sangalaza ya mhwani.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>Videje avyo navigwa hali kambi ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">chila honhu kuzunguluta haluga ha hewo.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Wanhu nawalya na kiguta ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">Nguluwi nakawapa chowaganile.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Ila lowawele wang'hali kigutiza maya ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">chilyo lochiwele ching'hali kuli milomo ja hewo,<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>ng'halazi ya Nguluwi naiwafika hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">nakawakopola wawele na mong'ho hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">na kuwagwisa wasongolo wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>Ila nawalutilila kudita gehile hali Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">hanga nakadita vinduzanduza, ila hawakundile.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>Lelo, nakaduma mazuwa ga hewo kota lweselo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">miyaka ja hewo kwa kubagama baho du.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>Chila loyawakopole, wala waponile nawampala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">na kumhinduchila Nguluwi kwa nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>Nawakumbuchila kota Nguluwi nayali italawe lya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya nayali mgombozi wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Ila nawamhada kwa ulonzi wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">chila chowamlonjele nachali udesi.<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>Hawambatilile heye kwa nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">nahawawele wakukundigwa kuli ilagano lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Ila Nguluwi yawele na isungu nakaugubika wihe wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">hawadumye hebu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">Mihela minji nayali yoilemeza ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">nahakulechile kuzudila kwa heye kweng'ha kuwafiche.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>Nakakumbuchila kota hewo ndo wanhu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">ndo kota mbeho ilingukola na kwajilila.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Mala zilinga nawambelenhuka kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">na kumzudiza ako kugunuche?<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Nawamjeza Nguluwi chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">nawamzudiza ayo Yelile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>Hawalukumbuchile ludali lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">zuwa lila loyawagombole kwa wang'honyo wa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>naloyaditile mbuli za kububuwaza kuli isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">na vinduzanduza kuli ibalalika lya Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>Nakagalusa zila nzanda ziwa danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">Wamisili waleche kuwa na mazi ga kunwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>Nakawahilichila vilundo vya ng'onzi ziwele naziwatunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">na mibula jiwifile chila chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>Nakalajiza nzije, nazilya mbena za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">na kuwifya migunda ja hewo.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>Nakajiwifya mizabibu ja hewo kwa nhonya ya maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">na mitini ja hewo kwa chipute ching'ang'ale.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>Misenga ja hewo najikopoligwa kwa nhonya ya maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">na ming'holo ja hewo kwa lumwemwesa.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>Nakaleka ng'halazi ya heye iwafiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">kuzudila na nhumbula yihile na kugaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">na chilundo cha wahilisi wa kudumya.<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>Nakalechelela ng'halazi ya heye ilutilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">ne kuwawika kutali na kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">ila nakawadumya kwa utamwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>Nakawakopola walelwa wa mwaluko weng'ha wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">ena, wa mwaluko kuli kambi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>Hamba nakawahilika wanhu wa heye kota ming'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">nakawalongoza kuchiwala kota chilundo cha migongolo ja kufujigwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>Nakawalongoza goya, nawo hawadumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">ila bahali naiwagubika wang'honyo wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>Nakawegala kuli isi ya heye yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">kuli chidunda choyachiholile kwa moko wa heye wa kudilo.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>Nakawawinga wanhu wa isi hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">nakazilavya isi za hewo ziwe za Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">nakaziwika nhanzi za Isilaeli hali honhu ha hewo.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Ila nawamjeza na kumbelenhuka Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">ne kibatilila malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Ila nawahinduka na kudita gehile kota wasekulu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">nawali wohambe wetumbilwe kota upinde wohauwele nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Nawamzudiza kwa honhu hawo ha kulavila nhambiko ha milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">nawamdita yawe na fihi kwa jimalukolo jawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>Nguluwi loyagawene ago, nakazudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">nakailema ng'hatu Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>Nakalileka ihema lyelile lya heye ako Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">haluga hawele nayali yekale hagati ha wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>Nakalileka isanduku, ulajilo wa mong'ho wa heye, liholigwe kuli isi ya chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">ukulu wa heye uwichigwe mmoko mwa wang'honyo.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>Nakawazudila wanhu wa heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">nakawalavya wadumigwe kwa ipanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Chiluli nachiwalakaza wasongolo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">wahinza wa hewo nawali walihela wanhu wa kuwahesa.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Watambika wa hewo nawabagama kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">wadala wa hewo wafililwe na walume wawo hawawezile kulombocheza.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Hamba Mkulu nakalilimka kota munhu yolawa kuli usinjizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">kota munhu yazidahe kitowa ngondo yanwele divai,<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>Nakawawinga wang'honyo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">nakawabasa soni ya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>Nakailema nhanzi ya Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">haihagule nhanzi ya Efulaimu,<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>ila nakaihagula nhanzi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">na chidunda cha Siyoni choyachiganile.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>Nakazenga aho ng'handa ya heye ng'hulu kota ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">kota isi yoyaiwichile nzinzili mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>Nakamhagula Daudi, chitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">nakamusa kuli mijito ja kudima ming'holo.<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>Nakamlavya kuli mijito ja kudima ming'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">yawe na mijito ja kudima wanhu wa Yakobo, wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">yadime Isilaeli, wanhu wa Nguluwi yuye.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Daudi nakawadima kwa nhumbula ya heye yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">nakawalongoza kwa luhala lwa moko ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, wajenzi nawaivaba isi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">nawaidita iwe ikokomoche ng'handa ya hegwe yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">na kuudita muji wa Yelusalemu uwe mahame.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Nawajileka mitufi ja vitumagwa wa hegwe jiwe chilyo cha videje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">ng'huli za wanhu wa hegwe ziwe chilyo cha migongolo ja kisolo.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Nawabohola danda kota mazi hali honhu ha muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">nawawichigwa amo na haduhuli wa kuwatila.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Natubaswa soni kwa wanhu wa isi za habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">walingikalasa habehi na hetwe wangutuseka na kutubeza.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndaze, kozudila mbaka mazuwa gose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Ng'halazi ya hegwe ya fihi yokwaka kota chiluli mbaka hanili?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Uwaboholele wajenzi ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">ena, isi zeng'ha zohambe zilicheme itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Kwa vila nawammela Yakobo, nhanzi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">nawahalakaza ng'hatu haluga ha heye.<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>Uleche kutugaza kwa chiwalo cha nongwa za wasekulu wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">Isungu lya hegwe lituyile himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">kwa vila twangugazigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Ututanze, gwa Nguluwi, mlohozi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwa lutogo lwa itagwa lyako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">utulohole na kugagubika gehile ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Lekachoni isi zitulonjele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">“Kakohi Nguluwi wa hemwe?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Ututambichize tulole vyoulinguwahilulila chibida wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">kwa kukopoligwa kwa vitumagwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Chililo cha hewo wanweng'hwa chikufichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">kwa ludali lwa hegwe lukulu uwalohole wowatagusigwe kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Wanhu awo wa isi wawele habehi, gwa Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">wahilusilwe kubezigwa mala saba.<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Natwe wanhu wa hegwe, tuwele ming'holo ja chilundo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">tolonga malumbo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">kulawa lulelo mbaka lulelo tokutogola.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na yunjiyunji. Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Uhulichize, gwa Mdimi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">ulinguwalongoza walelwa wa Yusufu kota ming'holo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">Hegwe ulingulongoza hali vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">ulangaze <verse eid="PSA 80:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>hali Efulaimu na Benjamini na Manase.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 80:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">Ulajile ludali lwa hegwe, uye kutulohola.<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>Gwa Nguluwi utuhiluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">utulole kwa kunoga, natwe toloholigwa.<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi uwele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">mbaka hanili kokuzudila kulanda kwa wanhu wa hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Nakudita masinzo gawe chilyo cha hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">nakutunweza mahozi kwa winji.<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Nakutudita tubezigwe na wotulingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">wang'honyo wa hetwe wangutuseka.<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi uwele na Mong'ho, utuhiluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">utulole kwa kunoga, natwe toloholigwa.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Hegwe nakigala mzabibu kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">nakuwawinga wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">na kuunyala kuli isi ya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>Nakuulolela goya leka ukule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">najo mizabi najiluta hanyi ng'hatu na kwenela kweng'ha muisi.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>Nakuvigubika vidunda kwa isisila lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">nhagala zake nazigubika mielezi mikulu.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>Nhagala zake nazenela mbaka kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">mizuchila jake mbaka hafungo mwa lwanda lwa Eyufulate.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Lekachoni nakubomola lukanzi lulinguzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">lelo chila yalingukola mnzila kangukwanyula zabibu zake?<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Migubi ja kisolo janguuwifya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">na migongolo ja kisolo janguudakula.<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Utuhinduchile kahi, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi uwele na Mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">Ulole kulawa kilanga, wone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">ukaulolele mzabibu awo.<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Ulyamile izuchila lyoulinyalile kwa moko wa hegwe wa kudilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">alyo izuchila lyoulimize nzinzili gwegwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>Mzabibu wa hegwe naudumuligwa na kulakazwa kwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">vyouwang'hanuchila, wanhu wa hegwe wangudumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Moko wa hegwe wa kudilo umwamile ayo youmganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">ayo youmhagule kwa chiwalo cha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>Hamba hatukuleka na kukubelenhuka kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">ututambichize ukomu, natwe tolichema itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi uwele na Mong'ho, utuhiluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">utulole kwa kunoga, natwe toloholigwa.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa mnvina</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Gititi. Lwimbo lwa Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Mumwimbile kwa usangalalo Nguluwi, mong'ho wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:1">mumtowele iyowe lya kusangalala Nguluwi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Mtowe iyowe lya kwimba lwimbo lwa kusangalala, mtowe ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">mvine igombogombo na ching'weleng'wele cha lizi linojile.<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>Mpembe mhalamhanda kuwikula kulawila kwa nyelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">na kahi nyelezi ikangale, mhela wa mnvina ya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Awo ndo mzilo kuli Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">alyo ndo ilajizo lya Nguluwi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Nakawika liwe kota ilajizo kwa Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">hoyaitowile isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">ako natuhulika ndonga yohatuizelele.<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>Nakalonga, “Heni ndizilavya mhomolo za hegwe mmayega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">nandikusila mitufali jouholile mmoko.<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>Louwele kuli magazo nakunyhema, nani nandikulohola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">Nandikwidichila londiwele kuli kivisa kuli kubuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">Nandikujeza kuli mazi ga Meliba.<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Hemwe wanhu wa heni, mhulichize ikanyo lya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">Wone wahanyhulichize, gwa Isilaeli!<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>Yaleche kuwa kwa hegwe mlungu wa chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">uleche kumfugamila mlungu yunji.<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">ndikulavile kulawa kuli isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">Ugabule mlomo wa hegwe, nani ndokupa chilyo.<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>“Ila wanhu wa heni hawanyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Isilaeli halingunyhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Ahyo nandiwaleka wapone na nhumbula za hewo zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">wawinze majesa ga hewo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Wone wanhu wa heni wahanyhulichize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">Wone Isilaeli yahawinzile nzila ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>Ndahawasumile wang'honyo wa hewo himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">ndahagolole moko wa heni kwa chiwalo cha wang'honyo wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>Wala walingumzudila Mkulu Nguluwi wahawele wakukabuswa hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">na magazo ga hewo gahawele ga mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Ila hegwe ndahakupele chilyo kwa ngano inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">ndahakugutize kwa hanombwa inonile.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi chilongozi mkulu</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Nguluwi kangwimilila chitala chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">kangulavya utaguso kuli nhing'hano ya milungu,<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>“Mbaka hanili molutilila kutagusa ne hachi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">na kuwaganilila wanhu wehile?<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Muwape ng'hochele na walekwa hachi za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">mwamile hachi za walingubunzwa na wazunwa.<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Muwalohole ng'hochele na wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">muwalohole kulawa kuli ndole za wehile.<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>“Ila milungu ndo mipoka na hajivizelele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">Hewo wangujenda kuli jiza lya kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">misisi jeng'ha ja hachi kuli isi najitigaswa.<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>Heni nandonga, ‘Hemwe mwa milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">mweng'ha mwa wana wa Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Ila mobagama kota wanhu wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">mogwa kota mkulu yoneche.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Gwa Nguluwi winuche, uzitaguse isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">kwa vila wanhu wa isi zeng'ha ndo wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuwasumya wang'honyo wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo. Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uleche kuwa tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:1">uleche kunyamalila gwa Nguluwi, ne kusindamala.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Lole wang'honyo wa hegwe wangudita ivuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">walingukuzudila wangwinula vitwi ne kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Wangiwika goya kwa wihe kuwaditila vibi wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">wangilongasa kwa chiwalo cha hewo ulinguwamila.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Wangulonga, “Muye tuwadumye wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">itagwa lya Isilaeli lileche kukumbuchilwa kahi.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Ena, wangikundiza kwa nhumbula imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">wangilaha kilumba hamwe leka kukulema.<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>Wanhu wa Edomu na Waishimaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">Wamoabu na wanhu wa Hagali,<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>wanhu wa Gebali na Amoni na Amaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">wanhu wa Filistiya na wenyeng'haye wa Tilo wangilumba,<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>mbaka Ashulu nailumba na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">nawekundiza kuwatanza walelwa wa Loti.<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Uwadite kota vyouwaditile wanhu wa Midiani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">vyouwaditile Sisela na Yabini kuli lwanda lwa Kishoni.<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>Wanhu wouwadumile kula Eni-doli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">nawali midohe mchanya mwa isi.<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>Uwadite wakulu wa hewo kota Olebu na Seebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">vilongozi wa hewo weng'ha kota Seba na Salimuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>wawele nawalonga, “Tochiholela honhu ha Nguluwi ha kudimila.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>Gwa Nguluwi wa heni, uwadite kota nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">kota mhumba zikalile zilinguholigwa na mbeho.<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Kota vila chiluli chilingulakaza chihulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">na milapi ja chiluli vyojilingulakaza vidunda,<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>uwabilimise hewo kwa chivuluvumbi cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">na kuwakabusa kwa mbeho ya hegwe ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>Uwadite wawe na soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">leka wakupale, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Wabasigwe soni na kusanzalima mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">wadumigwe kwa soni ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>Wavizele kota hegwe, uwele itagwa lya hegwe ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">hegwe uliyeka ndo Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya yalingulongoza isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s">Kugana kuwa kaye kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Gititi. Zabuli ya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Kaye kwa hegwe ndo kunoga ng'hatu, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Muhe wa heni wangugana ng'hatu mbaka ndangwisilwa mong'ho kwa chiwalo cha haluga ha Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">Nhumbula na lukuli lwa heni lweng'ha, vyeng'ha vyangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi yawele mkomu.<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Mbaka videje viwa na kaye kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">videje navigongomanya vimvulila vyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">amo naviwika mibofu jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">habehi na honhu ha hegwe ha kulavila nhambiko, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">mndewa wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Nawatambichizwa wala walingikala kaye kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">wokwimba mazuwa gose lutogo lwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Nawatambichizwa wala walinguwa na mong'ho kulawa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">walingugana kuluta kujendela mchidunda cha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Howokola kuli ibindi lya Baka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">kwanguliditaga liwe honhu ha nzasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">na nhonya za luhela zangumemezaga milamba.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>Wangulutilila kuwa na mong'ho ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">womona Nguluwi ako Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>Uhulichize kulanda kwa heni, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">umbichile goya ikutu lya hegwe, gwa Nguluwi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Gwa Nguluwi, umlole kwa kunoga ngawo ya hetwe, mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">umlole kwa uganililo youmbakalize mafuta.<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Zuwa limwe hela haluga ha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">fola kusinda mazuwa elufu honhu hanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">fola kwima hali lwizi lwa ng'handa ya hegwe Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kusinda kikala kuli mihema ja wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo isanya lya hetwe na ngawo ya hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">heye kangutuditaga tuwe na kunoga na ukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">Hambe yawalemeze kuwa na choneche chiwele chinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">wala walingikala ne nongwa.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">katambichizwa yula munhu yalingitumbila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kupegwa kahi kunoga kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Wakola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">nakuipa kunoga kwa hegwe isi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">nakumhilulila kahi Yakobo utambichizo wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Nakuigubika nongwa ya wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">nakusa gehile ga hewo geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>Nakulemeza kuzudila kwa hegwe kweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">nakuileka ng'halazi ya hegwe ing'ang'ale.<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>Utuhiluse kahi, gwa Nguluwi mlohozi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">wuse kuzudila kouwelenako kwa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Ndaze, kotuzudila hetwe mbaka mazuwa gose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Ndaze, kolutiliza ng'halazi ya hegwe kwa lulelo lweng'ha?<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>Ndaze, hambe utuhilusile kahi ukomu unyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">leka wanhu wa hegwe wasangalale kwa chiwalo cha hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>Utulajile igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">utupe ulohozi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Ndohulichiza choyalingulonga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">kwa vila kangulagana kuwapa wanhu wa heye kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">vitumagwa wa heye yuye wone woleka kuwila kahi upoka.<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Kukomya kowalohola walingumdumba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">leka ukulu wa heye ulutilile kikala kuli isi ya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa vyoting'hana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">kutanganika na kikala goya vyochilamsa.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Kukundigwa kozuchila kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">kutanganika kolola hasi kulawa kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kolavya chiwele chinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">isi ya hetwe yolavya mbena nyinji.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Kutanganika komlongola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">na kumuwichila goya nzila ya heye.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kulanda kwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mbichile goya ikutu lya hegwe, unyidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">kwa vila heni ndo mzunwa na ndilihela chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Uwamile ukomu wa heni kwa vila ndangukukunda hegwe Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">undohole heni chitumagwa wa hegwe ndilingukutumbila.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>Hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">lelo, umbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">kwa vila ndangukuchema nemisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Usangalaze heni mbele chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">kwa vila kulanda kwa heni ndangigala kwa hegwe Mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Gwa Mkulu, hegwe ndo unojile na kwanguwalechela wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">kuna winji wa igano lya kwimilila kwa weng'ha walingukuchema.<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ukuwichile goya ikutu lya hegwe kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">ukuhuliche kulila kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>Mazuwa ga kugazika ndangukuchema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">kwa vila hegwe kwangunyidichila.<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Gwa Mkulu, haduhu Nguluwi yawele kota hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">haduhu yalinguweza kudita goulingudita hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha uwalumbile, wokuya kukufugamila, gwa Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">wowikula ukulu wa itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Hegwe ndo mkulu, kwangudita vinduzanduza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">hegwe uliyeka ndo Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undanguse nzila ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">leka ndiwe wa kukundigwa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">umhe nhumbula ya kukuwinza hegwe uliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">leka ndikudumbe.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Gwa Mkulu, Nguluwi wa heni, ndokutogola kwa nhumbula yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">ndowikula ukulu wa itagwa lya hegwe mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila kwa heni ndo linji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">Nakundohola kulawa hasi kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Gwa Nguluwi, wanhu walingidaya wangunhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">chilundo cha wanhu wang'ang'ale wangugana kung'hopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">hambe wakudumbe hegwe ne hado.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Ila hegwe Mkulu, ndo Nguluwi wa kunoga na isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">hulinguzudila himahima, kuna winji wa igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Unyhinduchile, umbonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">umhe heni mong'ho wa hegwe, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">undohole mbele mwana wa mpogozi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undajile ulajilo wa kunoga kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">leka wala walingunzudila walole na kubasigwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">kwa vila nakunhanza na kunyhembuliza.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo lwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Wakola. Lwimbo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Nguluwi nakazenga muji wa heye mchanya mwa chidunda cha heye chelile.<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguugana muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">kusinda kaye kuyage kwa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Mbuli ng'hulu zangulonjigwa kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, gwa muji wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>“Hali wala walingunzela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">wa baho wanhu wa Misili na Babuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">hihyo du wanhu wa Filistiya na Tilo na Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">weng'ha wolonga, ‘Ayu nakapondigwa ako Siyoni.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Kuwala Siyoni yolonjigwa ahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">“Siyoni ndo mamo wa wala weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya koutawiza.”<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kokwandika kuli chitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">hoyowika kukumbuchila kwa wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">“Ayu nakapondigwa ako Siyoni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Weng'ha wanguvina ngoma na kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">“Nzasa za heni zeng'ha za kwa hegwe.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s">Chililo cha kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Wakola. Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Kwa kiwhana na Mahalati Nealoti. Ilanguso lya Hemani Mwesila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mlohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">ndangulila nemisi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">na nechilo ndangukulanda.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Kulanda kwa heni kukufichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">uhulichize chililo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Kugazika kwinji nakufika heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">nani nda habehi kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Ndangoneka kota munhu yalingudulika kuli ikulubila likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">mong'ho wa heni weng'ha naumalila.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Nandechigwa hali wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">kota wakopoligwe wawele kuli chilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">kota wala wawele hegwe hambe uwakumbuchile kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">wawele nawabaguligwa na kwamilwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Nakunhoza kuli ikulubila likulu lilutile hanyi ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">hali honhu ha mgati ng'hatu hawele na jiza.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>Ng'halazi ya hegwe naiwa itunyo ikulu kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">nakungubika kwa nhigu za hegwe zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Nakuwadita goloko wa heni webagule na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">nakundita ndiwe izudizo kwa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">Ndiwopigwa mgati, siweza hebu kusulupuka,<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>meho ga heni ndo ng'hochele kwa masinzo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 88:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">Chila zuwa ndangukulilila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">ndangukugololela moko ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Ndaze, hegwe kwanguwaditilaga wabagame kububuwaza kwa hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Ndaze, muhe wa wabagame wangwinukaga na kukutogola?<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>Ndaze, igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe lyangudamligwa kuli chilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">ama kukundigwa kwa hegwe kuli haluga ha kudumya?<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Ndaze, kububuwaza kwa hegwe kwanguzeleka amo kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">ama kutanganika kwa hegwe kuli isi ya wasemwigwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>Ila heni ndangukulilila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">chila mitondo ndangukugalila kulanda kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Lekachoni, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwangundema?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">Hambi lekachoni kwanguvisa heni kumeho kwa hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Nangazika na kuhejelela kubagama kulawa kuli usongolo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">nangazika kwa ukabuso wa hegwe, nhoka lukami.<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Kuzudila kwa hegwe kufichila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">kutowa kwa hegwe kwa kukabusa kwangundumya.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Kwangunzunguluta kota mazi tendema nemisi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">gangunzunguluta chila ubanzi.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Nakuwadita goloko na wayangu weng'ha wambagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">jiza ndo liwa miyangu hela.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s">Mhela wa kugazika kwa wanhu wa isi</para>
  <para style="d">(Ilanguso lya Etani Mwesila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndokwimba igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">Ndowikula kuli lulelo lweng'ha kukundigwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Ndangulonga kota igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe lyangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">kukundigwa kwa hegwe kolutilila mazuwa gose kota ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Nakulonga, “Nandita ilagano na yahaguligwe wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">nandimlahila chitumagwa wa heni Daudi,<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>‘Mazuwa gose ndomuwika mlelwa wa hegwe yawe mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">kahi ndoulolela undewa wa hegwe mazuwa gose.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>Ulanga uvitogole vinduzanduza vya hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">kukundigwa kwa hegwe kutogoligwe hali nhing'hano ya welile.<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Whaani ako kilanga yoweza kiwhanizwa na hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">Whaani yawele kota hegwe hali vilumbigwe vya kilanga?<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Hegwe Nguluwi kwangudumbigwa kuli chitala cha welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">weng'ha walingukuzunguluta wangububuwazwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">whaani yawele na mong'ho kota hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">Kukundigwa kwa hegwe nakukuzunguluta banzi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Hegwe kwangulongoza kutiguka kwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">nhigu yake hoikwinuka, kwanguidita isindamale.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>Nakulihonda izoka Lahabu na kulikopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">nakuwasambalula wang'honyo wa hegwe kwa mong'ho wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>Ulanga ndo wa hegwe na isi ndo ya hegwe kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">isi zeng'ha na vinhu vyeng'ha vilimumo hegwe nakuvilumba.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Hegwe nakulumba kasikazini na kusini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">vidunda vya Taboli na Helimoni vyangukutogola kwa kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>Moko wa hegwe una mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">moko wa hegwe una mong'ho na nausumya.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>Kutanganika na hachi ndo msisi wa chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa vyangukulongola.<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>Nawatambichizwa wanhu walinguweza kukutowela luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">walingikala kuli lumuli lwa kumeho kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Wangusangalala nemisi yeng'ha kwa chiwalo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">na kukutogola kwa chiwalo cha kutanganika kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Hegwe ndo ukulu na mong'ho wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">kwa uganililo wa hegwe twanguwa na kusumya.<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe ndo mwamizi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">mndewa wa hetwe nakalawa kwa hegwe, gwa Welile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangulagana na Daudi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Katali nakulonga kuli kulota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">nakuwalonjela vitumagwa wa hegwe wa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">“Ndimha mong'ho yalingitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">ndimha ukulu ayo yondimhagule hali wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Nandimpata Daudi chitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">nandimbakaliza mafuta ga heni gelile.<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>Moko wa heni wa mong'ho wowa na heye mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">moko wa heni nene baha womwimiza nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>Wang'honyo hawoweza kumsumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">ne wehile hawomditila vibi.<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Ndowahonda walingitwanza na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">ndowadumya weng'ha walingumzudila.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Ndowa wa kukundigwa na yawele na igano lya kwimilila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">kwa itagwa lya heni kowa na kusumya kukulu.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Ndowimiza nzinzili undewa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">kulawa kuli bahali mbaka kuli lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>Heye konyhema, ‘Hegwe ndo mhaza wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">Nguluwi wa heni, italawe na ulohozi wa heni.’<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>Nani ndomdita yawe mlelwa wa heni wa mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">mkulu kusinda wandewa weng'ha muisi.<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Igano lya kwimilila lya heni ndomuwichila mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">na ilagano lya heni na heye lyochikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Ndodita lukolo lwa heye lwa chiundewa lwikale mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">na chigoda cha heye cha undewa kota ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>“Wone walelwa wa heye wogaleka malanguso ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">howochikala kwa kuleka utaguso wa heni,<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>wone wobena mizilo ja heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">na kuleka kuhulichiza malajizo ga heni,<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>aho ndowagaza kwa nongwa za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">ndowatowanga kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>Ila sikusa igano lya kwimilila lya heni kwa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">ne kuleka kukundigwa kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>Sibena ilagano lya heni na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">ne kugalula ulonzi wondonjile kwa mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>“Nandilaha kamwe hela kwa welile wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">nani hambe ndimlonjele Daudi udesi.<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>Ivyazi lya heye lyolongoza mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">na undewa wa heye kota isanya.<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>Lochikala mazuwa gose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">kota nyelezi vyoilingulawa kuli ulanga.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masinzo ga mndewa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>Ila sambi Gwa Nguluwi, nakumuwika kutali na hegwe na kumlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">nakumema ng'halazi kwa ayo youmbakalize mafuta.<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Nakusa ilagano lyouliwichile na ayo chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">nakutoza kofia ya undewa wa heye kuli nhimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>Lukanzi lweng'ha lwa muji wa heye nakubomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">ngome za heye nakuwifyanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>Weng'ha walingukola wanguhola lufufu lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">nakawa wa kubezigwa kwa walingikala habehi na heye.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Wang'honyo wa heye nakuwapa kusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">nakuwasangalaza.<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>Vinhu vya heye vya kitowa ngondo nakuviwifya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">nakumleka yalemwele kuli ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>Nakusa ukulu wa heye wa chiundewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">nakuchigwisa chigoda cha heye cha undewa.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Nakumpunguzila mazuwa ga usongolo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">nakumgubika kwa igolole lya soni.<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kikala goya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>Mbaka hanili? Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kochivisa mbaka mazuwa gose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Mbaka hanili ng'halazi ya hegwe yokwaka kota chiluli?<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Ukumbuchile ukomu wa heni vyouwele udo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">kota munhu youmlumbile kangikala kwa mhela uchefu.<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Whaani yalingikala ne kubagama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">Whaani yoweza kusulupuka kuli isi ya wabagame?<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Gwa Mkulu, lya kohi lelo igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">lyoumlahile Daudi kwa kukundigwa kwa hegwe?<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Gwa Mkulu, ukumbuchile vyowalingumliga chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">ndaze vyondilingwimilila maligo ga wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Lole vyowalingumseka, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">ndaze vyowalingumbeza yabakalizwe mafuta wa hegwe chila hoyoluta.<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">Ena! Ena!<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cha Kane</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 90:-1-106">Zabuli 90-106</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi wa mazuwa gose na munhu chilumbigwe</para>
  <para style="d">(Kulanda kwa Musa, munhu wa Nguluwi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>Gwa Mkulu, kulawa lulelo lweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">hegwe nakuwa kikala goya kwa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Loving'hali kuwa vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">louwele ung'hali kulumba isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">hegwe ndo Nguluwi, kulawa mazuwa gose mbaka mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>Kwangumlonjela munhu, “Uhiluche kuli nhimbwisi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">Naye munhu kanguhilukaga kuli nhimbwisi nakoyalawile.<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Kwa hegwe miyaka elufu ndo kota zuwa limwe hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">ndo kota zuwa likolile hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">kwa hegwe ndo kota mhela uchefu wa nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>Kwanguwajiliza wanhu kota kulota.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">Munhu ndo kota misolo jilinguzuchila mitondo.<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>Mitondo janguzuchilaga na kubahula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">ila matinazo janguswinhaga na kukala.<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Ng'halazi ya hegwe yangutudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">twangukabuswa na kuzudila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>Nongwa za hetwe nakuziwika kumwando kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">gehile ga hetwe ga chinyele ga hazelu hali hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe, ukomu wa hetwe wangwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">wangumala kota lweselo.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Miyaka ja kikala ndo makumi saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ama wone tuwe na mong'ho, makumi nane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ila geng'ha ndo magazo na kisinza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">Mazuwa gangupuluta himahima, natwe twangubilabila himahima.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Whaani yalinguvizela itunyo lya ng'halazi ya hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Kwa vila kuzudila kwa hegwe ndo kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">kota kudumba kotulinguganigwa kuwa nako kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>Utulanguse kuvizela kota ukomu wa hetwe ndo uchefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">leka tuwe na luhala.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwe na isungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Kozudila mbaka hanili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Utonele isungu hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Utugutize igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe mitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">tutowe luchenze na kusangalala kuli ukomu wa hetwe weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Ututambichize lelo miyaka minji ja kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">kota vyoutupele miyaka minji ja magazo na kisinza.<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Utulajile madito ga hegwe hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">uwalajile walelwa wa hetwe ludali lwa hegwe lwa ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Uganililo wa hegwe, gwa Mkulu, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">chotulingudita uchiwiche chiwe goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">ena, uchiwiche goya chila chotulingudita.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi mwamizi wa hetwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>Heye yalingikala hali honhu ha kikala goya ha Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">kokwesela kuli lubehelo lwa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>Ndolonga kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">“Hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kubilimila na ngome ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">Nguluwi wa heni yondilingitumbila.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>Ena, Nguluwi kokulohola kuli idiwa lya mpelembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">kokwamila kuli matamwa galingukopola.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>Kokugubika kwa mabawa ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">kowa na kikala goya hala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">kukundigwa kwa heye kokwamila kota ngawo.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>Hulinguganigwa kudumba kukabusa kwa nechilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">ne kutowigwa na misale baho du nemisi,<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>ne utamwa ulinguya nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">ne kubagama kulingulawila nemisi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Hanga wanhu elufu wogwa habehi na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">ena, elufu kumi kwa moko wa hegwe wa kudilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">ila hegwe kubagama hambe kukuhejelele.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>Kwa meho ga gwegwe baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">kolola ndaze wanhu wehile vyowalingugazigwa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Kwa vila nakumdita Mkulu Nguluwi ndo honhu ha hegwe ha kubilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">ena, Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya yawele ndo kaye kwa hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>ahyo, hufichigwa na wihe woneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">ihema lya hegwe halifichigwa na utamwa woneche.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Kwa vila Nguluwi kowalajiza wahilisi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, leka wakwamile koneche kouluta.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>Wokuwika mmoko mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">leka magulu ga hegwe galeche kikwang'hwala kuli iganga.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>Kojisumya misimba na mizoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">kojihonda misimba na mingole.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Nguluwi kangulonga, “Ndomlohola yula yalingungana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">ndomwamila yula yalingunzela.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>Hoyonyhema nani ndomwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">hoyowa kuli magazo ndowa hamwe na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">ndomlohola na kumhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Ndomdita yasangalale kwa ukomu wa mihela minji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">ndomlajila ulohozi wa heni.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli. Lwimbo lwa Zuwa lya Kwesela.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Inoga kukulonjela, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">kulimbila lutogo itagwa lya hegwe, gwa Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>Inoga kuwikula igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe mitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">na kukundigwa kwa hegwe mhela wa nechilo,<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>kwa muziki wa igombogombo lya ng'weso kumi na ching'weleng'wele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">na kwa lizi linojile lya igombogombo.<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, madito ga hegwe gangusangalaza heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">ndokutowela luchenze kwa chiwalo cha mbuli za hegwe zeng'ha zouditile.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, madito ga hegwe ndo makulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">Majesa ga hegwe ndo itunyo ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Mpoka howeza kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">ne yasowile nyhala haizelele mbuli ayi,<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>hanga wehile woweza kudedemka kota misolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">na walingudita wihe weng'ha mbuli za hewo zowalutila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">kuduma kwa hewo ndo kudumigwa mazuwa gose,<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>ila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe kwa kuchanya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Wang'honyo wa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">ulole, hewo wang'honyo wa hegwe, ndikomya wodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">weng'ha walingudita wihe wosambaluka.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Hegwe nakumha heni mong'ho kota ibogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">nakumbakaliza heni mafuta ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Kwa meho nambona wang'honyo wa heni nawalemwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">kwa makutu nanyhulika chililo cha walingunditila wihe.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>Watanganiche wangudedemkaga kota mitende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">wangukulaga kota mielezi ja Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Awo ndo kota migodi jinyaligwe haluga ha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">jangudedemkaga kota migodi mgati mwa lugagala lwa Nguluwi wa hetwe,<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>wangulutililaga kulela mafuza kuli mhela wa kulala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">mazuwa gose wangumemaga unhomvu na wanguwaga wadodi,<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>Wowikula, “Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">heye ndo italawe lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">mgati mwa heye haduhu ne wihe.”<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi mndewa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">nakevika ukulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Mkulu Nguluwi nakavala ukulu na mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Nakayimiza nzinzili isi yeng'ha, nayo haitigasika hebu.<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa cha nzinzili kulawa katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">hegwe nawali baho mihela jeng'ha lojing'hali kuwa.<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Mazi menji nagalavya lizi, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">ena, nagakwiniza lizi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">mazi menji gangukwiniza kahi kubuma kwake.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>Heye ndo mkulu kusinda kubogoma kwa mazi makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">ndo mkulu kusinda nhigu za bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">Mkulu Nguluwi yalingikala kuchanya kana mong'ho.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, malajizo ga hegwe gema nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">welile wa ng'handa ya hegwe wangunojeza mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi mtagusa wa weng'ha</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi yalinguhilula chibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">hegwe Nguluwi mhilula chibida, wilajile.<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Wime, gwa mtagusa wa isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">uwagaze walingidaya vyoilinguganigwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Mbaka hanili, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">wehile wotowa luchenze?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Wangulonga ulonzi wa ujuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">wadita wihe weng'ha nawamema kidaya.<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wanguwadumya wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">wanguwagaza hewo uwahagule.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Wanguwakopola wadala wafililwe na walume wawo na wajenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">wanguwakopola walekwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Wangulonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi halingona hebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Nguluwi wa Yakobo havizelele.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Hemwe wapoka wa kuduma, mijese hado.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">Hemwe msowile nyhala hanili mowa na luhala?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>Yaliditile ikutu, ndaze, howeza kuhulika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Yalumbile iziho, ndaze, howeza kona?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>Ndaze, yalinguwazapa wanhu wa isi howeza kugaza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Yalinguwalangusa wanhu uwanzi.<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangugazela majesa ga wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">kanguvizela kota hagotanza chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakatambichizwa munhu ulingumzapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">munhu ulingumlangusa malajizo ga hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>leka zuwa lya magazo yesele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">mbaka wehile wabawilwe chilaga.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi howaleka wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">howatoza wahaguligwe na heye.<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Kwa vila nhaguso zolavigwa kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">weng'ha wagoloche nhumbula wozibatilila.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Whaani yawele yanhanzile kitwanza na munhu mwihe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Whaani nayawele ubanzi umwe na heni kwa chiwalo cha wehile?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Wone Mkulu Nguluwi yahalechile kunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">ndahawele habehi kuluta kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>Londijesile kota ndangutelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe nalinyimiza nzinzili.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Kusanzalima kwa nhumbula ya heni hokuwa kwinji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">hegwe kwangunyhembuliza na kusangalaza heni.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Hegwe huweza kihanza na watagusa wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">walinguwika mizilo ja kuwagaza wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Wangikungajiza kuwaditila wihe watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">na kuwatagusa kubagama, wanhu walihela nongwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ngome ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">Nguluwi wa heni ndo italawe lya kunyamila.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Wihe wa hewo, heye kowahilusila hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">kowadumya kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, kowadumya.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Muye tumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">tumtowele luchenze italawe lya ulohozi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>Tulute hali heye na kulonga malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">tumtowele luchenze na nzimbo za lutogo.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo Nguluwi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">heye ndo Mndewa mkulu hali milungu jeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>Mgati ng'hatu mwa isi kwa mmoko mwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">mbaka kuli vinhembenhembe vya vidunda ndo vya heye.<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>Bahali ndo ya heye, ndo yaiditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">kwa moko ga heye nakalumba isi ng'havu.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Muye tinamize na kumfugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">tufugame hali Mkulu Nguluwi, yatulumbile hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Kwa vila heye ndo Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">natwe twa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">ndo ming'holo ja heye yalingujidima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Wone lehano mohulika lizi lya heye,<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>“Mleche kuzidita nhumbula za hemwe ziwe zigagadale kota kula Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">kota vyowawele kula kuchiwala Masa.<verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>Wasekulu wa hemwe lowanjezile na kupima majesa ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">hanga nawajona mijito ja heni.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Kwa miyaka makumi gane nanzudizwa ng'hatu na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">nandonga, ‘Ndikomya, wanhu wano nawajilila mnhumbula za hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">Nawo hawazizelele nzila za heni.’<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Lelo nanzudila ng'hatu, nandilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">‘Hawokwinjila hali honhu hangu ha kwesela.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi ndo mndewa na mtagusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:23-33">1 Mihela 16:23-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi lwimbo lunyale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi, isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi na kulitogola itagwa lya heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">Mdamle chila zuwa madito ga heye ga ulohozi.<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Muuwikule ukulu wa heye hali wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">muwalonjele wanhu weng'ha madito ga heye ga vinduzanduza.<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mkulu, kangutogoligwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">kanguganigwa kudumbigwa kusinda milungu jeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Kwa vila milungu jeng'ha ja wanhu ndo jimalukolo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakalumba ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Ukulu na lutogo vya hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">mong'ho na kunoga vyangumemeza ng'handa ya heye.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Mumhe Mkulu Nguluwi lutogo, hemwe ivyazi za isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">ena, mumtogole kwa ukulu na mong'ho wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Mumfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi kwa ukulu wa itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">migale nhambiko na muye hali lugagala lwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>Mumfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi kuli welile ng'hatu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">Ukakame hali heye, hegwe isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>Muwalonjele wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">“Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongoza!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Ena, isi yeng'ha nayima nzinzili, haitigasika hebu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Kowatagusa wanhu kwa hachi.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Usangalale hegwe ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">utowe luchenze hegwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">bahali ibogome na vyeng'ha viwele mumo.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Msangalale hemwe migunda na vyeng'ha viwele mumo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">Hamba migodi jeng'ha ja kisolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">jokwimba kwa usangalalo,<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>hali Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa vila kanguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">ena, kanguya kuitagusa isi yeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Koitagusa isi kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">na wanhu wa isi kwa kukundigwa kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi chilongozi mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">Usangalale hegwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">Msangalale hemwe vihilwa vinji.<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Ng'hungugu na jiza totolo vyangumzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">kutanganika na hachi ndo msisi wa chigoda cha heye cha undewa.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Chiluli changulongola kumwando kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">kuwalakaza wang'honyo wa heye banzi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>Lumwemwesa lwa heye lwangulangazila isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">isi yanguwona na kukakama.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Vidunda vyangusungulumuka kota ihota hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">ena, hali Mkulu wa isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Ulanga wanguwikula kutanganika kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">wanhu wa isi yeng'ha wanguwona ukulu wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Weng'ha walingujikolela mijito jimalukolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">ena, weng'ha walingujitogola milungu, jiwele hajilingutanza chinhu, wangubasigwa soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">Milungu jeng'ha jangufugama hali Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Wanhu wa Siyoni wangusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">wanhu wa Yuda wangutowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">kwa chiwalo cha nhaguso za hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya, mchanya mwa isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">hegwe kuna ukulu ng'hatu mchanya mwa milungu jeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Wala walingumgana Mkulu Nguluwi, wauzudile wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">kwa vila kangwamilaga ukomu wa walingukundigwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">kanguwaloholaga kuli ndole za wang'honyo.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Lumuli lwanguwamwemweselaga watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">usangalalo kwa wanhu wawele na nhumbula zigoloche.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Msangalale kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi hemwe watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">mlonje malumbo kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heye lyelile.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi chilongozi wa isi zeng'ha</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi lwimbo lunyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kwa vila nakadita mbuli za vinduzanduza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">Moko wa heye wa kudilo uzidahe, moko wa heye welile naumha heye kusumya.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalajila ulohozi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">nakawalajila wanhu wa isi zeng'ha kutanganika kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>Nakalikumbuchila igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa kwa heye kwa Waisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Banzi zeng'ha za isi nazona ulohozi wa Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Isi yeng'ha itowe luchenze kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">imtogole kwa nzimbo za usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kutowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">mumtogole kwa lizi linojile lya igombogombo.<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Mumtowele luchenze Mkulu Nguluwi mndewa wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">msangalale kwa mhalamhanda na mbalati.<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Bahali ibogome na vyeng'ha viwele mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">isi zeng'ha na weng'ha walingikala mgati mwake.<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Hemwe nzanda mtowe vimbamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">hemwe vidunda mwimbe hamwe kwa kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>Visangalale hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">kwa vila kanguya kuitagusa isi yeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">Kozitagusa isi zeng'ha kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">kowatagusa wanhu kwa kutanganika.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi ndo mndewa mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wangukakama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">Nakekalisa hagati ha vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">isi yangutigasika.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mkulu ako Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">kangwinuligwa hali wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Weng'ha walitogole itagwa lya heye likulu lya kukabusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">Yelile ndo heye.<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Gwa mndewa uwele na mong'ho, ulingugana kutanganika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">Nakutawiza hachi kuli Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">nawigala kutanganika na hachi.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">mugwe chifunama hali heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">Yelile ndo heye.<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Musa na Aluni nawali watambika wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Samweli nayali hali wala walichemile itagwa lya heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Nawamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi naye nakawedichila.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>Nakalonga nawo kulawa kuli izengo lya ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">nawebatilila nhaguso za heye na mizilo joyawapele.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, hegwe nakuwedichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">kwa hewo nawali Nguluwi uwele ulinguwalechela wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">hanga nakuwagaza kwa nongwa za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">mfugamile kuli chidunda cha heye chelile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, ndo yelile.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa lutogo</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya kulonga malumbo.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Mumtowele luchenze Mkulu Nguluwi, hemwe isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Mumfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">mlute kwa heye kuno mkwimba kwa kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>Mvizele kota Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">Heye ndo yatulumbile, natwe twa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">hetwe ndo wanhu wa heye, ndo ming'holo hali honhu ha heye ha kudimila.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>Mkole hali lwizi lwa ng'handa ya heye kwa kulonga malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mwinjile kuli lugagala lwake kwa lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mlonje malumbo Nguluwi na kulitogola itagwa lyake.<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">kukundigwa kwa heye kwangulutilila hali lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s">Kulagana kwa mndewa</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Ndokwimba kuwala igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe na hachi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa hegwe ndokwimba lutogo.<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Ndobatilila nzila iwele inojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Ndaze, kokuya nili kwa heni?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Ndochikala kwa kugoloka haluga ha heni,<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>sikwimilila hebu upoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">Ndangugazudila madito ga wanhu wajilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">mbuli za hewo haziwa hamwe na heni.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Kwajilila koneche kula kuwe kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">heni ndowa haduhu ng'hatu hali wihe.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Yalingumlonga vibi kwa uviso yawele habehi na heye, ndomdumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">siweza kumwimilila munhu yalingidaya.<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>Meho ga heni gowa mchanya mwa wanhu wawele wa kukundigwa kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">leka wekale hamwe na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">Wanhu wagoloche ndo wong'holela mijito.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Mhadi yoneche hochikala haluga ha heni ha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">haduhu yalingulonga udesi yochikala kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Zuwa mbaka zuwa ndowasumya wehile weng'ha kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">ndowawinga wehile weng'ha kuli muji wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuli magazo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kulanda kwa munhu yawele kuli magazo na yawele kangumhilichila Mkulu Nguluwi kung'ung'uta kwa heye.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uhulichize kulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:1">na chililo cha heni chikufichile.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Uleche kivisa kutali na heni mhela wa magazo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">Umbichile goya ikutu lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">unyidichile himahima mhela hondikulanda.<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Mazuwa ga heni gangukola kota iyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">mizeje ja heni jangulakala kota kuli itanulu.<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Namhondigwa mnhumbula kota misolo na kuswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">hambe ngane ne chilyo.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Kwa chiwalo cha magazo ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">namhona mizeje na ngozi.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Ndayeka kota chideje cha kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">kota ituwe kuli chihame.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Ndanguwasa meho mwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">kota chideje chichiwa mchanya mwa chinduwiko cha ng'handa.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Nemisi yeng'ha wang'honyo wa heni wangundonga vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">Walingumbeza heni wanguwapanjila wanhu wanji kwa itagwa lya heni.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>Kwa vila ndangulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">mivu janguwa chilyo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">mahozi ndangugahanza na chakunwa cha heni,<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>kwa chiwalo cha kuzudila na ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">kwa vila nakundokota na kunhozela kutali.<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Ukomu wa heni ndo kota isisila lya matinazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">ndanguswinha kota misolo.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>Ila gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe, kwangulongoza mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">itagwa lya hegwe lyangukumbuchilwa lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Hegwe kokwinuka na kuwonela isungu muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kwa vila mhela naufika wa kuuditila ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">mhela wake uwichigwe naufika.<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>Kwa vila vitumagwa wa hegwe wanguuhulichiza lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">hanga naulala lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">wanguwonela isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">hanga nauwifigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wolihulichiza itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">wandewa weng'ha muisi wodumba ukulu wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kouzenga kahi muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">na koneka vyoyawele mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>Kokukunda kulanda kwa yalihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">hambe yakuleme kulanda kwa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Wandiche mbuli ayi kwa chiwalo cha lulelo lulinguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">leka howopondigwa hamba wamtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>“Nakalola hasi kulawa honhu helile ha heye hawele kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">Mkulu Nguluwi nakailola isi kulawa kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>Nakahulika kulila kwa wanweng'hwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">nakawalechela welejehe wowatagusigwe kukopoligwa.”<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>Ahyo wanhu woliwikula itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi ako Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">lutogo lwa heye lyowikuligwa ako Yelusalemu,<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>mhela wanhu wa isi zeng'ha howoting'hana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">na wandewa howoting'hana kumfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>Nguluwi nakamhunguzila mong'ho londiwele nding'hali msongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">nakambuza ukomu wa heni uwe udo.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>Ahyo nandonga, “Gwa Nguluwi wa heni, uleche kukunda mbagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">mhela londing'hali msongolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe kwangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>Hegwe nakuwika msisi wa isi katali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">ulanga ndo mijito ja moko ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Isi na ulanga vyokwaga, ila hegwe kopona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">vyolala kota ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">na kota nguwo kovigalula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">navyo vyokwajililila,<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>ila hegwe ndo yuyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">ukomu wa hegwe wahela kuduma.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Wana wa vitumagwa wa hegwe wochikala kwa kwamilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">walelwa wa hewo woditigwa wawe nzinzili hali hegwe.”<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kukulu kwa kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Gwa nhumbula ya heni, umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">vyeng'ha viwele mgati mwa heni vilitogole itagwa lyake lyelile.<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Gwa nhumbula ya heni, umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">Uleche kusemwa ng'o kunoga kwa heye kweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>Ndo yalingukulechela wihe wa hegwe weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">na kukudita uwe mkomu kulawa kuli matamwa geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>Ndo yalingukugombola kulawa kuli kubagama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">na kukuvaliza isungu lya heye na igano lya kwimilila lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>Ndo yalinguumemeza ukomu wa hegwe weng'ha kwa ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">leka upone msongolo uwele na mong'ho kota ikungule.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangutagusaga kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">kanguwapaga walingubunzwa hachi za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>Nakamzelesa Musa nzila za heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">nakawalajila wanhu wa Isilaeli madito ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kana isungu na uliholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">halinguzudilaga himahima nakamema igano lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>Hambe yatung'hanuchile chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">ne ng'halazi ya heye hambe ikale mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>Heye halingutugaza kwa kiwhana na gehile ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">hambe yahiluse chibida kwa winji wa wihe wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>Kota vila ulanga vyouwele kuchanya kutali na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">ndo vyoliwele linji igano lya kwimilila lya heye kwa wanhu walingumdumba.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>Kota kolilawilaga isanya vyokuwele kutali na kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">ndo vyoyalingubagula gehile ga hetwe kutali na hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Kota vila mhaza vyoyalingumonela isungu mwanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">ndo Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyalinguwonela isungu wanhu walingumdumba.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>Nguluwi kanguvizela ndaze vyotulumbigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">kanguvizela kota hetwe twa nhimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Ila munhu, ukomu wa heye ndo kota misolo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">na wangubawulaga kota uluwa kuchiwala.<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>Mbeho yanguputaga mchanya mwake nawo wangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">na honhu holiwele halingoneka kahi.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Ila igano lya kwimilila lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">kwa wala walingumdumba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">na kutanganika kwa heye kwangikala lulelo lweng'ha,<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>kwa weng'ha walingibatilila ilagano lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">walingukumbuchila kuhulichiza malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawika chigoda cha heye cha undewa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">heye kangulongoza mchanya mwa vinhu vyeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Hemwe wahilisi muwele na mong'ho, mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">mlingweneza malajizo ga heye na kuuhulichiza ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Hemwe wamizi weng'ha wa kilanga, mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">hemwe vitumagwa wa heye mlingudita goyalingugana heye.<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi hemwe vilumbigwe vya heye vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">mumtogole honeche homuwele kuli honhu heng'ha hoyalingulongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">Gwa nhumbula ya heni, umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola Yalumbile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, gwa nhumbula ya heni.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, hegwe kwa mkulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Hegwe nakivaliza ukulu na kuhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>Nawizungulusila lumuli kota ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">nakutandazula ulanga kota ihema.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>Kwanguzenga honhu ha hegwe ha kikala mchanya mwa mazi gawele kuchanya mwa ulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">Kwanguidita ng'hungugu iwa mutuka wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">kwanguguluka mchanya mwa mbeho.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>Kwanguidita mbeho iwe msenga wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">milapi ja chiluli jiwe vitumagwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>Isi nakuiwika nzinzili mchanya mwa misisi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">leka ileche kutigasika mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>Nakuigubika isi kwa bahali kota ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">mbaka mazi nagema mchanya mwa vidunda.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Lougang'hanuchile, mazi nagoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">logahuliche kubuma kwa hegwe, nagabilima.<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>Nagabubujika kulawa kuli chidunda mbaka kuli ibindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">mbaka hala honhu hougagongomanyile.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>Nakugawichila ago mazi mbaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">galeche kuigubika isi kahi.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Kwanguziditaga nzasa kuli mibindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">nzila zake zangukolaga hagati ha vidunda.<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>Azo zangujigalilaga mazi migongolo jeng'ha kisolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">Amo midogowi ja kisolo jangusindaga ng'halu zawo.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Videje vyanguzengaga vimvulila vyawo kuli migodi jiwele habehi na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">vyangudulikaga kuli nhagala zake na kwimba.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>Kulawa kuchanya kilanga kwanguvidulisila vidunda nhonya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">na isi kwanguigutiza kwa utambichizo wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>Kwangoteza misolo kwa chiwalo cha migongolo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">na mizuchila kwa chiwalo cha munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">leka naye yalime chilyo kuli misanga,<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>divai ya kumsangalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">mafuta ga mzeituni kubakala kumeho leka yadedemche</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">na ibumunda lya kumha mong'ho.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Migodi mikulu ja Mkulu Nguluwi janguwa na mazi ga kuhega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">ena, mielezi ja Lebanoni joyajinyalile.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Amo videje vyanguzengaga vimvulila vyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">misakulang'hola jina haluga kuli misonobali.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Vidunda viwele ng'wemang'wema ndo honhu ha kikala mhene za kisolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">mhimbi zangivisaga mitalawe.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Nakulumba nyelezi ipime mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">isanya nalyo lyanguuzela mhela wa kuzinga.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Kwangigala jiza, nechilo yangwinjila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">najo migongolo jeng'ha ja kisolo jangulawa.<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Misimba jangubumaga leka jiwe na upelembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">jangubetezaga Nguluwi yajipe chilyo chawo.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Isanya holilawa janguhilukaga kwa hewo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">na kwesela hali mhalika za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Aho, naye munhu kangulutaga kuli mijito ja heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">na kukola mijito ajo mbaka matinazo.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi nakudita mbuli nyinji lukami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Geng'ha nakudita kwa luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Isi naimema vilumbigwe vya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Hala hana bahali ng'hulu na iwele ngazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">kuwele nakumema vilumbigwe vyohambe viwaziche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">vilumbigwe vilingikala, vikulu na vidodo.<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>Ndo zilingujenda meli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">na lila linhu likulu Lewiyatani lyoulilumbile livine amo.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vyangukubeteza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">uvipe chilyo kwa mhela uwichigwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Vyangulokota choneche chila choulinguwapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">hougubula moko wa hegwe vyangiguta vinonile.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Louwapa chigosi, vyangudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">loukusa lweselo lwa hewo, vyangubagama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">na kuhiluka kuli nhimbwisi kowalawile.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Louwaputila lweselo lwa hegwe, vyangulumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">hegwe kwanguigalila isi kumeho kunyale.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi ulutilile kikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Mkulu Nguluwi yanojezwe na madito ga heye yuye,<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>heye yalinguilola isi nayo yangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">yalinguvidoliza vidunda navyo vyangulavya iyosi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Ndomwimbila Mkulu Nguluwi kuli ukomu wa heni weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">ndomtogola Nguluwi wa heni mhela weng'ha hondichikala.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unojezwe na aga majesa ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">kwa vila kusangalala kwa heni kwangulawa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Wawele na gehile wosigwe muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">hawe haduhu wehile woneche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, gwa nhumbula ya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi na wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:8-22">1 Mihela 16:8-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mliwikule itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">muwazelese wanhu weng'ha madito ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>Mumwimbile heye, mumwimbile heye lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">msimile madito ga heye ga kububuwaza.<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Lutogo kwa itagwa lya heye lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">nhumbula za walingumpala Mkulu Nguluwi zisangalale.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>Mpale Mkulu Nguluwi na mong'ho wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">Mumhejelele Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5-6"/>Hemwe walelwa wa Abulahamu chitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5-6">hemwe wana wa Yakobo, yahaguligwe wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5-6">mkumbuchile madito ga heye ga kububuwaza goyaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5-6">vinduzanduza vya heye na nhaguso zoyazilavile.<verse eid="PSA 105:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Heye ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">nhaguso za heye za muisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Heye kangulikumbuchilaga ilagano lya heye mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">kangwenezaga kulagana kwa heye kwa lulelo elufu.<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>Kangubatililaga ilagano lyoyaliditile na Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">na ilagano lyoyamlahile Isaka.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>Nakamtawizila Yakobo kulagana kwa heye kota ndo ilajizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">na Isilaeli kota ndo ilagano alyo lya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>Nakalonga, “Ndowapani isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">nayo yowa uhalizi wa hemwe.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Lowawele wachefu na walinguwazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">na wajenzi kuli isi ya Kanaani,<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>nawalubaluba kulawa honhu hamwe mbaka hayage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">isi imwe mbaka yinji.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Ila Nguluwi hakundile ne munhu yawabunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">kwa chiwalo cha hewo nakawang'hanuchila wandewa,<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>“Mleche kuwadoliza wabakalizwe mafuta wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">mleche kuwalumiza waloli wa heni.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>Nguluwi nakambuza lufemba kuli isi ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">nakawifya chilyo cha hewo cheng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>Ila nakawalongolezela munhu yumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Yusufu yawele yaguzigwe kuli upogozi.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>Nawamuwopa magulu kwa minyololo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">na ngwamo ya chuma kuli singo,<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>mbaka choyalonjile Yusufu vyochenele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi naulajila kota Yusufu nakakomya.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Mndewa wa Misili nakalajiza yadoholigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">chilongozi wa wanhu wa isi nakamlechela yelejehe.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>Nakamuwika yalongoze undewa wa heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">na mkulu wa lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha,<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>yawalongoze vilongozi wa heye vyoyalingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">na kuwalangusa wasekulu wa heye luhala.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Aho ndo Isilaeli nakenjila Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">kwa vila Yakobo nayali mjenzi kuli isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawadita wanhu wa heye waponde lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">nakawapa mong'ho kusinda wang'honyo wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>Nakawadita Wamisili wawazudile wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">nawawaditila vibi vitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>Hamba nakamlajiza Musa chitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">nakamlajiza na Aluni yahaguligwe wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>Nawadita ulajilo wa Nguluwi hali Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">vinduzanduza kuli isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>Nguluwi nakegala jiza mchanya mwa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">Wamisili nawalema kuuhulichiza ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>Nakagalula mazi ga nzanda za hewo nagawa danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">nakazikopola somba za hewo zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>Mibula najiivaba isi ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">mbaka ng'handa ya mndewa naimema jijo.<verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>Nguluwi nakalonga, navyuya vilundo vya ng'honzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">na sewe kuli isi ya hewo yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>Nakagalula nhonya ya hewo iwe nhonya ya maganga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">iwele na lumwemwesa kuli isi ya hewo yeng'ha,<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>nakajiwifya mizabibu na mitini ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">nakabena migodi ja isi ya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>Nguluwi nakalonga na nzije nazilawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">ndede maelufu zohambe ziwaziche,<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>nazijigubika mizuchila jeng'ha kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">najilya mbena za hewo zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Nakawakopola walelwa wa mwaluko kuli isi ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">walelwa wa mwaluko wa Wamisili.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>Hamba nakawalavya wanhu wa Isilaeli kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">nawoka na sendi na zahabu za Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">haduhu ne munhu yumwe wa hewo yekwang'wale.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Wamisili nawasangalala kuka kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">kwa vila nawali wakabuswe kwa chiwalo cha hewo.<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Nguluwi nakawika ng'hungugu kota chigubiko mchanya wa wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">na chiluli leka yawalangazile nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>Nawalanda naye nakawegalila ng'hwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">nakawagutiza ibumunda kulawa kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>Loyatulile italawe mazi nagalawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">kota lwanda nagakola kuli chiwala.<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>Nakakumbuchila kulagana kwa heye kwelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">koyampele Abulahamu chitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>Lelo nakawalavya wanhu wa heye kuli isi kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">wahaguligwe wa heye nawatowa luchenze lowalawile.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>Nakawapa isi za wanhu wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">na migunda ja wenyeng'haye,<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>leka wanhu wa heye wahulichize mizilo ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">na kuwinza malajizo ga heye.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s">Kunoga kwa Nguluwi kwa wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vila ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">kwa vila igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Whaani yoweza kulonga madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Whaani yoweza kumtogola kota vyoyalinguganigwa?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Nawatambichizwa wala walingudita hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">walingudita mazuwa gose mbuli zitanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Ung'humbuche gwa Mkulu Nguluwi mhela houlajila vyoulingunojezwa na wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">unhanze mhela houwalohola,<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>leka nhambichizwe hamwe na wahaguligwe wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">sangalale hamwe na wanhu wa isi ya hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">na kivuna hamwe na wahalizi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Natudita gehile, hetwe na wasekulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">natudita wihe, natudita mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Wasekulu wa hetwe lowawele Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">hawajesile madito ga heye ga kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">hawakumbuchile winji wa igano lya kwimilila lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">nawambelenhuka hafungo ha bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Ila Nguluwi nakawalohola kwa lutogo lwa itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">leka yalajile mong'ho wa heye ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>Nakaing'hanuchila bahali ya Shamu, naikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">nakawakoleza amo kota kuli isi ng'havu.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>Nakawalohola kuli moko ga wawazudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">nakawagombola kulawa kuli moko ga wang'honyo wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>Mazi ga bahali nagawagubika wang'honyo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">haponile ne yumwe wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Hamba wanhu wa heye nawaukunda ulonzi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">nawamwimbila nzimbo za lutogo lwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Ila mhela uchefu hela nawasemwa madito ga Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">nawaleka kitumbila kuli ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>Nawali wamemile maya ng'hatu ya iwunde kula kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">nawamjeza Nguluwi kula kugunuche.<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>Naye Nguluwi nakawapa chila chowaganile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">ila nakegala utamwa ulingwambuza kuganda hali hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>Kuli kambi walume nawamonela fihi Musa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">kahi nawamonela fihi Aluni, chitumagwa yelile wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Aho ndo misanga najigubuka na kummela Datani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">Abilamu na chilundo cha heye cheng'ha nawatiligwa,<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>chiluli nachiwalawila walinguwawinza hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">nachiwalakaza wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>Nawagongomanya ilogota kula Holebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">nawalifugamila limalukolo alyo lya zahabu ya kulubuswa,<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>nawauleka ukulu wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">kwa chiwalo cha limalukolo lya igongolo liwele lyangulyaga misolo.<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>Nawamsemwa Nguluwi yawalohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">yaditile mbuli ng'hulu kuli isi ya Misili,<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>vinduzanduza kuli isi ayo ya Hamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">na mbuli za mong'ho kuli bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>Nguluwi nakalonga kowadumya wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">ila Musa hela yahaguligwe wa heye nakema hagati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">nakalemeza ng'halazi ya heye ileche kuwadumya.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Hamba nawaibeza yila isi ya kunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">kwa vila hawawele na makundo na kulagana kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Nawang'ung'uta kuli mihema ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">hawamhulichize Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Ahyo Nguluwi nakenula moko, nakelaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">“Ndowadumya kuchiwala,<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>ndowasambalula walelwa wa hemwe hali wanhu wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">na ndowasambalula kuli isi yeng'ha.”<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Hamba nawelumba kumfugamila Baali wa kula Peoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">Nawalya nhambiko zilavigwe kwa chiwalo cha milungu jilihela ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>Nawamdita Nguluwi yazudile kwa madito ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">utamwa nawuya hali hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Ila Finehasi nakema hagati kuwatanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">na wula utamwa naulemezwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Mbuli ayo yangukumbuchilwa kwa kutanganika kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">kwa lulelo lulinguya lulihela kuduma.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>Nawamzudiza Nguluwi kuli mazi ga Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">Musa nakagazigwa kwa chiwalo cha hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>Kwa vila nawambelenhuka muhe wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">mbaka nakalonga ulonzi ne kijesa.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>Hawawakopole wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyawalajize,<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>ila nawehanza na wanhu wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">nawelangusa kudita mbuli za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Nawajifugamila jimalukolo ja milungu ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">najo najiwa idiwa lya kuwadumya.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>Nawawakopola wana wa hewo walume na wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">nawawalavya nhambiko kwa vijeni.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>Nawabohola danda ya walihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">danda ya wana wa hewo walume na wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">wawele nawawalavya nhambiko kwa jimalukolo ja Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">isi naiwa ikokomoche kwa danda ya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>Ahyo nawaditigwa wakokomoche kwa madito ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">nawali walihela kukundigwa kwa Nguluwi kota wang'hondwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>Lelo ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi naiwafika wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">nakazudizwa ng'hatu na wahalizi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>Nakawawika kuli ndole za wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">walinguwazudila nawawalongoza.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Wang'honyo wa hewo nawawabunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">na kuwawika hali ludali lwa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Mala nyinji Nguluwi nakawalohola wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">ila hewo nawahagula kumbelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">nawalutilila kudita wihe.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Ila Nguluwi nakahulichiza magazo ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">mhela loyahuliche chililo cha hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>Kwa chiwalo cha hewo nakalikumbuchila ilagano lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">nakawonela isungu kwa winji wa igano lya kwimilila lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>Nakawadita wonelwe isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:46">na weng'ha wawaholile.<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, utulohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">utukungajize hamwe kulawa hali wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">leka tulonje malumbo kwa itagwa lya hegwe lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na kivuna kwa chiwalo cha lutogo lwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">kulawa mazuwa gose mbaka mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Wanhu weng'ha walonje, “Ena.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cha Kahano</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 107:-1-150">Zabuli 107-150</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Lutogo kwa Nguluwi yanojile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>“Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vila heye ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">kwa vila igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Mlonje ahyo hemwe womgomboligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">wanhu wawele nakawalohola kulawa kwa wang'honyo.<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>Nakawakungajizani kulawa isi za chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa kolilawilaga isanya na kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa kasikazini na kusini.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Wamwenga nawalubaluba hela kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">kuno wolemwela kuufichila muji wa kikala.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Nawona nzala na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">nawagozola ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Kuli kugaya kwa hewo nawamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">naye nakawalohola kuli magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>Nakawalongoza kuli nzila igoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">mbaka nawaufichila muji wa kikala.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa igano lya kwimilila lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">kwa chiwalo cha vinduzanduza navyoyawaditile wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>Kanguwanwezaga wawele na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">na wawele na nzala kanguwagutizaga ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Wamwe nawekala kuli jiza na uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">wanweng'hwa kuli magazo na minyololo,<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>kwa vila nawabelenhuka malajizo ga Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">na kuubeza ulonzi wa Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya.<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>Nawali watochile lukami kwa mijito jing'ang'ale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">nawagwa, hakuwele na wa kuwatanza.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Kuli kugaya kwa hewo nawamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">naye nakawalohola kuli magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>Nakawalavya kuli jiza na uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">minyololo ja hewo nakajibenanga.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa igano lya kwimilila lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">kwa chiwalo cha vinduzanduza navyoyawaditile wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Heye kangubenaga na kuchumula lwizi lwa shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">na kutemanga fito za chuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Kwa upoka, wamwe nawadita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">nawagazika kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>nawachizudila chilyo cheng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">nawali habehi kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Kuli kugaya kwa hewo nawamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">naye nakawalohola kuli magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>Kwa ulonzi wa heye nakawalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">nakawalohola leka waleche kudumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa igano lya kwimilila lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">kwa chiwalo cha vinduzanduza navyoyawaditile wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Wamlavile nhambiko za kulonga malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">wasimile madito ga heye kwa nzimbo za kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Wamwenga nawali mmajendo kuli bahali kwa meli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">na kukola mijito ja hewo mumo kuli bahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>Nawagona madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">mbuli za kububuwaza zoyaditile ako.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>Nakalajiza, nakambuza chivuluvumbi chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">nachitoza kuchanya nhigu ya bahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Nawatozigwa kuchanya kuli ulanga, hamba hasi kuli mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">uzidahe wa hewo naumalila kuli mbuli ayo.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Nawatigasika na kuzebeduka kota wagalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">uwanzi wa hewo weng'ha wa kuli mazi nauwamalila baho.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Kuli kugaya kwa hewo nawamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">naye nakawalohola kuli magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>Nakachidita chila chivuluvumbi chikulu chisindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">nayo nhigu naileka.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Aho nawasangalala kwa kuwa na kusindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">nakawafichiza kuli bandali iwele nawali woluta.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa igano lya kwimilila lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">kwa chiwalo cha vinduzanduza navyoyawaditile wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Mumtogole kuli nhing'hano ya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">na kuli chitala cha wasekulu.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Nguluwi nakagalula nzanda ziwa kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">nzasa nakazidita zikale ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>Misanga jiwele na mboto nakajidita jiwe misanga jiwele na mwino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa wenyeng'haye wake.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Nakagalula kugunuche nakuwa mizimbo ja mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">na isi ng'havu naziwa nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>Nakawahilika ako wawele na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">nawo nawazenga muji na kikala ako.<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>Nawalima migunda na kunyala mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">nawabeta mbena kwa winji.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>Nakawatambichiza wanhu wa heye nawonjezeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">na winji wa migongolo ja hewo nawonjezeka.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Hamba lowapunguche na lowawele ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">kwa kuditilwa vibi na kugazigwa na masinzo,<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>nakawabeza wakulu wowawagazile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">nakawazungulusa kuchiwala kokuwele haduhuli nzila.<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Ila nakawalohola walingugana utanzi kuli magazo ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">nakonjeza nhanzi za hewo kota vilundo vya ming'holo.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Watanganiche howoyona mbuli ayo wosangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">ila wehile weng'ha woditigwa wanyamalile.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Wawele na luhala wejese kwa chiwalo cha mbuli azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">wejese kwa chiwalo cha igano lya kwimilila lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi kwa chiwalo cha kuwasumya wang'honyo</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 57:7-11">Zabuli 57:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60:5-12">60:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Gwa Nguluwi, nda nzinzili mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:1">ndokwimba na kukutowela luchenze kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Ndokwaluka kutowa ching'weleng'wele na igombogombo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">Ndolililimla isanya kuwe mitondo.<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndolonga malumbo kwa hegwe hali wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">ndokwimbila lutogo hali wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe ndo likulu mbaka kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">kukundigwa kwa hegwe kwangwenela mbaka kuli ng'hungugu.<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>Utogoligwe, gwa Nguluwi, kuchanya kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">ukulu wa hegwe wenele muisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Leka woulingugana waloholigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">ulohole kwa moko wa hegwe wa kudilo, unhyidichile.<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>Nguluwi nakelaha kulawa helile ha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">“Lelo, hondisumya ndoigawanula Shekemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">ibindi lya Sukoti ndolipima chila honhu.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Gileadi ndo ya heni na Manase ndo ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">Efulaimu ndo kofia ya heni ya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">na Yuda ndo ng'hweku ya heni ya undewa.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Moabu ndo kota chisaye cha heni cha kihovujila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">makwamba ga heni ndogatozela Edomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Ndotowa iyowe lya kusumya kwa chiwalo cha Filistiya.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Whaani yonyhilika kuli muji wa ngome?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">Whaani yondongoza mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Nakutuleka ng'hatu, gwa Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Lekachoni hambe ulute kahi na wamizi wa hetwe?<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Utugalile utanzi kwa chiwalo cha walingutugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">kwa vila ulohozi wa munhu hauwele chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Kwa utanzi wa Nguluwi tosumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">heye kowabiga walingutugaza.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s">Kung'ung'uta kwa munhu kuli magazo</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Uleche kunyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:1">gwa Nguluwi ndilingukutogola.<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>Wanhu wehile na wahadi wangunhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">wangulonga udesi kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>Wangulonga wihe kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">na kunhowa ne nongwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Hanga nandiwagana, nawandonjeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">ila nandiwalandila.<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>Wanguhilula wihe honhu ha kunoga kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">na kuzudila kwa igano lya heni.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Umuwiche mtagusa mwihe kwa mng'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">na yalingumlonjeleza heye yamhiliche kuli chitala.<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Hoyotagusigwa yafichigwe na nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">kulanda kwa heye kuwazigwe kota nongwa yinji.<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Mazuwa ga ukomu wa heye gawe machefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">munhu yunji yahole mijito ja heye ja kulongoza.<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Wana wa heye wawe walekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">na mamo wa wana awo yawe yafililwe na mlume.<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Wana wa heye wawe wolubaluba na kulandalanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">wawinjigwe kuli mahame ga ng'handa za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Yalingumdai chinhu yasukule lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">na wajenzi wahole vinhu vyoyapatile kwa chituguti cha heye.<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Hawe haduhu munhu wa kumonela isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">ama kuwalolela wana wa heye walekwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Walelwa wa heye weng'ha wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">itagwa lya heye lisemwigwe kuli lulelo lulinguya.<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yaukumbuchile wihe wa wasekulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">gehile ga mayake galeche kusigwa hebu.<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yakumbuchile gehile ga hewo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">ila hewo wawo wasemwigwe muisi.<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Mwihe ayo hajesile ng'hatu kuwa na isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">ila nakawabunza wazunwa na walihela chinhu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">na ng'hochele mbaka kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Heye kanguganaga kuwapanjila wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">kupanjila kumfiche heye yuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">Hambe yawaganile wanji utambichizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">lelo, yaleche kuwa na utambichizo.<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>Kwa heye kupanjila ndo kota kuvala nguwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">lelo, kupanjila ako kumdodeze kota mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">kwinjile kuli mizeje ja heye kota mafuta.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>Kupanjila kumgubiche kota nguwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">kumzungulute mazuwa gose kota isali.<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yawahilusile kota ahyo wanhu walingundonjeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">ena, hewo walingulonga gehile kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">unhanze kwa lutogo lwa itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">undohole kwa winji wa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Heni mzunwa na ndilihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">nandilumizwa mbaka mnhumbula mwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Ndangwajilila kota isisila lya matinazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">nanyhusigwa kota ndede mlukuli.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Mafugamilo ga heni ndo ng'hochele kwa chiwalo cha kwesela kulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">ndipona na mizeje na ngozi.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>Ndiwa munhu wa kubezigwa hela na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">howombona wangutigasaga vitwi vya hewo kwa kubeza.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Unhanze, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">undohole kwa winji wa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>Uwalajile wanhu kota ago ndo madito ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakudita ahyo.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Wanguweza kumhanjila, ila hegwe konhambichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">walingunhowa wabasigwe soni, nani chitumagwa wa hegwe ndosangalala.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Walingundonjeleza wavalizwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">wegubiche soni ya hewo kota igolole.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Ndolonga malumbo ng'hatu kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">ndomtogola hali chilundo cha wanhu,<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>kwa vila heye kangumlewelaga mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">kangumloholaga mhela hoyotagusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwichigwa kwa mndewa na mtambika yahaguligwe</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangumlonjela Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">“Wikalise ubanzi wa kudilo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">mbaka ndiwawiche wang'honyo wa hegwe hasi ha magulu ga hegwe.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi koweneza undewa wa hegwe kulawa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">hegwe kolongoza mchanya mwa wang'honyo wa hegwe weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Wanhu wa hegwe wokuyila kwa kunuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">zuwa lyouluta kuwatowa wang'honyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">Mchanya mwa vidunda vyelile wokuyila wasongolo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">kota nungwi ilingulawa lufuku ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakelaha, hogalula kunuwila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">“Hegwe ndo mtambika mazuwa gose kwa kuwinza utambika wa Melekisedeki.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Mkulu ka ubanzi wa hegwe wa kudilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">kowahonda wandewa hoyozudila.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>Kowatagusa na kuwakopola wanhu wenji wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">kowahonda vilongozi chila honhu muisi.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Mndewa konwa mazi ga mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">naye kokwinula mutwi kuchanya kwa kusumya.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s">Madito makulu ga Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Ndolonga malumbo Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">hamwe na ikugusi lya wanhu watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi ndo makulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">Weng'ha walingusangalalila wanguwaga wogajesa.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Chila choyalingudita chimema ukulu na lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">kutanganika kwa heye kwangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Nakambuza madito ga heye ga kububuwaza gakumbuchilwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Mkulu Nguluwi ka yanojile na yawele na isungu.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>Kanguwapaga chilyo walingumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">mazuwa gose kangulikumbuchilaga ilagano lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>Nakawalajila wanhu wa heye mong'ho lwa madito ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">nakawapa isi za wanhu wa isi zinji ziwe uhalizi wa hewo.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Madito ga heye ndo ga hachi na ga kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">malajizo ga heye geng'ha ndo ga kukundigwa,<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>gangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">nagalavigwa kwa hachi na kutanganika.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>Nakawagombola wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">na kudita na hewo ilagano lya mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">Heye ka yelile na wa kukabusa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo msisi wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">weng'ha walingibatilila malajizo ga heye wangutambichizwa luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Lutogo lwa heye lwangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s">Kusangalala kwa munhu yanojile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Katambichizwa munhu yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">yalingusangalala ng'hatu kibatilila malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>Walelwa wa heye wowa wawele na mong'ho kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">wana wa wagoloche nhumbula wotambichizwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Kuli ng'handa ya heye kowa na lufufu lwinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">kutanganika kwa heye kwangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Munhu yanojile kangulangaziwaga lumuli kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">munhu yawele na isungu na yaliholile na yatanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Ganojile gomuyila munhu yula yawele na isungu na yalingwazika ne kugana mzidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">yalingudita mbuli za heye kwa hachi.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Yatanganiche hotigasika hebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">kokumbuchilwa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>Halingudumba hoyofichigwa na mbuli yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">kana nhumbula iwele nzinzili na kangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>Ka nzinzili mnhumbula, hodumba hebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">naye kowona wang'honyo wa heye wosumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>Kangulavyaga kwa isungu na kuwapa wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">kutanganika kwa heye kwangikala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">Ludali lwa heye lwangutogoligwa kwa kuhulichizwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Wanhu wehile wangugona ago na kuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">wangujejedaga mizino kwa kuzudila na kubilabila ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">kitumbila kwa munhu yehile kwangwajilila hela.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo kwa Nguluwi yawele na ukulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Hemwe vitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi, mlitogole itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi litogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">lehano mbaka mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>Kulawa kolilawilaga isanya mbaka kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">litogoligwe itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka mchanya mwa wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">ukulu wa heye wangufika mchanya mwa ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Whaani yawele kota Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">Heye nakekalisa mchanya kuli chigoda cha undewa,<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>ila kangulola hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:6">yalole ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>Kangumwinulaga yalihela chinhu kulawa kuli nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">na kumkwiniza mzunwa kulawa kuli soni ya heye,<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>na kumuwika hamwe na wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">wakulu wa wanhu wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>Kangumtambichizaga mdala yawele mhende kusangalala kuli ng'handa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">kangumsangalazaga kwa kumtambichiza wana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kana mong'ho wa kuwalohola Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Wanhu wa Isilaeli lowalawile Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">walelwa wa Yakobo lowalawile kuli isi ya ulonzi wa chijenzi,<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Yuda nayali haluga ha Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Isilaeli nayali undewa wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Bahali ya Shamu naimona Nguluwi, naibilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">lwanda lwa Yolodani naluleka kuchililika.<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Vidunda navizumazuma kota ing'holo ilume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">vidunda vidodo navizuma kota ming'holo myana.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Gwa bahali, lekachoni nakubilima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Nagwe Yolodani, lekachoni nakuleka kuchililika?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Hemwe vidunda, lekachoni namzumazuma kota ing'holo ilume?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Hemwe vidunda, lekachoni namzuma kota ming'holo myana?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Gwa isi, ukakame hali Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">ukakame hali Nguluwi wa Yakobo,<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>yalingudoliza italawe kuwa ilamba lya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">nago maganga nagali nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi yumwe wa kukomya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Hatuwele hetwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hatuwele hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">ila hegwe uliyeka utogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">kwa chiwalo cha igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe na kukundigwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Lekachoni wanhu wa isi walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">“Kakohi Nguluwi wa hemwe?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Nguluwi wa hetwe ka kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">heye kanguditaga geng'ha yalingugana.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Jimalukolo ja hewo ndo sendi na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">najigongomanyigwa kwa moko ga wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Jina milomo, ila hajilingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">jina meho, ila hajilingona.<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>Jina makutu, ila hajilinguhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">jina mhenyelo ila, hajilingunusa.<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>Jina moko, ila hajilingwabasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">Jina magulu, ila hajilingujenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">Hajiweza hebu kulavya lizi.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Weng'ha walingujigongomanya wochiwhana najo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">hihyo du na weng'ha walingujitumbila.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Hemwe Waisilaeli mchitumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">heye ndo utanzi na ngawo ya hemwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Hemwe walelwa wa Aluni, watambika, mchitumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">heye ndo utanzi wa hemwe na ngawo ya hemwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Hemwe mlingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi, mchitumbile kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">heye ndo utanzi wa hemwe na ngawo ya hemwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangutukumbuchila na kotutambichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">kowatambichiza wanhu wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">kowatambichiza walelwa wa Aluni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Kowatambichiza weng'ha walingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">kowatambichiza wakulu na wadodo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yawatambichize leka monjezeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:14">yawatambichize monjezeche hemwe na walelwa wa hemwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Mtambichizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">yavilumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Ulanga uwele kuchanya ng'hatu ndo wa heye Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">ila isi nakawapa wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Wabagame hambe wamtogole Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">ne wala walingudulika kuli isi iwele tulu.<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Ila hetwe tuwele wakomu twangumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">tomtogola sambi mbaka mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s">Kulonga malumbo kwa kuloholigwa kulawa kuli kubagama</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Ndangumgana Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kwa vila nakanyhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kwa vila nakahulika chililo cha kulanda kwa heni kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>Nakambichila goya ikutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">ahyo ndomlanda mhela weng'ha hondichikala.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Vihindo vya kubagama navinzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">kukabusa kwa isi ya wabagame nakuvaba heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">nandali memile kusanzalima na masinzo.<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Hamba nandimlilila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undohole.”<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamema isungu na kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Nguluwi wa hetwe ndo yawele na uliholile.<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwamilaga walingunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">londiwele kuli magazo nakandohola.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Usindamale, gwa nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakanditila ganojile.<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Nakandohola kulawa kuli kubagama na kusa mahozi ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">nakanyamila leka ndeche kugwa.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Ndojenda hali heye Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">kuli isi ya wanhu wawele wakomu.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>Nandali na makundo hala hondonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">“Nangazika lukami.”<verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>Mbaka nandonga kwa lunhwinhwi lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Wanhu weng'ha wangulonga udesi.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>Ndimhilusile choni Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">kwa isungu lya heye lyeng'ha lyoyanditile?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>Ndomlavila nhambiko ya divai kwa kundohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">ndolanda kwa itagwa lya heye Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>Ndomwenezela Mkulu Nguluwi chilaho cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">hali wanhu wa heye weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>Kubagama kwa wanhu wa kukundigwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:15">haiwele mbuli ndodo hali heye.<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, heni nda chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">nda chitumagwa wa hegwe, mwana wa mpogozi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">nakuvichumula vihindo vya heni vya kubagama.<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>Ndokulavila nhambiko za kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">na kulanda kwa itagwa lya hegwe, Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>Ndomwenezela Mkulu Nguluwi chilaho cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">hali wanhu wa heye weng'ha,<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>wowekungajize hali ng'handa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">hagati ha Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Hemwe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha za chijenzi, mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">Hemwe wanhu weng'ha mumtogole.<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Kwa vila igano lya kwimilila lya heye kwa hetwe ndo likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">na kukundigwa kwa heye Mkulu Nguluwi kwangikala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s">Kulonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa vila ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Wanhu wa Isilaeli walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">“Igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Walelwa wa Aluni, watambika, walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">“Igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Weng'ha walingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">“Igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>Kuli magazo ga heni nandimlanda Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">naye nakanyhulika na kumbika ndilejehe.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka hamwe na heni, silingudumba chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">munhu kondita choni?<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka hamwe na heni, kunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">nani ndowona wang'honyo walingunzudila nawalemwela.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Fola kubilimila kikala goya kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">kusinda kuchitumbila kwa munhu.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Fola kubilimila kikala goya kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">kusinda kuchitumbila kuli vilongozi wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha nawanzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">ila kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi nandiwadumya.<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Nawanzunguluta chila ubanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">ila kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi, nandiwadumya.<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Nawanzunguluta, wenji kota nzuchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">ila nawalakazwa himahima kota chisosolo kuli chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi nandiwadumya.<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Nang'hundujizwa kumbele habehi kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakanhanza.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka mong'ho wa heni ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">heye ndo ulohozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Lizi lya usangalalo wa kusumya lyanguhulikwa kuli ihema lya hewo watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">“Moko wa kudilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi naudita mbuli ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Moko wa kudilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi nawinuligwa kuli kusumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">Moko wa kudilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi naudita mbuli ng'hulu.”<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Sibagama hebu, ila ndochikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">na kusimila madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakanzapa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">ila handechile mbagame.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Nyhumulile lwizi lwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">nyinjile na kumlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi malumbo.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Alu ndo lwizi lwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">wanhu wawele watanganiche wokwinjila amo.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Ndolonga malumbo, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kunyhidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">kwa vila hegwe ndo ulohozi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Iganga lyowalilemile walinguzenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">naliwa iganga likulu lya msisi,<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>ajo ndo mijito ja Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">najo ndo ja kububuwaza ng'hatu kwa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Ali ndo zuwa lyoyaliditile Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">ahyo tusangalale na kutowa luchenze.<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, dedede utulohole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">Dedede uzidite mbuli za hetwe zilutilile goya, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Yatambichizwe ayo yalinguya kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Twanguwatambichiza kulawa haluga ha Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">naye ndo yatupele lumuli lwa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">Mibate nhagala mmoko kwa chiwalo cha mnvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">kuno mjenda hamwe mbaka honhu ha kulavila nhambiko.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>Hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni, nani ndangulonga malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">ndangukutogola, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vila ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">igano lya kwimilila lya heye lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s">Ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>Nawatambichizwa walingikala ne nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">walingibatilila ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Nawatambichizwa walinguhulichiza kwamula kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">walingumpala kwa nhumbula yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Wanhu wohawaditile wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">mazuwa gose wanguwinzaga nzila za heye.<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Gwa Nguluwi, nakutupa malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">leka tugebatilile kwa kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Ndahaganile ng'hatu kwima nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">kwa kuwinza mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Ahyo nasalikona soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">kwa kijesa kuwala mizilo ja hegwe jeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Ndokutogola kwa nhumbula igoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">kuno ndichilangusa malajizo ga hegwe gatanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Ndojiwinza mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">uleche kundeka ne hado.<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhulichiza malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Msongolo koulolela ndaze ukomu wa heye leka uwe welile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Kwa kuwinza ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>Ndangikangaza kukuhulichiza kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">uleche kundeka ndijibelenhuche mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Ndibatilila ulonzi wa hegwe mnhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">leka ndeche kukuditila gehile.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, utogoligwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">Undanguse malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Ndogahiluchila kwa lizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">malajizo ga hegwe geng'ha gougalavile.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Ndangusangalala kuwinza kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">kusinda kuwa na lufufu lwinji.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Ndangijesa malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">na kijesa ng'hatu kuwala nzila za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>Ndangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">siweza kusemwa hebu ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maya ga malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Unditile igano heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">leka ndikale na kibata ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Ugagubule meho ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">ndigone malanguso ga kububuwaza kuli malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Heni nda mjenzi hela hano muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">uleche kuvisa heni mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Nhumbula ya heni yangugazika kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">ga kugana kuzizela ng'hatu nhaguso za hegwe mhela weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Hegwe kwanguwang'hanuchila walingidaya na wawele wapanjilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">walingujibelenhuka mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Umbiche kutali na maligo na kubeza kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">kwa vila ndibatilila kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Wakulu wanguting'hana na kugana kunditila vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">heni chitumagwa wa hegwe ndochijesa kwa chiwalo cha mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Kwamula kwa hegwe ndo usangalalo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">azo ndo zilingundongoza kota goloko yanojile.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa kwimilila</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Ndangugalawata hanyi mnhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">umhe heni kahi ukomu kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Nandonga kwa mlomo wa heni gala gonditile, nagwe nakunyidichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">Undanguse malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Undanguse vyoilinguganigwa kibatilila malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">nani ndogajesa madito ga hegwe ga kububuwaza.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Nhoka kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">unyhilulile mong'ho kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Umbiche kutali na nzila za uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">undanguse kwa isungu malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Nanyhagula nzila ya kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">ndibatilila nhaguso za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Ndangibatilila kwamula kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">uleche kukunda mbasigwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>Ndikomya, ndojiwinza mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">kwa vila kwangumha heni uwanzi wa kugazela ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda uwanzi wa kuvizela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undanguse kibatilila mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">nani ndojibatilila mbaka kuduma.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Unzelese leka ndibatilile malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">ndigawinze kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Undongoze kuli nzila ya mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">kwa vila amo ndanguwa na usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>Umhe heni maya ga kibatilila kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">haiwele kuli lufufu.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Umbiche kutali, ndeche kuwinza mbuli zohambe zitanze chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">undajile nzila ya hegwe, umhe heni ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Unyenezele kulagana kwa hegwe, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">kulagana koulinguwapa wala walingukuhulichiza.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Undavile soni yondilinguidumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">kwa vila nhaguso za hegwe ndo zinoga.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Ndangona maya ng'hatu kibatilila malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">umhe heni ukomu, ndikomya hegwe kwa utanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugana malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe lyuye kwa heni, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">undohole kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>Aho ndoweza kuwedichila awo walingundiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">kwa vila ndina makundo ng'hatu na ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Uleche kusa hebu ulonzi wa kukomya kuli mlomo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">kwa vila kitumbila kwa heni kwa kuli nhaguso za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Ndogabatilila malajizo ga hegwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">ena, mazuwa gose na mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Ndochikala kuli kilejeha kuwele kwenele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">kwa vila ndangibatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Ndowalonjela wandewa kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">ne kona soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>Maya ga heni ndo kibatilila mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">jondilingujigana.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Ndangugahulichiza na kugagana malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">mizilo ja hegwe ndojijesa.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhembulizwa na malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Ukumbuchile kota vyoulagane na heni, chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">kulagana kuwele nakumha heni kitumbila.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Mbaka hondiwa mmagazo ndanguwa sindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">kwa vila kulagana kwa hegwe kwangumha heni ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Walingidaya wangundanila mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">ila hambe mbelenhuche malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndanguzikumbuchila nhaguso za hegwe za katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">nazo zangunyhembuliza.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Ndanguwa na ng'halazi ing'ang'ale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">hondiwona wehile wangubena malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Mizilo ja hegwe najiwa lwimbo lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">londilingikala kwa mhela uchefu.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Nechilo ndangukukumbuchila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">na kibatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Awu ndo utambichizo ukulu kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:56">kwa vila ndangibatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maya ga kuwinza malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe uliyeka ndo ndilingukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">ndangilagana kibatilila ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Ndangulanda kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">umbonele isungu kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Nandigajesa madito ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">nanyhiluka leka mbinze kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Ne kukawila ndangudita himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">kujibatilila mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Wehile nawawika midiwa leka wangwilize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">ila heni sisemwa malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Nechilo ng'hatu ndangulilimka kukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">kwa chiwalo cha nhaguso za hegwe zitanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Heni nda goloko wa weng'ha walingukudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">goloko wa hewo walingibatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Isi naimema igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">undanguse mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kangunditila ganojile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Nakunditila goya heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">kota vyoulagane, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Undanguse kuvizela goya na kuwa na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">kwa vila ndina makundo ng'hatu na mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Louwele ung'hali kunzapa nanyajilila nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">ila lelo ndangibatilila ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>Hegwe ndo unojile na kwangudita ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">undanguse mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Walingidaya wangulonga udesi kuwala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">ila heni ndangibatilila malajizo ga hegwe kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Nhumbula za hewo nazigagadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">ila ndangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>Nayali goya kwa heni kugazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">kwa vila nakundita ndilanguse malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Malajizo gougawichile ndo ganoga kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">kusinda lufufu lweng'ha lwa muisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuhembulizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>Moko ga hegwe nagandita na kunyimiza nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">umhe heni uwanzi wa kuvizela leka ndilanguse mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Walingukudumba wombona na kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">kwa vila kitumbila kwa heni kwa kuli ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndivizela nhaguso za hegwe ndo za kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">na kota nakunzapa kwa vila hegwe kwa wa kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe linyhembulize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">kota vyoulagane kwa heni, chitumagwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Umbonele isungu leka ndikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">kwa vila malajizo ga hegwe ndo usangalalo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Walingidaya wabasigwe soni kwa vila nawalonga udesi kuwala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">ila ndochijesa kuwala malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Weng'ha walingukudumba woye kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">leka wakuzele kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha ibatilile mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">leka ndeche kubasigwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda mhela wa kubunzwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Nhoka kwa chiwalo cha kubeteza ulohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">ndanguwika kitumbila kwa heni kuli ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Meho ga heni gangubilabila kwa kubeteza choulagane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">Ndanguuza, “Kokuya nili kunyhembuliza?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Hanga silingutanza chinhu kota chihako cha igozi chiwifigwe na iyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">sisemwile malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Heni chitumagwa wa hegwe ndobeteza mbaka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Kowatagusa nili wala walingumbunza?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Walingidaya wambawila misimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">wanhu wawele hambe wawinze malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Mizilo ja hegwe jeng'ha ndo ja kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">wanhu wangungaza ne hachi, unhanze.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Wahabehi kundumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">ila sibenile malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Uwamile ukomu wa heni kwa kiwhana na igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">leka ndibatilile kwamula koulonjile.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi gangumha munhu ukomu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ulonzi wa hegwe wangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">nautawizwa kuchanya kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Kukundigwa kwa hegwe kwangikala kuli lulelo lweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">nakuiwika isi honhu hake na yangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Vinhu vyeng'ha vyangikala kwa nhaguso za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">kwa vila vyangukukolela mijito.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Wone malajizo ga hegwe hagawele usangalalo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">ndahawele ndumigwe kwa magazo ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Siweza kusemwa malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">kwa vila kwa ago nakumha heni ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Heni nda wa hegwe, undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">kwa vila nandikangaza kibatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Wehile wangumbeteza leka wang'hopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">ila ndangijesa kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Ndivizela chila chinhu changuwa na kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">ila mizilo ja hegwe jahela kuduma.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi gangumha munhu luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Ndangugagana ng'hatu malajizo ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">Ndangugajesa nemisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Mizilo ja hegwe ja hamwe na heni mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">jangumha heni luhala kusinda wang'honyo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Ndivizela kusinda walangusa wa heni weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">kwa vila ndangijesa kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Ndanguvizela kusinda wasekulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">kwa vila ndangibatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>Ndangilemeza kuwinza nzila yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">leka ndibatilile ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Sibelenhuche nhaguso za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">kwa vila hegwe nakundangusa.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>Ulonzi wa hegwe ndo unona ng'hatu kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">ena, ndo unona ng'hatu kusinda hanombwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Kwa malajizo ga hegwe ndanguwa na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">ahyo ndanguzudila chila chilingulutilila vibi.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi ndo lumuli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>Ulonzi wa hegwe ndo chenje cha kundongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">na lumuli kuli nzila ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Nandilaha na kutawiza chilaho cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">kota ndobatilila nhaguso za hegwe za kukomya.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangugazika ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">uwamile ukomu wa heni kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ubochele lutogo lwa heni lwa kunuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">na kundangusa nhaguso za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Mazuwa gose kikala kwa heni kwa habehi kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">ila hambe ndigasemwe malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Wehile nawambichila midiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">ila hambe mbelenhuche malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Kwamula kwa hegwe ndo uhalizi wa heni mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">ako ndo usangalalo wa nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>Nangana kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">kuwinza malajizo ga hegwe mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kikala goya kuli malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Ndanguwazudila wanhu wadesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">ila ndangugagana malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>Hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kikala goya na ngawo ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">ndanguwika kitumbila kwa heni kuli ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Muche kwa heni, hemwe mwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">leka ndijibatilile mizilo ja Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Undite ndiwe nzinzili kota vyoulagane, nani ndochikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">uleche kukunda mbasigwe soni kuli kitumbila kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Unyimize nzinzili nani ndoloholigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">mazuwa gose ndiwe ndilinguhulichiza mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Kwanguwalema weng'ha walingubelenhuka malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">kwa vila majesa ga hewo ga uhadi hagalingutanza chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Wehile weng'ha kwanguwosa kota wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">ahyo heni ndangugana kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Ndangukakama kwa kukudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">ndangudumba kwa chiwalo cha nhaguso za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi kwa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Nandita mbuli zinojile na za hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">uleche kundeka kuli ndole za walingumbunza.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Ulagane kota konhanza, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">uleche kukunda walingidaya wambunze.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Meho ga heni gangubilabila ndibeteza undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">ndibeteza weneze vyoulagane ilagano lya kutanganika.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Unditile, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe kwa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">undanguse mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Heni ndo chitumagwa wa hegwe, umhe heni uwanzi wa kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">leka ndikuzele kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Sambi ndo mhela wa Mkulu Nguluwi kudita chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">kwa vila wanhu wangubena malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Ndangujigana mizilo ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">kusinda zahabu inojile ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Ahyo, ndangugawinza malajizo ga hegwe geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">chila nzila yihile ndanguizudila.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maya ga kuhulichiza malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Kwamula kwa hegwe ndo kwa kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">ahyo ndangukubatilila kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>Ulonzi wa malanguso ga hegwe gangigalaga lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">ganguwapaga luhala wanhu wohawavizelele chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Nhumbula ya heni ina maya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">kwa vila ndangujigana ng'hatu mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Ungalamchile na kumbonela isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">kota vyoulinguwaditila walingukugana.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Umbiche ndiwe nzinzili hondijenda kota vyoulagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">uleche kukunda ndongozwe na wihe.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Ungombole kulawa kwa walingumbunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">leka ndibatilile malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>Unhambichize, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">undanguse mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Meho ga heni gangulavya mahozi kota lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">kwa vila wanhu hawalingubatilila malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hachi ya malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe kwa utanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">na nhaguso za hegwe ndo za hachi.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Nakulavya kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">kwa kukundigwa na kutanganika.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Igano lya heni kwa hegwe lyangundita nzudile ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">kwa vila wang'honyo wa heni nawausemwa ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Kulagana kwa hegwe ndo kwa kukomya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">nani chitumagwa wa hegwe ndangukugana kulagana ako.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Heni nda mdodo na ndangubezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">ila sisemwa malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Kutanganika kwa hegwe kwangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">malajizo ga hegwe ndo ga kukomya.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Magazo na masinzo navifika heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">ila mizilo ja hegwe ndo usangalalo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Kwamula kwa hegwe ndo kwa hachi mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">umhe heni uwanzi wa kuvizela leka ndikale.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kuloholigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>Ndangukulilila kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unyhidichile leka mbinze mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>Ndangukulilila undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">leka ndibatilile kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Ndangulilimka kung'hali kubwemwenzuka na kukulanda utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">ndanguwika kitumbila kwa heni kuli ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Siwasile nechilo yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">kwa chiwalo cha kijesa ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe, unyhuliche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">uwamile ukomu wa heni kwa hachi ya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Wanhu wang'ang'ale walingumbunza wangunyejelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">awo wa kutali ng'hatu na malajizo ga hegwe,<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>ila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe kwa habehi na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">na mizilo ja hegwe jeng'ha ndo ja kukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Kulawa katali nandilangusa kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">kuwele ukuwichile kukale mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwamilwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Ulole magazo ga heni, undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">kwa vila sigasemwile malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Undewele heni na kungombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">uwamile ukomu wa heni kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Wehile hawoloholigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">kwa vila hambe wajiwinze mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, isungu lya hegwe ndo likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">uwamile ukomu wa heni kwa kiwhana na nhaguso za hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Wang'honyo na walingumbunza ndo wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">ila sikuleka kwamula kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Hondiwona walingudita wihe, ndanguzudizwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">kwa vila hambe webatilile ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ulole vyondilingugagana malajizo ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">Uwamile ukomu wa heni kwa kiwhana na igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>Ulonzi wa hegwe weng'ha ndo wa kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">nhaguso za hegwe zeng'ha ndo za kutanganika, zangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusangalala kuli malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Wang'hangala wangumbunza ne chiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">ila nhumbula ya heni yangukakama kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Ndangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">kota munhu yalufichile lufufu lwinji ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Ndanguuzudila ng'hatu udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">ila ndangugagana malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Ndangukutogola mala saba chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">kwa chiwalo cha nhaguso za hegwe zitanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Walingugagana malajizo ga hegwe wana kikala goya kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">haduhu choweza kuwagwisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangukubeteza undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">ndangweneza mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Ndangibatilila kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">ndangukugana ng'hatu kwamula ako.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Ndangibatilila malajizo na kwamula kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">kwa vila kwangugona madito ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, chililo cha heni chikufichile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">Umhe heni uwanzi wa kuvizela kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Kulanda kwa heni kukufichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">undohole kota vyoulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Ndolutilila kulonga lutogo lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">kwa vila kwangundangusa mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>Ndokwimba kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">kwa vila mizilo ja hegwe jeng'ha ndo ja hachi.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>Unhanze kwa mong'ho wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">kwa vila nanyamula kuwinza malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangubeteza lukami undohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">malajizo ga hegwe ndo kusangalala kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Unhambichize kikala leka ndikutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">na malajizo ga hegwe ganhanze.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>Ndangulubaluba kota ing'holo lyajilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">uye umhale heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">kwa vila sisemwile mizilo ja hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Kuli magazo ga heni nandimchema Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">naye nakanyhidichila.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undohole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">kulawa kwa wanhu wadesi na wahadi.<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Hemwe wanhu wahadi, mopegwa choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">Mozapigwa ndaze?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>Kowagaza kwa misale jing'ang'ale ja mwamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">na kwa makala ga chiluli ching'ang'ale.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Ndochona kwa vila ndangikala kota mjenzi aku Mesheki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">ama kuli mihema ja Kedali.<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Nandikala kwa mihela minji ng'hatu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">hali wanhu walinguzudila kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Heni nda munhu wa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">ila hondilonga ahyo, hewo wangugana ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangutwamila</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Ndangulola kuchanya kuli vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">utanzi wa heni wolawa kohi?<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>Utanzi wa heni wangulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">yalumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>Hokuleka ugwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">mwamizi wa hegwe hambe yasinzile.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Ena, mwamizi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">hambe yasinzile ne kuwasa.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mwamizi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">ka ubanzi wa hegwe wa kudilo kota lubehelo kukwamila.<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>Nemisi isanya haliweza kukulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">ne nyelezi mhela wa nechilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kokwamila na lihile lyoneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">kowamila goya ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kokwamila kuli mbuli za hegwe za chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">kulawa sambi mbaka mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo ako Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya. Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>Nasangalala vyowandonjele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“Tulute kaye kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Lelo twa hano natwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:2">mgati mwa lwizi lwa hegwe, gwa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Yelusalemu, muji uzenjigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">leka wanhu weting'hane amo.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Amo ndo nhanzi zilinguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">ena, nhanzi za Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">kulonga malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kota vyoyalajize.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Amo namuwichigwa chitala cha utaguso wa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">chitala cha lukolo lwa chiundewa lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>Muulandile kikala goya muji wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">“Weng'ha walinguugana, mbuli za hewo zilutilile goya.<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Mgati mwa ng'hanzi za hegwe kuwe na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">na ngome ya hegwe iwe goya.”<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heni na wang'holozangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">ndangulonga, “Gwa Yelusalemu, ndangukuganila kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">ndangukulandila ganojile.”<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda isungu</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Ndangwinula meho ga heni kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">ndangukulola hegwe ulingulongoza ako kuchanya kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>Kota vitumagwa vyowalingumlola mkulu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">kota mpogozi vyoyalingitumbila kwa mkulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">ndo natwe vyotulingitumbila kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">mbaka aho houtonela isungu.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Utonele isungu, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, utonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">kwa vila natubezigwa lukami.<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Natiguta kwa mhela winji kubezigwa kwa wawele na lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">walingidaya wangutona kota natubezigwa.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi ka ubanzi wa hetwe</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya. Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>“Wone Mkulu Nguluwi yahawele haduhu ubanzi wa hetwe.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Mlonje mweng'ha muwele kuli Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>“Wone Mkulu Nguluwi yahawele haduhu ubanzi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">mhela wula lotutowigwe na wang'honyo,<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>ndangukomya twahawele tumeligwe tung'hali wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">mhela ng'halazi ya hewo loitufichile.<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>Twahaholigwe na mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">twahatowigwe kota mazi ga lwanda,<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>mazi galinguluta himahima gahatuholile.”<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">yawele hatulechile kuli ndole za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Natusulupuka kota chideje kuli idiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">idiwa nalibenigwa, natwe natuloholigwa.<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Utanzi wa hetwe wangulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">yalumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwazunguluta wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Walingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wa kota chidunda cha Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">chiwele hambe chitigasiche ila changupona chiwele nzinzili mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Kota Yelusalemu vyoilinguzungulutwa na vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">ndo Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyalinguwazunguluta wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">kulawa sambi na mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Wehile hawolutilila kuilongoza isi ya watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">leka watanganiche waleche kudita gehile kota wala.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwe unojile kwa wanhu wanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">kwa wala wagoloche nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Ila walingugalamka na kuwinza nzila za hewo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Mkulu Nguluwi uwose hamwe na walingudita gehile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Kikala goya kuwe na Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi utuwiche goya kahi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi loyatuwichile goya na kutuhilula Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">natwali kota wanhu walingulota.<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Ahyo natwaluka kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">natutowa luchenze kwa usangalalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Wanhu wa isi zinji nawalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“Mkulu Nguluwi nakawaditila mbuli ng'hulu.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Ena, Mkulu Nguluwi nakatuditila mbuli ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">natusangalala lukami.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, utuwiche goya kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">kota nhonya vyoilingigala mazi kugunuche.<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Walingunyala kwa mahozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">wobeta kwa usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Walinguluta kunyala nyhadikwa kuno wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">wohiluka kwa usangalalo wawele na mbena.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s">Ne kuwa na Nguluwi, mijito ja hetwe hajiwele chinhu</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya. Lwimbo lwa Solomoni.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi wone hazenjile ng'handa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">walinguzenga wangitunya hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Wone Mkulu Nguluwi howamila muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">walingwamila wanguwa meho kwa kitunya hela.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Mwangitunya hela kulilimka lufuku ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">na kukawila kuluta kwesela matinazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">mipalile chilyo kwa chituguti cha hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Nguluwi kanguwapaga chilyo wala yalinguwagana, hanga howowasa.<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Wana ndo utambichizo kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">wana ndo ndolendole kulawa kwa heye.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Wana wapondigwe kuno wahaza wa hewo wang'hali wawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">woweza kuwatanza wahaza wa hewo howowa walalile.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Ahyo, nakatambichizwa munhu yawele na wana wenji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">Holemwela hoyowa habehi na mng'honyo hali chitala.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s">Chonolo kwa munhu yalingumdumba Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Nawatambichizwa weng'ha walingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">walingikala kwa kuwinza nzila za heye.<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>Kowa na mafuza ga chituguti cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">kosangalala na mbuli za hegwe zolutilila goya.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>Mchewako kowa kota mzabibu wa mafuza menji kaye kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">wana wa hegwe kota mizuchila ja mizeituni kuzunguluta chisaga cha hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Ena, ndo vyoyotambichizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">munhu yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yakutambichize kulawa Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">Uzone mbuli za Yelusalemu zilutilila goya mazuwa gose ga ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Wikale mbaka uwone wazukulu wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Kikala goya kuwe na Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kulinguwala wang'honyo wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>“Nawangaza ng'hatu kulawa kuli usongolo wa heni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Chila munhu kuli Isilaeli yalonje,<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>“Nawangaza ng'hatu kulawa kuli usongolo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">ila hawawezile kusumya heni.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Nawanhowa ng'hatu kumgongo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">kumgongo kwangu nakuwa kota misitali ja kumgunda.<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo katanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">nakandohola kulawa kuli ng'weso za wanhu wehile.”<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Wabasigwe soni na kuhiluswa kumbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">wala weng'ha walinguuzudila muji wa Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Wawe kota misolo jilihela mizabi milefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">jiwele janguswinhaga lojiwa jing'hali kukula,<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>kuduhu munhu yalingukola mijito ja kujikungajiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">ne kuhola kota nyinza.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Haduhuli yalingukola habehi hoyolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“Mkulu Nguluwi yawatambichize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Twanguwatambichiza kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Kulawa kuli magazo ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">ndangukulilila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Gwa Mkulu, uhuliche lizi lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">uwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe uhulichize kulanda kwa heni kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wone wahakumbuchile wihe wa hetwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">gwa Mkulu, whaani yahawezile kusulupuka kulawa kuli kugazigwa?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Ila kwa hegwe twanguwa na kulechelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">leka hetwe tukudumbe.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>Ndangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">ndina makundo ng'hatu na ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>Ndangitumbila kwa Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kusinda wamizi walingubeteza kubwemwenzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kusinda wamizi walingubeteza mitondo.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Gwa Isilaeli, witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwa vila kwa heye Mkulu Nguluwi kuna igano lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwa heye kuna mong'ho ng'hatu wa kutugombola.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>Heye kowagombola wanhu wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">kulawa kuli gehile ga hewo geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s">Kitumbila kwa Nguluwi kwa kusindamala</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya. Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndahela nhumbula ya kidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">siwele munhu wa kidaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">Hambe ndite mbuli ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">ama gawele ga vinduzanduza ng'hatu kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Ila nhumbula ya heni naisindamala na kuwa na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">kota chali vyochisindamale na mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">ndo nhumbula ya heni vyoisindamale.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Gwa Isilaeli, witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">kulawa sambi mbaka mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mkumbuchile Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">ukumbuchile magazo geng'ha goyapatile.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ukumbuchile kulagana koyakupele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">chilaho choyakulahile, gwa Nguluwi wa Yakobo, Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>“Sikwinjila mgati mwa ng'handa ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">ne kuwasa kuli chinhanda cha heni,<verse eid="PSA 132:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>sikunda kuwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:4">ne kusinzila,<verse eid="PSA 132:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>mbaka ndikupe hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">haluga ha hegwe, gwa Nguluwi wa Yakobo, Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Ako Efulata natuhulika mbuli za isanduku lya ilagano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">natulifika kuli migunda ja Yealimu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>“Goya. Tuche kaye kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">tufugame kumwando mwa chigoda cha heye cha undewa.”<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Ndangukulanda winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">ulute hali honhu ha hegwe ha kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">hegwe, hamwe na isanduku lya ilagano lya mong'ho wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Watambika wa hegwe wagubikwe na kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">na welile wa hegwe watowe iyowe lya usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>Kwa chiwalo cha Daudi, chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">uleche kumlema yabakalizwe mafuta wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlahila Daudi chilaho cha kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">chilaho chiwele hambe yachigalule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“Ndomuwika yumwe wa walelwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">yakalise kuli chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa.<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Wone wana wa hegwe webatilile ilagano lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">na kibatilila malanguso gondiwapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">wana wa hewo kahi wowa wandewa kota hegwe mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Kukomya, Mkulu Nguluwi nakauhagula muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">nakagana hawe haluga ha heye.<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>“Aha ndo hondichikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">ndo haluga ha heni kwa vila nandihagana.<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Ndoutambichiza ng'hatu muji wa Siyoni kwa vinhu vyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">ndowagutiza chilyo wazunwa wake.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Ndowavaliza ulohozi watambika wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">na walingukundigwa wake wotowa luchenze lwa usangalalo.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>Kulawa aha, hemwe mowa na mndewa yazidahe wa lukolo lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">Kota chenje chilingwimilila ndomwimiza mndewa yondimbakalize mafuta.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>Wang'honyo wake ndowavaliza soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">ila heye ndomvaliza kofia ya chiundewa.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s">Uhamwe hali wanhu</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya. Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Ndo mbuli inojile na ya kunojeza ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">wenyelukolo kikala hamwe kwa uhamwe.<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Ndo kota mafuta ganojile kumutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">mbaka kuli lulevu lwa heye Aluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">mbaka mlupembo lwa ivalo lya heye msingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">kota ulajilo kota Nguluwi nakamhagula leka yawe mtambika.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Kota nungwi vyoilingulawila kuli chidunda cha Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">utambichizo wa Nguluwi wokuya mchanya mwa chidunda cha Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">Ako Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga nakalagana kuwatambichiza wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">kuwegalila ukomu ulihela kuduma.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa kuluta kuchanya.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Muye mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi hemwe vitumagwa wa heye weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">hemwe mweng'ha mlingukola mijito nechilo haluga hake.<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Mwinule moko kulutila honhu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">na kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Mkulu Nguluwi yawatambichize kulawa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">heye yalumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Mlitogole itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">mumtogole hemwe vitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Mumtogole hemwe mlingikala kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">kuli lugagala lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vila ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">mlitogole kwa nzimbo itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">kwa vila alyo lyangunojeza.<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamhagula Yakobo yawe wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli muwe wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Ndikomya, ndivizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">Mkulu wa hetwe ndo mkulu mchanya mwa milungu jeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguditaga choneche choyalingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">kuli kilanga na muisi na mbahali na mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Ndo yalingigala ng'hungugu kulawa kuli mbaka ja isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">yalingudita mazi tendema kwa lumwemwesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">na kuputa mbeho ng'hulu kulawa kuli ng'hano za heye.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>Ndo yawakopole walelwa wa mwaluko ako Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">walelwa wa wanhu na migongolo kahi.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>Ndo yaditile ulajilo na kububuwaza kwa hegwe, gwa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">kwa kuwagaza Falao na vitumagwa wa heye weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>Ndo yawadumye wanhu wa isi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">nakawakopola wandewa wawele na mong'ho,<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>wawele ndo Sihoni mndewa wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">Ogu mndewa wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na wandewa weng'ha wa Kanaani.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>Nakahola isi za hewo na kuwapa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">ena, leka ziwe uhalizi kwa wanhu wa heye Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Itagwa lya hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, lyangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">lyokumbuchilwa kuli lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kowalewela wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">na kuwonela isungu vitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Jimalukolo ja wanhu wa isi ndo sendi na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">najigongomanyigwa kwa moko ga wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Jina milomo, ila hajilingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">jina meho, ila hajilingona.<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>Jina makutu, ila hajilinguhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">na jahela ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Weng'ha walingujigongomanya wochiwhana najo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">hihyo du na weng'ha walingujitumbila.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli, mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">Hemwe watambika wa ivyazi lya Aluni, mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Hemwe Walawi, mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">Hemwe mlingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi, mumtogole.<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi kuli Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">yatogoligwe yalingikala Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s">Igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vila ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Nguluwi wa milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu wa wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>Ndo yaliyeka yalingudita makulu ga kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>Ndo yaulumbile ulanga kwa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>Ndo yaigongomanyile isi mchanya mwa mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>Ndo yalumbile isanya na nyelezi na nhondwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>Isanya lilongoze nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>Nyelezi na nhondwe vilongoze nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>Ndo yawakopole walelwa wa mwaluko wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>Nakawosa wanhu wa Isilaeli kulawa ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>Kwa moko wa heye uwele na mong'ho na ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>Ndo yaigawanule Bahali ya Shamu honhu heli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose,<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>nakawadita wanhu wa Isilaeli wakole amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>Ila nakawazibiza Falao na chilundo cha heye cha wamizi kuli Bahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>Ndo yawalongoze wanhu wa heye kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>Ndo yawatowile wandewa wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>Nakawakopola wandewa wawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>Nakamkopola Sihoni, mndewa wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose,<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>na Ogu, mndewa wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>Nakazihola isi za hewo, nakawapa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose,<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>leka ziwe uhalizi kwa Isilaeli, chitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>Ndo yatukumbuchile mhela wa ung'hochele wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose,<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>nakatulohola kulawa kwa wang'honyo wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>Ndo yalingigala chilyo kwa chila chilumbigwe chiwele na ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Mlonje malumbo kwa Nguluwi wa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s">Kulombocheza kwa Waisilaeli kuli ujenzi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Hafungo ha nzanda za Babuloni, natikalisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">natwali tulila vyotukumbuchile Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Kuli migodi ja isi yila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">natupatika migombogombo ja hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Watuholile tuwe wapogozi wa ngondo nawagana tuwembile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">walingutugaza nawatugana tuwasangalaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">“Mtwimbile lwimbo lumwe hali nzimbo za Siyoni.”<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Toweza ndaze kwimba lwimbo lwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">kuli isi ya chijenzi?<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Gwa Yelusalemu, wone ndikusemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">moko wa heni wa kudilo usemwe uwanzi wa kutowa igombogombo.<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Umyango wa heni unanahile na kulemwela kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">wone sikukumbuchile hegwe, gwa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">ena, wone ndogana choneche kusinda kusangalala kwa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kusemwa gowaditile Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">zuwa lila Yelusalemu vyoiholigwe kuli upogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">ukumbuchile gowalonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">“Mbomole muji wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">Mng'humbule misisi jake.”<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>Gwa Babuloni, kodumigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">Kotambichizwa yula yawele yokuhilusila chibida kwa gehile goutuditile,<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>yula yowahola wana wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">na kuwahondanga kuli mitalawe.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa kulonga malumbo</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Ndangulonga malumbo, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">ndangwimba lutogo lwa hegwe hali milungu.<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>Ndanginamiza kulola kuli ng'handa ya hegwe yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">ndangulitogola itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwa chiwalo cha igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe na kukundigwa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwa vila nakuwika itagwa lya hegwe na ulonzi wa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">mchanya mwa chila chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Londikulilile, hegwe nakunyidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">nakunyonjezela mong'ho wa nhumbula.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wandewa weng'ha muisi wokutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">kwa vila nawahulika ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Wokwimba lutogo lwa ndaze vyoulingudita, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">kwa vila hegwe ndo mkulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Hanga hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa mchanya mwa weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">kwanguwalola kwa kunoga wawele ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">ila walingidaya kwanguwonaga kulawa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Hala hondifichigwa na magazo, hegwe kwangunyamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">kwangugolola moko wa hegwe kwa chiwalo cha ng'halazi ya wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">kwa mong'ho wa hegwe ukulu, kwangundohola.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kokweneza geng'ha goulagane na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, lyangikala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Uleche kujileka kutali mijito ja moko wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangugazela geng'ha na kangulongoza geng'ha</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe nakumhugajiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">hegwe kwangunzela heni mbaka mgati.<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>Kwanguvizela kikalisa na kwima kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">kwanguvizela chila chinhu chondilingijesa kulawa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>Kwanguvizela hondijenda ama hondikwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">kwanguhazela chila honhu hondilinguluta.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Nding'hali kulonga ulonzi woneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakuuzela ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>Kwa baho kuli chila ubanzi wa heni, kumwando na kumbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">kwangumbichila moko wa hegwe kunyamila.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Uwanzi wa hegwe ndo mzidi wa nyhala za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">ndo ukulu ng'hatu, siweza kuuzela.<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>Mbilimile kohi kuwele muhe wa hegwe wa haduhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">Ndute kohi kuwele hegwe kwa haduhu?<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Wone ng'hwine kilanga, hegwe kwa baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">wone mbase hanyi kuli isi ya wabagame, hegwe kwa baho.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Wone nguluche mbaka kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">ama mbaka kuli kolizinjilaga isanya,<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>mbaka ako kahi kwa kuko kundongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">moko wa hegwe wa kudilo wondibata.<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Wone ndahalandile jiza lingumbiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">jiza linzungulute honhu ha lumuli,<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>kwa hegwe, jiza haliwele jiza ne hado,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">na nechilo kwangupulika kota nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kwa hegwe jiza na lumuli ndo chinhu chimwe.<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>Hegwe nakundita heni, nhumbula na muhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">nakungongomanya mmunda mwa mayangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Ndangukutogola kwa vila nditigwa kwa kububuwaza na vinduzanduza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">madito ga hegwe ndo ga kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">nhumbula ya heni yangugazela ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>Lukuli lwa heni haluvisigwe kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">vyounditile kwa uviso, honhu hawele munhu hawezile kumbona.<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>Hegwe nakumbona lombele nding'hali kupondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">nakwandika chila chinhu mchitabu cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">mazuwa ga heni geng'ha nakugawika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">mbaka kung'hali kuwa baho zuwa lila lya mwaluko.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Gwa Nguluwi, majesa ga hegwe ndo makulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">hambe gaweze kuwalizwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Wone ndahagawazile gahawele menji kupuluta sangalaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">Hondililimka, nding'hali nda hamwe na hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Gwa Nguluwi, uwakopole wanhu wehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">Walingukopola woche kwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Wangulonga vibi kwa chiwalo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">wangulonga gehile kwa hegwe galinguwala itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndanguwazudila walingukuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">ndanguwabeza ng'hatu wala walingukubelenhuka.<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Wang'honyo wa hegwe ndo wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">ndanguwazudila ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Umhugajize, gwa Nguluwi, uizele nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">unjeze, uluzele lunhwinhwi lwa heni.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>Ugalole, wone gala gondilingudita ndo geha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">undongoze kuli nzila ya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwamilwa na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa yalingwaluchiza kwimba. Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undohole kulawa kwa wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:1">unyamile na wanhu walingugana kundumiza.<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Wanhu awo wangiwika goya mnhumbula za hewo kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">wangwambuza kilewa chila mhela.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>Myango zawo ziha kota za izoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">kuli milomo jawo muna ulonzi uwele na dunga kota ya izoka.<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unyamile na ndole za wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">unyamile na wanhu walingugana kundumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">wawele wewichile goya kungwisa.<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Walingidaya nawambichila midiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">nawalambalika ng'weso kota utandawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">nawavisa midiwa mnzila leka wandibate.<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Ndangumlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi, “Hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uhulichize lizi lya kulanda kwa heni kwa isungu.<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Mkulu wa heni, mlohozi wa heni yawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">nakunyamila goya mhela wa ngondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kuwapa wehile gowalingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">na kiwika goya kwa hewo kwihile kuleche kulutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">ama wokwinula vitwi vya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Wihe wa ulonzi wa hewo uwafiche hewo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Makala ga chiluli gawagwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">watozwe kuli chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">wenjizwe kuli ikulubila, waleche kwinuka kahi.<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Mbuli za walinguwaheha wanji zileche kulutilila goya kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">wihe uwawinge na kuwadumya wala walingugana kundumiza.<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Ndivizela Mkulu Nguluwi kangulewelaga mbuli za wanhu walingubunzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">na kuwapa hachi wazunwa.<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Ndikomya, watanganiche wolitogola itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">wagoloche nhumbula wochikala hali hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa kugana kwamilwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Ndangukuchema, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">uye himahima kunhanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Uhulichize lizi lya heni mhela hondikuchema.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>Kulanda kwa heni ukubochele kota ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">hondikwinula moko ga heni kwa hegwe ung'hunde kota nhambiko ya matinazo.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwamile mlomo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">uwiche wamizi kuli lwizi lwa mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>Undemeze ndeche kuluta kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">ndeche kihanza na madito gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">ndeche kilumba na wanhu walingudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">ne kuwa hamwe kuli mnvina za hewo.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Munhu yawele na hachi yanhowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">ndo mbuli ya isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">na yang'hanuchile, ndo mafuta kumutwi kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Mutwi wa heni hauweza kuilema mbuli ayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Ila kulanda kwa heni mazuwa gose, ndo kwa chiwalo cha hewo kuleka wihe.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Wakulu wa hewo howohondigwa kuli mitalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">ndo wovizela kota ulonzi wa heni nawali goya.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Mizeje jawo josambalulwa kuli mlomo wa chilaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">kota munhu vyoyalingulima na kukatula misanga.<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Ila heni ndangitumbila kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">ndangubilimila kwa hegwe leka unyamile, uleche kundeka kwihile.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Unyamile na midiwa jowambichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">kugwilizwa na wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Wehile wagwilizwe kuli midiwa jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">mhela hondikola kwa kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa munhu yalechigwe mchiwa</para>
  <para style="d">(Ilanguso lya Daudi loyawele kuli mhalika. Kulanda.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Ndangumlilila Mkulu Nguluwi kwa lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:1">ndangumdedeza Mkulu Nguluwi kwa lizi, leka yambonele isungu.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Ndangumuwichila kung'ung'uta kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">ndangumlonjela magazo ga heni.<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>Hondiwa habehi kugozola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">hegwe kwa baho, kwangunzela vyombele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">Wang'honyo wa heni nawambichila midiwa kuli nzila ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Hondilola ubanzi wa kudilo na kubeteza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">ndangona haduhu munhu wa kunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">ndahela kahi honhu ha kubilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">haduhu munhu yalingijesa kwa chiwalo cha heni.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangukulilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">Hegwe ndo honhu ha heni ha kubilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">hegwe ndo chila chinhu kwa heni kuli isi ya wawele wakomu.<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Uhulichize chililo cha heni, kwa vila nhoka lukami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">Undohole kulawa kwa walingungaza, kwa vila wana mong'ho kusinda heni.<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>Undavye amu mchinweng'ho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">leka ndonje malumbo kwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Wanhu watanganiche wochilumba na heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">kwa vila nakunditila ganojile menji.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s">Kulanda utanzi</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Uhulichize kulanda kwa heni, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">Uwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe kwa chiwalo cha kulanda kwa heni kwa isungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">Kwa chiwalo cha kukundigwa na kutanganika kwa hegwe, unyidichile.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>Uleche kunhagusa kwa kung'ang'ala, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">kwa vila haduhu yoneche yawele mkomu, yawele yatanganiche hali hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Wang'honyo wa heni nawambinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">nawangwisa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">nawambika kuli jiza kota munhu yabagame katali.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Ngozola ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">nhumbula ya heni naizilika kwa chiwalo cha kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>Ndangugakumbuchila mazuwa ga katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">ndangijesa kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja hegwe jeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">ndangulola mijito jikoligwe kwa moko ga hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Ndangugolola moko ga heni kulanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">nhumbula ya heni ina ng'halu na hegwe kota isi ng'havu.<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, unyidichile himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">kwa vila nangozola ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Uleche kivisa kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">leka ndeche kuwa kota wala walingudulika kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Mitondo undajile igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwa vila nandikuwichila kitumbila kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">Undanguse vyoilinguganigwa kudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwa vila ndangukugalila nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, undohole kulawa kwa wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">kwa vila kwa hegwe ndangubilimila kikala goya.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>Undanguse kweneza vyoulingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">kwa vila hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">Muhe wa hegwe unojile undongoze kuli nzila inojile.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya hegwe, Mkulu Nguluwi, uwamile ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">umbuse kuli magazo kwa chiwalo cha kutanganika kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>Kwa chiwalo cha igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe, uwakopole wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">uwadumye weng'ha walingumbunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">kwa vila heni nda chitumagwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s">Malumbo kwa kusumya</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi, italawe lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">yalingugadita moko ga heni gazowele kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">na kuvilangusa vidole vya heni kitowa.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>Heye ndo igano lya kwimilila lya heni na ngome ya heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">yalingunyamila na mlohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">heye ndo ngawo ya heni na honhu ha heni ha kubilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">kanguwasumyaga wanhu wa isi zinji na kuwawika hasi ha heni.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, munhu ndo choni mbaka umlolele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Munhu ndo choni mbaka umjese?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>Munhu ndo kota lweselo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">mazuwa ga heye ndo kota isisila lilingukola.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Uchumule ulanga wa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uduliche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">Uvidolize vidunda navyo vilavye iyosi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Wambuze lumwemwesa, luwasambalule wang'honyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">utowe misale ja hegwe, leka wabilime.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Ugolole moko wa hegwe kulawa kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">undohole na kumbusa kuli mazi aga menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">umbuse kuli moko ga wajenzi,<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>wawele wangulongaga ulonzi wa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">wangugololaga moko kwa ulolezi wa udesi.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ndokwimbila lwimbo lunyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">ndokutowela ching'weleng'wele cha ng'weso kumi,<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>hegwe ulinguwapa wandewa kusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">ulingumlohola Daudi chitumagwa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Undohole na ipanga lya mng'honyo yamemile wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">umbuse kuli moko ga wajenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">wawele wangulongaga ulonzi wa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">wangugololaga moko kwa ulolezi wa udesi.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Wasongolo wa hetwe wakule goya kota mizuchila kuli kagunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">wahinza wa hetwe wawe kota mizengo jihongoligwe kwa kuinoliga ng'handa ya mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Ng'hano za hetwe zimeme mbena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">Ming'holo ja hetwe kuli migunda jilele maelufu kwa maelufu.<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>Migongolo ja hetwe jiwe jinenehe na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">jileche kwajiliza nyinda ne kulela mhela haunafika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">ne chililo cha magazo kuli vijiji vya hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Kukomya, nawatambichizwa wanhu wa isi wawele watambichizwe mbuli azo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">Nawatambichizwa wanhu wa isi wawele Nguluwi wa hewo ndo Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwimbo lwa lutogo lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Ndokutogola, gwa Nguluwi wa heni na mndewa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">ndolipa ukulu itagwa lya hegwe mazuwa gose na mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Ndokutogola chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">ndolitogola itagwa lya hegwe mazuwa gose na mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mkulu, kanguganigwa kupegwa lutogo lwinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">ukulu wa heye hauweza kupugajizika.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Lulelo mbaka lulelo, lutogo lwa madito ga hegwe lwosimilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">awo wowikula madito ga hegwe makulu.<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>Wolonga ukulu wa ludali lwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">Ndogajesa madito ga hegwe ga kububuwaza.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Wowikula ukulu wa mong'ho wa madito ga hegwe ga kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">nani ndowikula ukulu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>Wowikula lutogo lwa kunoga kwa hegwe kwinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">na kwimba kwa chiwalo cha kutanganika kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kana isungu na uliholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">halinguzudilaga himahima, nakamema igano lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka yanojile kwa weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">ndo yawele na isungu kwa vilumbigwe vya heye vyeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Vilumbigwe vya hegwe vyeng'ha vyolonga malumbo kwa hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">nawo wa kukundigwa wa hegwe wokutogola.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Wolonga ukulu wa undewa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">na kuwikula mong'ho wa hegwe ukulu,<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>leka chila munhu yagazele madito ga hegwe makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">na ukulu wa undewa wa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Undewa wa hegwe ndo undewa wa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">ludali lwa hegwe lukale lulelo lweng'ha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:13"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Mkulu Nguluwi ka wa kukundigwa kuli kulagana kwa heye kweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">ka yanojile kuli madito ga heye geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwatanzaga weng'ha walingugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">kanguwenulaga weng'ha walingugazika.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vyangukulola kwa kitumbila ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">nagwe kwanguvipa chilyo kwa mhela uwichigwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Kwangugubula moko wa hegwe kwa isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">kwanguvyenezela chila chovilingugana chila chilumbigwe chiwele na ukomu.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yatanganiche kuli nzila za heye zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">ndo yanojile kuli madito ga heye geng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka habehi na weng'ha walingumlanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">weng'ha walingumlanda kwa nhumbula igoloche.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Kanguwagalilaga chowalingugana weng'ha walingumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">kanguhulichizaga chililo cha hewo na kuwalohola.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwamilaga weng'ha walingumgana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">ila kowadumya wehile weng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Ndowikula lutogo lwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vilitogole itagwa lya heye lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">mazuwa gose na mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s">Lutogo kwa Nguluwi mlohozi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">Umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, gwa nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Ndomtogola Mkulu Nguluwi kuli ukomu wa heni weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">ndomwimbila Nguluwi wa heni mhela weng'ha hondichikala.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Mleche kitumbila kuli wakulu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">hewo ndo wanhu hela, hawoweza kulohola.<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>Munhu hoyolavya lweselo lwa heye lwa kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">kanguhiluka kuli nhimbwisi nakoyalawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">na aho mijito ja heye jeng'ha joyajiwichile goya jangwajililaga.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Nakatambichizwa munhu yalingutanzigwa na Nguluwi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">munhu yawichile kitumbila kwa heye kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heye,<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>yavilumbile ulanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">bahali na vyeng'ha viwele mumo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">Heye kangibatililaga kulagana kwa heye mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>Heye kanguwapaga walingubunzwa hachi zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwapaga chilyo wawele na nzala.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:7"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwapaga wanweng'hwa kilejeha.<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwagubulaga meho wohambe walole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwenulaga walinguduliswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwaganaga wanhu watanganiche.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwamilaga wajenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">kanguwatanzaga wadala wafililwe na walume wawo na walekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">ila kangwajilizaga nzila ya wehile.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongoza mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Nguluwi wa hegwe, gwa Siyoni, ka mndewa wa lulelo lweng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s">Inoga kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Ndaze vyoiwele goya kumwimbila lutogo Nguluwi wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Heye ka yanojile na kanguganigwa kwimbilwa lutogo.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguuzenga kahi muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">kanguwahilula Waisilaeli wawele kuli ujenzi.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>Kanguwatanza watweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">na kuwopa vilonda vya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>Kangwamula hisabu ya nhondwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">na kuzigalila zeng'ha matagwa gake.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Mkulu wa hetwe ka mkulu, kana mong'ho ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">luhala lwa heye lwahela chipimilo.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwakwinizaga wala walingunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">ila kanguwatozaga wehile, wagwe kuli nhimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi nzimbo za kulonga malumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">mumtowele ching'weleng'wele Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>Kangugubikaga ulanga kwa ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">kanguigalilaga isi nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">na koteza misolo kuli vidunda.<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>Kangujigalilaga migongolo chilyo chawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">na mibofu ja mibondwa hojilila.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Hambe yagane mong'ho wa falasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">na hambe yanojezwe na uzidahe wa wamizi,<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangunojezwaga na walingumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">wanhu walingitumbila igano lya kwimilila lya heye.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Umtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, gwa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Umtogole Nguluwi wa hegwe, gwa Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Kwa vila kanguwikaga nzinzili lwizi lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">kanguwatambichizaga wanhu wawele mgati mwa hegwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>Kangwamilaga mbaka ja hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">kangukugutizaga kwa mhau inojile.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Kanguhilikaga mzilo wa heye muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">na ulonzi wa heye wangwenezwaga himahima.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>Kangwanzanza seluji kota igolole lya sufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">kangusambalulaga nungwi kota mivu.<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>Kangigalaga nhonya ya maganga kota maganga madodo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">Whaani yoweza kwimilila kung'ang'ala kwa chipute cha heye?<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Hamba kangulavyaga ulonzi, leka seluji ayo isungulumuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">kangigalaga mbeho ya heye, nayo yanguchililikaga.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>Kanguwikulaga usenga wa heye kwa walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">mizilo ja heye na nhaguso zake kwa Isilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>Ila haditile ahyo kwa wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">wanhu wanji hawagazelele malajizo ga heye.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s">Vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vimtogole Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">mumtogole kulawa ako kuchanya ng'hatu.<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Mumtogole, hemwe wahilisi wa heye weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">mumtogole, hemwe wamizi wa heye weng'ha wa kilanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Mumtogole hemwe isanya na nyelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">mumtogole hemwe nhondwe zeng'ha zilingupulika.<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Mumtogole hemwe ulanga wa kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">na mazi gawele kuchanya mwa ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Vyeng'ha vilitogole itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">kwa vila heye nakalajiza na vyeng'ha navilumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>Nakaviwika honhu hawo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">kwa mzilo uwele hauweza kugaluswa.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi kulawa muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">hemwe mizoka ja mbahali na mgati ng'hatu mwa bahali, mumtogole.<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>Mumtogole hemwe lumwemwesa na nhonya ya maganga na seluji na ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">mbeho ya nhigu ilingweneza mzilo wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>Mumtogole hemwe vidunda vikulu na vidunda vidodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">migodi ja mafuza na vihulo.<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>Mumtogole hemwe migongolo ja kisolo na ja kufujigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vilingutambala na videje vyeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>Mumtogole hemwe wandewa na wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">wang'hangala na vilongozi weng'ha muisi.<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>Mumtogole hemwe wasongolo na wahinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">wasekulu weng'ha na wana kahi.<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Mweng'ha mlitogole itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">kwa vila itagwa lya heye yaliyeka lyangwinuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">ukulu wa heye wa kuchanya ng'hatu mwa isi na ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>Nakawagalila mong'ho wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">kuhulichizwa kwa wanhu weng'ha walingukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">wanhu wa Isilaeli yawaganile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kusumya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi lwimbo lunyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">mumtogole kuli nhing'hano ya walingukundigwa.<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Usangalale, gwa Isilaeli, kwa chiwalo cha yakulumbile hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">wenyeng'haye wa Siyoni, mtowe luchenze kwa chiwalo cha mndewa wa hemwe.<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Mlitogole itagwa lya heye kwa ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">mmwimbile na kutowa ngoma na igombogombo.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kangunojezwaga na wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">nakawanoliga ulohozi walingunyenyetela.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Wanhu walingukundigwa wangusangalala kwa kusumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">wasangalale mbaka howalinguwasa.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>Wawe na lutogo lukulu lwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">na mipanga jiwele na kunoleche kwili mmoko mwa hewo,<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>wawahilulile chibida wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">wawagaze wanhu wa isi zinji,<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>wawawohe wandewa wa hewo kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">na vilongozi wa hewo kwa pingu za chuma,<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>leka weneze magazo gogalajizwe na Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Alo ndo lutogo lwa walingukundigwa wa Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Mumtogole Nguluwi kuli ng'handa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">muutogole mong'ho wa heye kuli ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>Mumtogole kwa chiwalo cha madito ga heye makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">mumtogole kwa chiwalo cha winji wa ukulu wa heye.<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>Mumtogole kwa lizi lya mhalamhanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">mumtogole kwa igombogombo na ching'weleng'wele.<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>Mumtogole kwa kutowa ngoma na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">mumtogole kwa mluli na ching'weleng'wele.<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>Mumtogole kwa kutowa matoazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">Mumtogole kwa matoazi ga lizi likulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Chila chilumbigwe chiwele chikomu chimtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
